<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JOB" style="id">- Dawuro Full Bible Latin Version</book>
  <para style="h">Iyyooba</para>
  <para style="toc1">Iyyooba Mas'aafaa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Iyyooba</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yob.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Iyyooba Mas'aafaa</para>
  <para style="imt">Geluwaa</para>
  <para style="ip">Iyyooba mas'aafan nuuni be'iyaa taarikii, daro tuggaynne bashshay gakkeedda itti keeka bitaniyaabaa odiyaa taarikiyaa. Ha bitanii bare naanatuwaa ubbaappenne bare duretetsaa ubbaappe mela atteeda asaa. Hewaa bollakka k'ay iita maytsaan shoc'etiide saketteedda. Hewaappe guyyiyaan timirttiyaa s'aafuwaan k'onc'c'isseedda heezzu haasayatuwaan Iyyoobinne Iyyooba laggetuu ha sakuwaan barenttoo sisetteeddawaa haasayeeddino. Wurssetsan k'ay S'oossay Iyyoobaw k'onc'c'eedda.</para>
  <para style="ip">Iyyooba laggetuu Iyyooba gakkeedda metuwaa bolla k'ofaa immiidde, benippe barenttu eriyaa ammanuwaa wogaan basetiide immiino. Hewaa diraw unttunttu, «S'oossay keeka asaw lo"obaa immee; shin iita asaa muree. Hewaa maaran Iyyooba ha metuu ubbay gakkeeddawe, I nagaraa ootseedda dirassa gidanaw koshshee» yaagiino. Shin Iyyoobi geeshshanne keeka asaa gideedda diraw, hawaa mala muruwaa bessiyaa asaa gidenna. Ubbaa k'ay erettenna k'an"ishe gideeddawe, Aa malatiyaa keeka asaa bolla hawaa mala muruwaa wod'd'eedda. Iyyooba ammanuu sa'aappe deshenan d'oyooppekka, likke pirddaa pirddiide, barena ha harggiyaa k'ashuwaappe billana malanne beni de'oo zaarana mala, minisiide woossiyaawaa aggibeenna.</para>
  <para style="ip">S'oossay Iyyoobi oochcheedda ooshaw ittoo ittoo zaaruwaa immibeennawaa gidooppenne, Aa ammanuwaa minotetsaa nashshiide, bare S'oossatetsaa wolk'k'aanne bare aad'd'eeda eraa malalissiyaa timirttiyaa haasayan k'onc'c'isseedda. Hewaappe guyyiyaan Iyyoobi S'oossay wolk'k'aama gidiyaawaanne aad'd'eeda eranchcha gidiyaawaa eriide, s'alaaninne hank'k'uwaan kumeedda k'aalatuwaa haasayeeddawoo kayyottiide, nagaraappe simmeedda.</para>
  <para style="ip">Wurssetsan timirttiyaa gidenna yeda s'aafuwaan s'aafetteedda sa'aan Iyyooba de'uu benisaa simmeeddawawaanne ak'uwaa baggana gidooppe, kasewaappe dakko daruwaa demmeeddawaa be'eettee. Iyyooba laggetuu Aa gakkeedda metuu hak'anna yeeddentto unttunttoo gelibeenna diraw, S'oossay unttuntta mino seeraa seereedda. Meeze ammanuwaa k'ofaappe S'oossay wolk'k'aama gidiyaawaa ereeddawe Iyyooba s'alala.</para>
  <para style="iot">Shemppatuwaa Ubbatoo Imetteedda K'antsa K'ofatuwaa</para>
  <para style="io1">Iyyoobe Paac'etussaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 1:1-2:13">1:1—2:13</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Iyyoobanne Aa Laggetsatuwaa palumiyaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 3:1-37:24">3:1—37:24</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Med'inaa Goday Iyyoobaw Immeedda Zaaruwaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 38:1-41:34">38:1—41:34</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Iyyoobe Anjjuwaa Zaari Demussaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 42:1-17">42:1-17</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JOB 1" />
  <para style="ms">Iyyoobe Paac'etussaa</para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="JOB 1:1-2:13">1:1—2:13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="s">Sees'aanay Iyyooba Paac'c'anaadan <optbreak />S'oossay Sheniyaa Immeedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 1:1" />Uus'a giyaa biittan Iyyooba giyaa itti bitanii de'ee; I tooshii bayinnanne suure asaa; S'oossaw yayyiide, iitabaappekka haakkeedda asaa. <verse eid="JOB 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 1:2" />Aw laappun attuma naanatuunne heezzu mac'c'a naanatuu yeletteeddino. <verse eid="JOB 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 1:3" />Mas'uwaa gidooppe, aw laappun sha"u dorssatuu, heezzu sha"u gaalotuu, ichcheshu s'eetu waatsa booratuu, ichcheshu s'eetu mac'c'a haretuunne loytsi daro k'oomatuu de'iino. Away doliyaa baggana de'iyaa asaa ubbaappe I aad'd'eeda dure asaa.<verse eid="JOB 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 1:4" />Aa attuma naanatuu barenttu son barenttu son, kaali kaali gibiraa giigissiide, barenttu heezzu michchetuwaa barenttuna maanawunne ushanaw s'eesiino. <verse eid="JOB 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 1:5" />Gibiraa gallassatuu poletteedda wode, Iyyoobi wontta guuraanna denddiide, bare naanatuwaa ittuwaa ittuwaa suntsan s'uuggiyaa yarshshuwaa yarshshee. I hewaa ootsiyaawe, «Ta naanatuu barenttu wozanaan S'oossaa shek'k'iide, nagaraa ootseeddinonttonne» giide hirggeedda dirassa. I unttuntta geeshshanaw hewaa ubbaa gede ootsee.<verse eid="JOB 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 1:6" />Itti gallassi S'oossaa kiitanchchatuu Med'inaa Godaa sintsan beettanaw yeeddino; Sees'aanaykka k'ay unttunttunna yeedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:2">Dom. 6:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JOB 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 1:7" />Med'inaa Goday Sees'aanaa, «Laa neeni hak'appe yaad?» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 1:7">Sees'aanay Med'inaa Godaw, «Taani sa'aan ubbaan yaanne haanne yuuyyiyaasaappenne simerettiyaasaappe yaad» yaagiide zaareedda.<verse eid="JOB 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 1:8" />Med'inaa Goday Sees'aanaa, «Yaatina, ta k'oomaa Iyyooba akeekaade be'aaddi? Sa'aa bollan Aa malatiyaa tooshii bayinnanne suure Asay mulekka baawa. I S'oossaw yayyiyaa, iitabaappekka haakkeedda asaa» yaageedda.<verse eid="JOB 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 1:9" />Sees'aanay, «Tumu Iyyoobi new c'oo yayyii?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9-11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 12:10">Sas'. 12:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JOB 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 1:10" />Aanne Aa soo asaanne aw de'iyaawaa ubbaa neeni diraade naagabeykkii? I ootsiyaa oosuwaa ubbaa neeni anjjeedda diraw, Aa mehiyaa wudii biittaa ubbaa bollan dareedda. <verse eid="JOB 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 1:11" />Shin neeni ne kushiyaa yeddaade, aw de'iyaa mas'uwaa ubbaa shoc'antto, I neena tumu ne sintsan shek'k'ana» yaageedda.<verse eid="JOB 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 1:12" />Med'inaa Goday Sees'aanaa, «Eeno, aw de'iyaabay ubbay ne kushiyaanna. Shin neeni Aa bochchoppa» yaageedda. Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Sees'aanay Med'inaa Godaa sintsaappe kesiide beedda.<verse eid="JOB 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 1:13" />Itti gallassi Iyyooba attuma naanatuunne mac'c'a naanatuu barenttu bayira ishaa son miiddenne woyniyaa eessaa ushiidde de'iino. <verse eid="JOB 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 1:14" />Yaatishin itti bitanii Iyyoobakko yiide, «Nuuni booratuwaa waas'iide goshishin, haretuukka nu matan maataa miidde de'ishiina, <verse eid="JOB 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 1:15" />Saaba biittaa asatuu akeekenan yiide, olaa kesseeddino; yaatiide ubbaakka akki beeddino. K'ay k'oomatuwaakka k'ara mashshaan busakkeeddino. Yaatina, ta s'alalay ataade, ha haneeddawaa new odanaw yaad» yaageedda.<verse eid="JOB 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 1:16" />I biro haasayishin, hara bitanii yiide, «S'oossaa tamay saluwaappe wod'd'iide, dorssatuwaanne dorssatuwaa heemmiyaawantta meedda. Yaatina, ta s'alalay ataade, ha haneeddawaa new odanaw yaad» yaageedda.<verse eid="JOB 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 1:17" />I biro haasayishin, hara bitanii yiide, «Kaladaawetuwaa biittaappe heezzu c'uguwaan shaakketteedda paannatuu yiide, nuuna oliide, gaaluwaa ubbaa akki beeddino; k'oomatuwaakka k'ara mashshaan busakkeeddino. Yaatina, ta s'alalay ataade, ha haneeddawaa new odanaw yaad» yaageedda.<verse eid="JOB 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 1:18" />I biro haasayishin, hara bitanii yiide, «Ne attuma naanatuunne mac'c'a naanatuu barenttu bayira ishaa son miiddenne woyniyaa eessaa ushiidde de'ishiina, <verse eid="JOB 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 1:19" />wolk'k'aama gotii akeekenan bazzuwaappe denddiide, golliyaa ubbaanna shoc'eedda. Gollii unttunttu bolla kunddina, naanatuu hayk'k'eeddino. Yaatina, ta s'alalay ataade, ha haneeddawaa new odanaw yaad» yaageedda.<verse eid="JOB 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 1:20" />Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Iyyoobi denddiide, kayyoo bare mayuwaa peed'iide; bare huup'iyaakka meedetteedda. Biittan guufanniide S'oossaw goyinniidde, <verse eid="JOB 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 1:21" />hawaadan yaageedda;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 1:21">«Taani ta aatti uluwaappe kallo yelettaad;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 1:21">hayk'k'iyaa wodekka taani akkaade biyaabay baawa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 1:21">Med'inaa Goday immeedda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 1:21">Med'inaa Goday zaariide akkeedda.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 1:21">Med'inaa Godaa suntsay galatetto» yaageedda.<verse eid="JOB 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 1:22" />Ha ubbankka Iyyoobi nagaraa ootsibeenna; S'oossaa amaassalibeenna.<verse eid="JOB 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JOB 2" />
  <para style="s">Iyyooba Laa"entso Paac'iyaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 2:1" />Hara gallassikka k'ay S'oossaa kiitanchchatuu Med'inaa Godaa sintsan beettanaw yeeddino; Sees'aanaykka k'ay unttunttunna ittippe Aa sintsan beettanaw yeedda. <verse eid="JOB 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 2:2" />Med'inaa Goday Sees'aanaa, «Laa neeni hak'appe yaad?» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 2:2">Sees'aanay Med'inaa Godaw, «Sa'aan ubbaan yaanne haanne yuuyyiyaasaappenne simerettiyaasaappe yaad» yaageedda.<verse eid="JOB 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 2:3" />Med'inaa Goday Aa, «Ta k'oomaa Iyyooba akeekaade be'aaddi? Sa'aa bollan Aa malatiyaa tooshii bayinnanne suure Asay mulekka baawa. I S'oossaw yayyiyaa, iitabaappekka haakkeedda asaa. Gaasuu bayinnan taani Aa d'ayissana mala, neeni taana dentsetsinakka, ha"i gakkanaw I bare suuretetsan min ek'k'eedda» yaageedda.<verse eid="JOB 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 2:4" />Sees'aanay zaariide S'oossaa, « ‹Galbbaa diraw galbbaa akko!› yaagiyaawaadan, Asay bare shemppuwaa diraw, barew de'iyaawaa ubbaa immana. <verse eid="JOB 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 2:5" />Shin neeni ne kushiyaa yeddaade, Aa ane shoc'a. Yaatintto I neena tumu ne sintsan shek'k'ana» yaageedda.<verse eid="JOB 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 2:6" />Med'inaa Goday Sees'aanaa, «Eeno, Aa wod'oppappe attina, Aa bolla neeni koyeeddawaa ootsanaw danddayaasa» yaageedda.<verse eid="JOB 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 2:7" />Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Sees'aanay Med'inaa Godaa sintsappe kesiide, Iyyooba gediyaappe huup'iyaa gakkanaw iita madutsay Aa bolla kesanaadan ootseedda. <verse eid="JOB 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 2:8" />Yaatina, Iyyoobi bidintsaa bolla uttiide, kon"aan barena gooddeedda.<verse eid="JOB 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 2:9" />Aa machata Aa, «Ha"i gakkanawukka neeni ne suuretetsan minna uttaaddii? S'oossaa shek'k'aade hayk'k'a» yaagaaddu.<verse eid="JOB 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 2:10" />I zaariide izo, «Neeni booza mac'c'a asaadan haasayaadda. Nuuni S'oossaappe lo"obaa akki akkiide, iitabaa akkokkoyye?» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 2:10">Ha ubbankka Iyyoobi bare geeddawaan nagaraa ootsibeenna.<verse eid="JOB 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Heezzu Iyyooba Laggetsatuu Aa Be'anaw Yeeddino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 2:11" />Iyyooba laggetuu heezzatuu, Temaana biittaappe Elifaazi, Shuuha biittaappe Bilddaadinne Naa'ima biittaappe S'oofaari Iyyooba bolla gakkeedda metuwaa siseedda wode, aw k'arettanawunne Aa mintsetsanaw barenttu sooppe barenttu sooppe k'aagettiide, ittippe aakko yeeddino. <verse eid="JOB 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 2:12" />Unttunttu Aa haakuwaan gidiide s'eelliyaa wode, I Iyyooba gidiyaawaa eribeykkino. Guyyeppe Aa gidiyaawaa ereedda wode, barenttu k'aalaa d'ok'k'u ootsiide yeekkeeddino; barenttu mayuwaakka peed'iide, barenttu huup'iyaan baana k'oleeddino. <verse eid="JOB 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 2:13" />Hewaappe guyyiyaan, unttunttu aanana laappun gallassaanne laappun k'ammaa biittan utteeddino. Aa sakuu loytsi dareeddawaa unttunttu be'eedda diraw, aw ay asaynne k'aalaakka k'aattibeenna.<verse eid="JOB 2:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JOB 3" />
  <para style="ms">Iyyoobanne Aa Laggetsatuwaa Palumiyaa</para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="JOB 3:1-37:24">3:1—37:24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="s">Koyiro Haasayatuwaan Iyyoobi Bare <optbreak />Yeletteedda Gallassaa Shek'k'eedda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="JOB 3:1-2" />Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Iyyoobi bare doonaa dooyiide, bare yeletteedda gallassaa hawaadan yaagiide shek'k'eedda;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1-19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 20:14-18">Erm. 20:14-18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JOB 3:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 3:3" />«Taani shahaaretteedda k'ammaynne taani yeletteedda gallassay c'oo d'ayino! <verse eid="JOB 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 3:4" />He gallassay d'uma gido; Bolla S'oossay he gallassaa sheneko go; Aa bollan poo'uukka poo'oppo. <verse eid="JOB 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 3:5" />Leeleedda d'umaynne shaannochchuu Aa goozo; Aa shaarii kammo; Aa poo'uwaakka d'umay gentso. <verse eid="JOB 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 3:6" />He gallassaa k'ammaa d'ip'p'i go d'umay oyk'k'o. Laytsaa giddon de'iyaa gallassatuwaan I paydettoppo; aginatuwaa payduwaankka geloppo. <verse eid="JOB 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 3:7" />He gallassaa k'ammay k'ammiide wonttoppo; nashshechchaa ililssaykka an sisettoppo. <verse eid="JOB 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 3:8" />Leewaataana giyaa dawiyaa dentsetsanaw looheedda shareechchotuu he gallassaa shek'k'ino. <verse eid="JOB 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 3:9" />He k'ammaw bakkaaliyaa s'oolinttii poo'oppo; poo'uwaa naagiidekka demmoppo; wontta s'alk'k'iikka aw s'alk'k'ettoppo. <verse eid="JOB 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 3:10" />He k'ammay taani ta aatti uluwaan shahaarettennaadaaninne ha metuwaa be'ennaadan te"ibeenna diraw, shek'k'etteeddawaa gido.<verse eid="JOB 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 3:11" />«Taani ta aatti uluwaan haatsaa kesaarikkitaashsha! Ta aatti uluwaappe yeletta wod'd'anne hayk'k'aarikkitaasha! <verse eid="JOB 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 3:12" />Ta aata taana ayaw bare kiwuwaan idimmaadeeshsha? Bare d'antsaakka taana ayaw d'antsaadeeshsha? <verse eid="JOB 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 3:13" />He wode taani hayk'k'eeddawaa gidintto, ha"i shemppaade gem"ishaad shin! <verse eid="JOB 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 3:14" />Koletteedda sa'atuwaa barenttoo zaaretsi kees's'eedda sa'aa kaatetuwaannanne unttuntta zoriyaawanttunna, <verse eid="JOB 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 3:15" />work'k'ay de'iyaanne barenttu golliyaan biraa kuntseedda mooddiyaawanttunna ittippe duufuwaan gisaaddi shin! <verse eid="JOB 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 3:16" />Woy aatti uluwaappe boshettiide yeletteedda na'aadan, woy gallassaa poo'uwaa ayinne be'ibeenna boshettowaadan, taani biittaa giddon k'osetta diggaarkkitaashsha! <verse eid="JOB 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 3:17" />Duufuwan iitatuu barenttu iita oosuwaa aggiino; yaan daaburanchchatuukka shemppiino. <verse eid="JOB 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 3:18" />He sa'aan k'ashetto asatuukka shemppiide nashettiino; oosuwaa oosissiyaawanttu waasuwaa unttunttu hewan sissikkino. <verse eid="JOB 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 3:19" />Guutsay daruukka yaan de'ee; ayiliikka bare godaw ayilettiyaasaappe kesee.<verse eid="JOB 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 3:20" />«Metuwaan de'iyaawanttoo poo'uu ayaw imetteedee? De'uu c'ammiyaawanttoo, <verse eid="JOB 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 3:21" />hayk'k'uu yanddeeshsha giide amottina, yeennan is's'iyaawanttoo, k'osi wotseedda duretaa koyiyaawaappe aatsiide, hayk'k'uwaa koyiyaawanttoo,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 9:6">Sas'. 9:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JOB 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 3:22" />duufuwaa biide gakkiyaa wode, nashshechchaaninne ililssan pooc'ummiyaawanttoo de'uu ayaw imetteedee? <verse eid="JOB 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 3:23" />Ogii bayi kichcheedda uraw, S'oossay Aa yuushshuwaa diri diggeedda uraw poo'uu ayaw imetteedee? <verse eid="JOB 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 3:24" />Kayyuu taw k'uma gideedda; ta oolii aggenaan goggiyaa haatsaa mala. <verse eid="JOB 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 3:25" />Taani yayyeeddawe ta bolla gakkeedda; taani dagammeeddawekka taanan haneedda. <verse eid="JOB 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 3:26" />Taw metoppe attina, saruu, woppaynne shemppuu baawa» yaageedda.<verse eid="JOB 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JOB 4" />
  <para style="s">Elifaazi Koyiro Haasayeedda Haasayaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="JOB 4:1-14:22">4:1—14:22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 4:1" />Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Teemaana biittaappe yeedda Elifaazi zaariide, hawaadan yaageedda; <verse eid="JOB 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 4:2" />«Itti uray neenanna s'aliide haasayooppe, neeni hank'k'ettanii? Shin haasayennaaninne agganawe oonee? <verse eid="JOB 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 4:3" />Be'a, neeni darotuwaa tamaarissaadda; arggaac'eedda kushetuwaakka mintsetsaadda. <verse eid="JOB 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 4:4" />Ne k'aalay d'ubetteeddawantta minisi essee; daabureedda gulbbatatuwaakka mintsetsee. <verse eid="JOB 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 4:5" />Shin ha"i metuu neekko yeedda; neeni genc'c'abeykka. Metuu neena gakkina, neeni shabbirettaadda. <verse eid="JOB 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 4:6" />Neeni S'oossaw yayyiyaawe neena ammantsiide wotsennee? Ne hamettiyaa suure hametay new hidoota gidennee?<verse eid="JOB 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 4:7" />«Ane neeni ha"i k'oppa: geeshsha gideedda asan d'ayeeddawe oonee? Woy suure Asay hak'an d'ok'ollettiide d'ayi erii? <verse eid="JOB 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 4:8" />Taani be'eeddawaadan, iitatetsaa goshiide, metuwaa zeriyaawanttu iitatetsaanne metuwaa c'akkana. <verse eid="JOB 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 4:9" />Unttunttu S'oossaappe kesiyaa shemppuwaan punettiide bayana; Aa hank'k'uwaa suuluwaankka unttunttu meetetti d'ayana. <verse eid="JOB 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 4:10" />Iitatuu gudiyaanne daariyaa gaammotuwaa mala; shin S'oossay unttunttu achchaa mentsee. <verse eid="JOB 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 4:11" />Shankkatiide oyk'k'eeddawaa maanaw achchaa d'aya gaammotuwaadan, iitatuu koshaan hayk'k'iino; unttunttu naanatuukka laalettiino.<verse eid="JOB 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 4:12" />«Itti gallassi itti s'uuray taakko yeedda; he s'uuray saasukettiide, ta haytsaan wod'd'eedda. <verse eid="JOB 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 4:13" />K'amma gem"ishshuwaa pannurishin, taana iita akumuu un"etseedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 33:15">Yob. 33:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JOB 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 4:14" />Taana yashshaynne kokkorssay oyk'k'eedda; ta mek'etsaa ubbaa gaji gajisseedda. <verse eid="JOB 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 4:15" />C'arkkuu aad'd'iidde ta som"uwaa pittiidde, ta sintsanna aad'd'eedda; dagamaappe denddeeddawaan ta bollan de'iyaa binnaanay ek'k'eedda. <verse eid="JOB 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 4:16" />I ta sintsan ek'k'eedda; shin I ayentto taani shaakkaade eranaw danddayabeykke. Hewaappe guyyiyaan, c'o"u geeddasaappe hawaadan yaagiyaa kooshshaa sisaad; <verse eid="JOB 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 4:17" />‹Hayk'k'iyaa Asay S'oossaa sintsan s'illuwaa gidiide beettanaw danddayii? Woy Asay barena Med'd'eeddawaa sintsan geeshsha gidiide beettanaw danddayii? <verse eid="JOB 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 4:18" />S'oossay bare k'oomatuwaan ammanettena; bare kiitanchchatuwaankka bayzzuwaa demmee. <verse eid="JOB 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 4:19" />Yaatina, urk'k'aappe med'etteeddawanttun, unttunttu de'uwaa baasuu baanaa gideeddawanttun, bil"aappekka elleelliide wook'k'iyaawanttun ay keeshshaa daro bayzzuu beettanddeeshsha! <verse eid="JOB 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 4:20" />Wontta pas'a de'iyaa Asay omarssi gakkanaw, ooninne hassayennan de'ishiina hayk'k'ee. <verse eid="JOB 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 4:21" />Unttunttu de'uwaa shikaalii shodetti wod'd'iyaa wode, unttunttu aad'd'eeda eratetsaa demmennaan hayk'k'i bayiino› yaagiyaawaa sisaad.<verse eid="JOB 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JOB 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 5:1" />«Iyyoobaa, ane s'eesa! Shin oonee new koyanawe? Kiitanchchatuwaappe ookko simmanii? <verse eid="JOB 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 5:2" />Eeyya uraa lanc'c'ii wod'ee; akeekay pac'c'eedda uraakka k'anaatii d'ayissee. <verse eid="JOB 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 5:3" />Eeyya uray minniide de'iyaawaa taani ta huup'iyaan be'aad; shin ellekka taani Aa golliyaa shek'k'aad. <verse eid="JOB 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 5:4" />Aa naanatuu saruu bayinna saan de'iino; unttunttu chilootan, maaddiide haasayiyaawe bayinna saan pirddaa d'ayeeddino. <verse eid="JOB 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 5:5" />I shiishsheedda katsaa koshshatteeddawanttu maana; aguntsaa giddon mokkeeddawaakka unttunttu aw aggikkino. Saametteeddawanttu Aa mas'uwaa akkanaw yaaretiino. <verse eid="JOB 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 5:6" />Tuggay baanaappe kesenna; metuukka biittaappe mokkenna. <verse eid="JOB 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 5:7" />Tamay pude piriyaawaadan, Asay metoo yeletteedda.<verse eid="JOB 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 5:8" />«Taana gidintto, taani S'oossaakko shiik'ana; ta mootuwaakka Aa sintsan wotsana. <verse eid="JOB 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 5:9" />Pilggiide eranaw danddayettenna wolk'k'aamabatuwaanne paydu bayinna ooratsabatuwaa S'oossay ootsee. <verse eid="JOB 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 5:10" />Iraa biittan bukissee; gadiyawukka haatsaa yeddee. <verse eid="JOB 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 5:11" />Toosheteeddawantta bonchchee; kayyottiyaawanttakka mintsetsiide nashechchee. <verse eid="JOB 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 5:12" />Genanchchatuwaa halchchuwaakka halissee; hewaa diraw, unttunttu kushiyaa oosuu polettenna. <verse eid="JOB 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 5:13" />Aad'd'eeda eranchchatuwaa I unttunttu geniyaan oyk'k'ee; geellatuwaa mak'k'uwaakka aatsi yeggee.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 3:19">1 K'or. 3:19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JOB 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 5:14" />Unttunttoo gallassay d'umana; gallassaa seetankka unttunttu hekka bilahiyaadan tattaafana. <verse eid="JOB 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 5:15" />Hiyyeesatuwaa I unttunttu morkketuu mashshaappe ashshee; I unttuntta wolk'k'aamatuwaa kushiyaappekka wotsi akkee. <verse eid="JOB 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 5:16" />Hewaa diraw, hiyyeesatoo hidootay de'ee; iita asatuwaa I c'o"u ootsee.<verse eid="JOB 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 5:17" />«S'oossay seeriyaa uray anjjetteedawaa; hewaa diraw, Ubbaa Danddayiyaa S'oossaa seeraa kad'oppa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:11">Lem. 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 12:5-6">Ibr. 12:5-6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JOB 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 5:18" />I madutsee, shin madutsaa k'achchee. I dechchee, shin Aa kushii d'allee.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 6:1">Hos. 6:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JOB 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 5:19" />Usuppun k'ommo metobaappe I neena ashshana; laappuntsikka neena bochchenna. <verse eid="JOB 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 5:20" />Koshaa wode hayk'k'uwaappe, olaa wodekka mashshaa k'araappe I neena ashshana. <verse eid="JOB 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 5:21" />I neena ins's'arssaa lissuwaappe gentsana; bashshay gakkiyaa wodekka yayakka. <verse eid="JOB 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 5:22" />Bashshaa bollanne koshaa bolla neeni miic'c'ana; bazzo do'atookka yayakka. <verse eid="JOB 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 5:23" />Ne goshiyaa goshshan shuchchay de'enna; bazzo do'atuukka neenanna saro gidanawantta. <verse eid="JOB 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 5:24" />Ne dunkkaanii saro gidiyaawaa neeni geeshshaade erana; ne dorssatuwaa ak'uwaakka neeni s'omoosiyaa wode, unttunttuppe ittuunne pac'c'enna. <verse eid="JOB 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 5:25" />Ne yeletay c'orattanawaanne ne zeretsatuukka dembbaa maataa keeshshaa gidanawaa neeni erana. <verse eid="JOB 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 5:26" />Zarggaa tukuu bare wodiyaan uddumaa yiyaawaadan, neeni adussa laytsaa de'aade, duufuwaa baana. <verse eid="JOB 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 5:27" />Iyyoobaa, nuuni hawaa ubbaa pilggi s'eelleeddo. Hewe tuma gidiyaa diraw, hewaa sisaade, new akka» yaageedda.<verse eid="JOB 5:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JOB 6" />
  <para style="s">Iyyoobi Laa"entsuwaa Haasayee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 6:1" />Iyyoobi zaariide, <verse eid="JOB 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 6:2" />«Ta waayiinne ta kayyuu ubbay miizaanan likketteerenne! <verse eid="JOB 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 6:3" />Yaatintto abbaa doonaa shafiyaappekka aad'd'i dees'anawaa. Hewaa diraw, ta k'aalay s'ala gideedda. <verse eid="JOB 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 6:4" />Ubbaa Danddayiyaa S'oossaa wonddaafiyaa pootsay taana c'addeeddino; ta bollaykka unttunttu yishshaa ushee. S'oossaa dagantsiyaa boshay ta yuushshuwaa dooddeedda. <verse eid="JOB 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 6:5" />Harii maatay Aa sintsan de'ishiina waasiiyye? Woy booray dalaa demmiide s'aaggiiyye? <verse eid="JOB 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 6:6" />Mal"ennabay mas'inii gelennaan meetettiiyye? Woy k'uuk'k'ulliyaa giddo haatsay lok'ilok'iyye? <verse eid="JOB 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 6:7" />Hewaa mala k'umaa taani shenetay; hewaa mala k'umaa mooppe, taana sakkee.<verse eid="JOB 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 6:8" />«Taani woosseedda woosay gakkeerennee! S'oossaykka ta wozanaa amuwaa immeerennee! <verse eid="JOB 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 6:9" />S'oossay taana mentsereetseerennee! I bare kushiyaa yeddiide, ta de'uwaa turaa duutseerenneeshsha! <verse eid="JOB 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 6:10" />Geeshsha S'oossaa k'aalaa kaddabeenna diraw, taw sakuu darooppenne, mintsetsuwaa gideereneshsha. <verse eid="JOB 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 6:11" />Taani de'uwaan de'anaw taw ay wolk'k'ay de'ii? Taani danddayanaw, ta wurssetsay ayee? <verse eid="JOB 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 6:12" />Ta wolk'k'ay shuchchaa wolk'k'aa malee? Woy ta ashuu nahaasiyaa birataa malee? <verse eid="JOB 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 6:13" />taana maaddanaw ay wolk'k'aynne taw baawa; maaduwaa demmanaw taani biyaa sa'aykka de'enna.<verse eid="JOB 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 6:14" />«Metuwaan de'iyaa uray Ubbaa Danddayiyaa S'oossaw yayyiyaawaa agginttokka, Aa laggetuu aw keekkatetsaa bessanaw koshshee. <verse eid="JOB 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 6:15" />Ta ishatoo, hintte iray bukkenna wode meliyaa shaafaa mala, taana c'immiitta. <verse eid="JOB 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 6:16" />Balgguwaa aginatuwaan he shaafay orddo shachchaan kumiide kametee. <verse eid="JOB 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 6:17" />Shin bonii gakkiyaa wode, he shachchay muushiide, haatsaa kesee; haatsaykka he sa'aappe d'ayee. <verse eid="JOB 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 6:18" />C'aanaa mehiyaa laaggiide biyaa zal"anchchatuu haatsaa koyanaw barenttu ogiyaappe gas'aa kesiide, mela biittan toyilakattiidde, hayk'k'i d'ayiino. <verse eid="JOB 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 6:19" />Teema biittaa zal"anchchatuunne Saaba biittaa ogiyaawanttu haatsaa demmana giide, hidootaa wotsiino. <verse eid="JOB 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 6:20" />Shin unttunttu ammanettiide koyina d'ayeedda diraw, yeellateeddinonne hidootaa k'ans's'eeddino. <verse eid="JOB 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 6:21" />Hinttekka taw he shaafatuwaa mala gideeddita; taana gakkeedda metuwaa be'iide yayyeeddita. <verse eid="JOB 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 6:22" />Taani hinttena, ‹Taw ittibaa immite› woy, ‹Hintte ak'uwaappe ta diraw asaw mattaayiyaa immite› gaadditaa? <verse eid="JOB 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 6:23" />Woy, ‹Taana ta morkkiyaa kushiyaappe ashshite› woy, ‹Uk'k'inniyaawanttu kushiyaappe taana wozite› gaadditaa?<verse eid="JOB 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 6:24" />«Hintte taana tamaarissite; taani c'o"u gaana. Ayaa bayzzaadditantto, ane taana bessite. <verse eid="JOB 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 6:25" />Tuma gideedda k'aalay ay keena wolk'k'aamee! Shin hintte palumay ubbay taana ayaanne seerenna. <verse eid="JOB 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 6:26" />Hintte taani haasayiyaa haasayaa c'arkkuwaa mala giide k'oppiita. Yaatina, taani hidoota k'ans's'aade haasayiyaa haasayaa ayaw k'oriitee? <verse eid="JOB 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 6:27" />Aawuu bayinnawantta shaakki akkanaw hintte saamaa yeggiita; hintte laggiyaakka zal"anaw washissiita. <verse eid="JOB 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 6:28" />Ane tishshi ootsiide, taana s'eellite. Taani hintte sintsan wordduwaa haasayikke. <verse eid="JOB 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 6:29" />Hayyanaa, ane zaaretsiide k'oppite; taani s'illuwaa gidiyaa diraw, ta bolla c'oo pirddoppite. <verse eid="JOB 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 6:30" />Taani ta ins's'arssan worddoteeddawaa malatii? Ta doonay likkiyaa likke gidenawaappe shaakkiide haasayanaw danddayennee?<verse eid="JOB 6:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JOB 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 7:1" />«Asaa de'uu sa'aa bollan wolk'k'aama baas'e gidenneeyye? Aa de'uwaa laytsay keraa ootsiyaa asaa de'uwaa laytsaa mala gidenneeyye? <verse eid="JOB 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 7:2" />Kuwaa amottiyaa k'oomaadan, woy bare dirgguwaa akkanaw naagiyaa oosanchchaadan, <verse eid="JOB 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 7:3" />hewaadan taw mela aginatuunne tugga k'ammatuu imetteeddino. <verse eid="JOB 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 7:4" />Taani gisiyaa wode, ‹Awude beegottandditaashsha?› yaagay. Shin k'ammay taw aduk'k'ee; sa'ay wonttana gakkanaw hiis'an aad'd'a aad'd'a wod'd'ay. <verse eid="JOB 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 7:5" />Ta bollay gus'uniyaanne pok'uwaa mayyeedda; ta madutsaappe giishshay goggee. <verse eid="JOB 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 7:6" />Ta laytsay shemayinniyaa mukuukkaappekka aad'd'i elleellee; ay hidootaynne bayinnan ta laytsay wuree.<verse eid="JOB 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 7:7" />«Abeet S'oossaw, ta laytsay siid'iyaanna shemppiyaa itti shemppuwaa mala gidiyaawaa hassaya! Ta ayifii laa"entso keekkabaa be'ennaan atteedda. <verse eid="JOB 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 7:8" />Neeni taana ha"i be'aasa; shin laa"entso be'akka; neeni taana koyooppe, taani d'ayaad.<verse eid="JOB 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 7:9" />«Shaarii piskki giide d'ayiyaawaadan, duufuwaa wod'd'eedda uray simmiide kesenna. <verse eid="JOB 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 7:10" />Bare gollekka laa"entso simmiide yeenna; Aa eriyaa asaykka Aa dogee.<verse eid="JOB 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 7:11" />«Hewaa diraw, taani c'o"u giikke; taani ta tuggaa diraw haasayana; ta de'uu c'ammeedda diraw zuuzummana. <verse eid="JOB 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 7:12" />Hawaa keeshshaa neeni taana ayaw naagay? Taani new abbaa woy abbaa giddo hambbaaziyaa gaaddiyye? <verse eid="JOB 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 7:13" />Taani, ‹Ta hiis'ay taana mintsetsanddee; ta alggayikka taana zuuzuntsaappe shemppissanddee!› yaagiyaa wode, <verse eid="JOB 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 7:14" />neeni taana akumuwaan yashissaasa; sas'aankka taana dagantsaasa. <verse eid="JOB 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 7:15" />Taani ha sakkiyaa bollaanna de'anawaappe sulettiyaawaanne hayk'k'iyaawaa dooray. <verse eid="JOB 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 7:16" />Taani ta de'uwaa kad'aad; taani med'inaw de'anaw koyikke. Ta laytsay siid'iyaanna shemppiyaa itti shemppuwaa mala gidiyaa diraw, neeni taana agga basha.<verse eid="JOB 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 7:17" />«Neeni Aa woggabaadan s'eellanaw Asay ayee? Neeni aabaw ayaw bonchcho sa'aa immay?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:4">Maz. 8:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 144:3">144:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JOB 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 7:18" />Wontta wontta neeni Aa biddaassaa; k'ay wodiyaan wodiyaan Aa paac'c'aasa. <verse eid="JOB 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 7:19" />Neeni taakko s'eelliyaawaa mulekka aggikkii? Woy taani ta c'uchchaa mittiyaa wodiyaakka taw immikkii? <verse eid="JOB 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 7:20" />Abeet asaa wochchiyaawoo, taani nagaraa ootseeddawaa gidooppe, neena ayay k'oheeddee? Neeni ayaw taana c'addi kaa'iyaawaa ootsaaddii? New taani dees'o tookuwaa gidaadditayye? <verse eid="JOB 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 7:21" />Ta balaappe ayaw taana maarennan is's'ay? Ta nagaraakka ayaw atto geenan aggay? Simmi taani duufuwaa wod'd'iyaa wodii gakkeedda; neeni taana koyiyaa wodekka, taani beettikke» yaageedda.<verse eid="JOB 7:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JOB 8" />
  <para style="s">Bilddaade Haasayeedda Haasayaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 8:1" />Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Shuuha biittaappe yeedda Bilddaade zaariide, hawaadan yaageedda; <verse eid="JOB 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 8:2" />«Neeni hawaa malabaa awude gakkanaw haasayay? Ne doonaappe kesiyaa k'aalay wolk'k'aama gotiyaa mala. <verse eid="JOB 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 8:3" />Ubbaa Danddayiyaa s'oossay pirddaanne s'illobaa geellayii? <verse eid="JOB 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 8:4" />Ne naanatuu S'oossaa bolla nagaraa ootseedda diraw, I unttuntta unttunttoo bessiyaawaadan muree. <verse eid="JOB 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 8:5" />Shin neeni S'oossaakko simmooppe, Ubbaa Danddayiyaa S'oossaa woossooppe, <verse eid="JOB 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 8:6" />neeni geeshshanne suure gidooppe, I ne diraw denddiide, neena maaddana; I kase ne de'oo zaariide woytana. <verse eid="JOB 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 8:7" />Ne doometsay guutsa malattooppenne, ne wurssetsay loytsi darana.<verse eid="JOB 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 8:8" />«Kase yeletaa ane oochcha; nu mayzza aawotuu ayaa ayaa tamaareeddentto, koyaade demma. <verse eid="JOB 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 8:9" />Ayaw gooppe, nuuni zino yeletteeddawantta; nuuni ayaanne erokko. Nuuni ha sa'aan de'iyaa laytsay kuwaa mala. <verse eid="JOB 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 8:10" />Unttunttu neena tamaarissino, new odinonne barenttu akeekeeddawaappe haasayino.<verse eid="JOB 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 8:11" />«C'arii c'ariyaa haatsay bayinna saan dic'c'anaw danddayenna; mak'k'aykka haatsi bayinna saan mokkanaw danddayenna. <verse eid="JOB 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 8:12" />Biro dic'c'iidde, k'ans's'ettennan de'iiddi, maataappekka elle shullana. <verse eid="JOB 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 8:13" />S'oossaa dogiyaa asaa ubbaa wurssetsay hewaa mala; S'oossay bayinna uraa hidootaykka d'ayana. <verse eid="JOB 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 8:14" />I ammanettiyaawe me"i kichchiyaawaa; I c'eek'ettiyaabaykka shararootaa golliyaa mala. <verse eid="JOB 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 8:15" />I bare shararootatti golliyaan zemppee, shin ek'k'enna; I Aa oyk'k'ana, shin Aa danddayenna. <verse eid="JOB 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 8:16" />I awaan haatsaa ushsheedda ataakilttiyaa mala; ataakilttiyaa sa'aa pinni kesana gakkanaw daashee. <verse eid="JOB 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 8:17" />Keelaa shuchchaa yuushshuwaan bare s'ap'uwaa yeddee; shuchchatuwaa giddonkka barew sa'aa koyee. <verse eid="JOB 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 8:18" />Shin I bare sa'aappe shodetti d'ayintto, he sa'ay Aa, ‹Taani neena be'abeyikke› yaagana. <verse eid="JOB 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 8:19" />Be'a, iita asatuwaa nashechchay hawaa mala. Hara asatuukka yiide, unttunttu sa'aa oyk'k'iino.<verse eid="JOB 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 8:20" />«S'oossay tumuwaappe tooshii bayinna asaa oli erenna; iitaa ootsiyaawantta k'ay maaddenna. <verse eid="JOB 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 8:21" />I zaariide, neena miic'issananne ililissana. <verse eid="JOB 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 8:22" />Neena is's'iyaawanttu yeellaa mayyana; iitatuwaa gollii d'ayana» yaageedda.<verse eid="JOB 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JOB 9" />
  <para style="s">Iyyoobi Gujjiidekka Haasayee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 9:1" />Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Iyyoobi zaariide, hawaadan yaageedda; <verse eid="JOB 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 9:2" />«Ee, hawe hintte giyaawe tuma gidiyaawaa taani eray. Shin Asay S'oossaa sintsan s'illuwaa gidanaw waan danddayii?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 4:17">Yob. 4:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JOB 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 9:3" />Aanana itti uray palumettanaw koyooppe, he uray I oochchiyaa sha"u ooshaappe ittuwaanne zaaranaw danddayenna. <verse eid="JOB 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 9:4" />S'oossay bare wozanaan aad'd'eeda eranchcha; bare abbiyankka daro wolk'k'aama. Aanana ek'ettiide s'oonettibeenawe baawa. <verse eid="JOB 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 9:5" />Erennan de'ishiina, d'ok'k'a deretuwaa I unttunttu sa'aappe diggee; bare hank'k'uwaankka aatsi yeggee. <verse eid="JOB 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 9:6" />I biittaa Aa sa'aan k'aatsee; biittaa tuuk'etuwaakka yiik'k'iyiik'k'issee. <verse eid="JOB 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 9:7" />Away awas's'enaadaaninne s'oolinttetuu poo'ennaadan azazanaw danddayee. <verse eid="JOB 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 9:8" />I barekka salotuwaa mic'c'eedda; abbaa beetaa bollankka hamettee. <verse eid="JOB 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 9:9" />S'oossay Wogga Beeriyaa, Ooriyoona, Piliyaadisa giyaa s'oolinttetuwaa c'uguwaanne hewaadankka gedissa baggana de'iyaa s'oolinttetuwaa c'ugotuwaa med'd'eeddawaa. <verse eid="JOB 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 9:10" />Pilggiide eranaw danddayettenna wolk'k'aamatuwaa, paydu bayinna ooratsabatuwaa I ootsee.<verse eid="JOB 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 9:11" />«S'oossay taakko shiik'inttokka, taani Aa be'anaw danddaykke; I ta miyiyaanna aad'd'inttokka, taani I hewan de'iyaawaa eranaw danddaykke. <verse eid="JOB 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 9:12" />I bare koyeeddawaa akkina, Aa ooninne digganaw danddayenna. ‹Waatay?› yaagiide Aa oochchana Asay baawa. <verse eid="JOB 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 9:13" />S'oossay bare hank'k'uwaa te"enna; Ra'aaba giyaa dawiyaa maaddiyaa bare morkkatuwaa bare gediyaappe garssaw aatsiide yed'd'ee.<verse eid="JOB 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 9:14" />«Yaatina, taani Aa ooshaa zaaranaw lo"o k'aalaa hak'appe demmanaw danddayayitaa? <verse eid="JOB 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 9:15" />Taani s'illuwaa gidinttokka, pirddiyaa S'oossay taana maaranaadan woossanaappe attina, taani Aa bolla haasayikke. <verse eid="JOB 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 9:16" />Taani Aa s'eesina, I taw koyinttokka, ‹Ta kooshshaa siseedda› gaade ammanikke. <verse eid="JOB 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 9:17" />I taana gotiyaan mentsereetsee; gaasuu bayinnan I ta madutsaa darissee. <verse eid="JOB 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 9:18" />Taana shemppuwaakka shemppissennan diggee; I ta de'uwaa c'amuwaan kuntseedda. <verse eid="JOB 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 9:19" />Wolk'k'aabaa haasayooppe, I wolk'k'aama. Pirddaawaa haasayooppe, Aa s'eesiide, pirdda golle shiishshana Asay baawa. <verse eid="JOB 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 9:20" />Taani s'illuwaa gidinttokka ta doonay taana bayzzanchcha kessee; taani tooshii bayinna asaa gidinttokka, I taana geella kessee.<verse eid="JOB 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 9:21" />«Taani tooshii bayinna asaa. Shin ta de'uwaa dosikkenne kad'ay. <verse eid="JOB 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 9:22" />Dummatetsay baawa; hewaa diraw, taani, ‹I tooshii bayinnawanttanne iitatuwaa laa"uwaakka ittippe d'ayissee› yaagay. <verse eid="JOB 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 9:23" />Bashshay s'illo asatuwaa k'oppennaan wod'iyaa wode, S'oossay k'iliic'ee. <verse eid="JOB 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 9:24" />S'oossay ha sa'aa iita asatoo aatsiide immeedda; pirddiyaawanttu ayifiyaakka goozeedda. Hawaa ubbaa ootseeddawe Aa gidanaappe attina, haray oonee?<verse eid="JOB 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 9:25" />«Ta de'uwaa laytsatuu wotsaa wos's'iyaa uraappekka aad'd'iide elleelliino; unttunttu lo"obaa be'ennaan paalliide d'ayiino. <verse eid="JOB 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 9:26" />Ta de'uwaa laytsatuu mak'k'aa wonggiriyaadan elleelliino; arggantsay barew miyaawaa oyk'k'anaw saluwaappe duge paalliyaawaadan paalliino. <verse eid="JOB 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 9:27" />Taani, ‹Ta zuuzuntsaa dogana; ta som"uwaakka d'umissiyaawaa aggade pashikkana› yaagooppe, <verse eid="JOB 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 9:28" />neeni taana geeshsha geenawaa taani eray; ayaw gooppe, taana gakkana waayiyaa ubbaw taani yayyay. <verse eid="JOB 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 9:29" />Yaatina, taani bayzzanchcha gida kichchaaddippe attina, c'oo mela ayaw daaburayttaa?<verse eid="JOB 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 9:30" />«Taani ta bollaa haray atto saamunaan meec'ettanttokka, ta kushiyaa hanc'c'iic'iyaan meec'c'anttokka, <verse eid="JOB 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 9:31" />neeni taana urk'k'aa ollaan olana; ta mayuukka taana shenetana. <verse eid="JOB 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 9:32" />Taani aw zaaruwaa immana gaanaw, S'oossay ta mala asaa gidenna. Hewaa diraw pirddaw boytte gaanaw danddaykke. <verse eid="JOB 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 9:33" />Shin bare kushiyaa nu laa"uwaa bolla wotsiide, nuuna sigetsiyaa Asay nu giddon de'eerenneeshsha! <verse eid="JOB 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 9:34" />Abeet S'oossaw, taana muriyaawaa agga; taana dagantsiyaawaanne yashissiyaawaa agga. <verse eid="JOB 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 9:35" />Yaatooppe, taani aw yayyenan haasayana; shin ha"i danddaykke.<verse eid="JOB 9:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JOB 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 10:1" />«Taani ta de'uwaa kad'ay! Hewaa diraw, taani mootettanaappe attina, c'o"u giikke; taani mishettaade haasayay. <verse eid="JOB 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 10:2" />Taani S'oossaa hawaadan yaagay: Ha"i ta bolla pirddoppa; neeni taana mootiyaa mootuu ayenttonne taw oda. <verse eid="JOB 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 10:3" />Neeni taana uk'k'unnanaw bessii? Neeni ne kushiyan med'd'eedda uraa kad'iyaawe, k'ay iitatuwaa halchchuwaa polissiyaawe lo"ee? <verse eid="JOB 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 10:4" />Ne ayifii asaa ayifiyaa malee? Asay s'eelliyaawaadan neeni s'eellay? <verse eid="JOB 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 10:5" />Ne de'uwaa laytsaykka asaawaa keeshshee? Ne de'uwaa laytsaykka asaa laytsaayda k'antsee? <verse eid="JOB 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 10:6" />Yaatina, ta bayzzuwaa ayaw koyay? Ta nagaraakka ayaw k'oray? <verse eid="JOB 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 10:7" />Taani bayzzanchcha gidennawaanne ne kushiyaappe taana ooninne ashshanaw danddayennawaa neeni eraasa.<verse eid="JOB 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 10:8" />«Taana ne kushii giigissiide med'd'eedda; shin ha"i he kushii simmiide, taana d'ayissee. <verse eid="JOB 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 10:9" />Neeni taana urk'k'aappe med'd'eeddawaa hassaya. Yaatina, ha"i taana baanaadan liik'issanaw hanay? <verse eid="JOB 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 10:10" />Taana maatsaadan ta aatti uluwaan tigeeddawenne dichcheedawe neena. <verse eid="JOB 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 10:11" />Taana neeni ashuwaanne galbbaa mayzzaadda; ta mek'etsaa s'ap'uwaanna gatsaade waas'aadda. <verse eid="JOB 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 10:12" />Neeni taw de'uwaanne aggena ne siik'uwaa immaadda; ne naaguwaan neeni taana pas'a wotsaadda.<verse eid="JOB 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 10:13" />«Shin neeni he wodiyaappe doommaade, ne wozanaa giddon taana k'ohanaw k'oppiyaawaa taani eray. <verse eid="JOB 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 10:14" />Taani nagaraa ootsooppe be'anaw, neeni taana geeddaasa; ta bayzzuwaakka murenaan aad'd'akka. <verse eid="JOB 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 10:15" />Bayzzanchcha gidooppe, taw aayye ana! K'ay taani s'illo gidinttokka, ta huup'iyaa pude d'ok'k'u ootsanaw danddaykke. Ayaw gooppe, neeni taana yeellaan kuntsa wotsaaddanne tuggaan matsoya wotsaadda. <verse eid="JOB 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 10:16" />Taani otorettooppe, neeni taana gaammuwaadan yederssaade oyk'k'ana; k'aykka taana k'ohanaw, ne malalissiyaa oosuwaa neeni ootsana. <verse eid="JOB 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 10:17" />Neeni ta bolla ooratsa markkatuwaa ahaasa; ne hank'k'uwaakka ta bolla darissaasa; taana olanaw ooratsa halchchotuwaa giigissaasa.<verse eid="JOB 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 10:18" />«Yaatina, taana ta aatti uluwaappe ayaw kesaadii? Ooninne taana be'ennaan hayk'k'aarikkitaasha! <verse eid="JOB 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 10:19" />Taani de'ennaan aggaarikkitaashaa! Woy ta aatti uluwaappe kesosaanna duufuwaan wod'd'aarikkitaashsha! <verse eid="JOB 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 10:20" />Ta de'anaw atteeda laytsatuu guutsa gidikkinoo? Taani laafaa nashetta akkana mala, ha"i taana aggaarikkii! <verse eid="JOB 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 10:21" />Leeleedda d'uma sa'aa taani biyaa wodii mateedda; taani hewaappe simmaade haa yiikke. <verse eid="JOB 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 10:22" />Taani biyaasa'ay d'ip'p'i go d'umaynne maaray baynawanttu de'iyaa biittaa; hewan de'iyaa poo'uukka d'umaa mala» yaageedda.<verse eid="JOB 10:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JOB 11" />
  <para style="s">S'oofaari Haasayeedda Haasayaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 11:1" />Naa'ima biittaappe yeedda S'oofaari zaariide, hawaadan yaageedda; <verse eid="JOB 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 11:2" />«Ha haasayetteedda k'aalaw ubbaw zaaruwaa immiyaa Asay baawee? Woy hawaa haasayeedda bitanii tumanchcha gidanaw danddayii? <verse eid="JOB 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 11:3" />Ne mela haasayay asaa c'o"u ootsii? Neeni k'iliic'iyaa wode, neena seeriyaawe baawa gaaddiyye? <verse eid="JOB 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 11:4" />Neeni odaadde, ‹Ta timirttii tuma; taani S'oossaa sintsan geeshsha› yaagaasa. <verse eid="JOB 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 11:5" />S'oossay ne bolla bare doonaa dooyiide haasayeerenneeshsha! <verse eid="JOB 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 11:6" />I new aad'd'eeda eratetsaa s'uuraa k'onc'c'isseerenneeshsha! Ayaw gooppe, tumu aad'd'eeda eratetsaw laa"u kifiletuu de'iino. S'oossay neena ne ootseedda nagaraa keeshshaa muribeennawaa era.<verse eid="JOB 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 11:7" />«Neeni S'oossaa c'iimma s'uuraa k'oraade eranaw danddayay? Woy Ubbaa Danddayiyaa S'oossaa zawatuwaa koyaadde demmanaw danddayay? <verse eid="JOB 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 11:8" />Unttunttu salotuwaappekka d'ok'k'a; neeni ayinne ootsanaw danddayakka. Unttunttu Si'ooliyaappekka aad'd'eeda c'iimma; neeni eranaw danddayakka. <verse eid="JOB 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 11:9" />S'oossaa aad'd'eeda eratetsay biittaa adusatetsaappe aduk'k'ee; abbaa gomppaappekka aakkee. <verse eid="JOB 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 11:10" />I yiide, neena k'asho golliyaan yegginttonne pirdda golle shiishshintto, Aa digganaw danddayiyaawe oonee? <verse eid="JOB 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 11:11" />S'oossay patsenna asatuwaa eree; iitabaa be'iyaa wode, I c'oo aggena. <verse eid="JOB 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 11:12" />Eeya Asay aad'd'eedda eranchcha gidiyaawaappe dembbaa harii asaa gidi yelettiyaawe matee.<verse eid="JOB 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 11:13" />«Iyyoobaa, neeni ne wozanaa suure ootsooppe, ne kushiyaakka aakko mic'c'aade woossooppe, <verse eid="JOB 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 11:14" />nagaraa neeppe haassooppe, ne gollenkka iitabay de'ennaadan ootsooppe, <verse eid="JOB 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 11:15" />yaatooppe, neeni d'ok'k'u gaade yeellay bayinnan ubbabaa s'eelana; yashshiyaawe bayinnankka minnaade ek'k'ana. <verse eid="JOB 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 11:16" />Ne metuwaa ubbaakka neeni dogana; gukkeedda haatsaadan, neeni Aa laa"entso hassayakka. <verse eid="JOB 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 11:17" />Ne de'uu seeta gallassaa awaappekka aad'd'iide poo'ana; ne de'uwaa d'umaykka wontta poo'uwaa mala gidanawaa. <verse eid="JOB 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 11:18" />New hidootay de'iyaa diraw, neeni hirggennan de'ana. S'oossay neena naagiyaa diraw, neeni woppu gaananne shemppana. <verse eid="JOB 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 11:19" />Neeni gem"ishshiyaa wode, neena yashissana uray baawa; darotuu neena awuddashana. <verse eid="JOB 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 11:20" />Shin iitatuwaa ayifii k'ook'ana; aappe bak'ati attanawukka danddaykkino. Unttunttu hiddootay hayk'k'uwaa» yaageedda.<verse eid="JOB 11:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JOB 12" />
  <para style="s">Iyyoobi zaariidekka Haasayee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 12:1" />Iyyoobi zaariide, hawaadan yaageedda; <verse eid="JOB 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 12:2" />«Ee, hintte tumukka aad'd'eedda eranchcha; aad'd'eeda eratetsaa ubbaykka hinttenanna hayk'k'ana! <verse eid="JOB 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 12:3" />Shin tawukka hinttewaadan akeekay de'ee; taani hintteppe laafikke! Ha hintte haasayeeddawaa ubbaa ooninne eree. <verse eid="JOB 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 12:4" />Taani S'oossaa woossina, I siseedda asaa gidooppenne, ta laggetoo miic'c'iyaawaa kesaad; taani s'illuwaanne tooshii bayinna asaa gidooppekka, k'iliic'iyaawaa kesaad. <verse eid="JOB 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 12:5" />Hinttena ay metuunne gakkibeenna diraw, ta metuwaa kad'iita; kunddanaw ganddigaariyaa bitaniyaakka sugiita. <verse eid="JOB 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 12:6" />Bonk'k'iyaawanttu golletuu saro de'iino; S'oossaa hank'k'etsiyaawanttu hirggi bayinnan de'iino. Unttunttu kushiyaa wolk'k'ay unttunttu goyinniyaa s'oossaa.<verse eid="JOB 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 12:7" />«Shin neeni ane mehetuwaa oochcha; unttunttu neena tamaarissana. Woy saluwaa kafotuwaa oochcha; unttunttu new odana. <verse eid="JOB 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 12:8" />Woy sa'aw haasaya izakka neena tamaarisanna; abbaa moletuukka new odana. <verse eid="JOB 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 12:9" />Med'inaa Godaa kushii hawaa ootseeddawaa hawanttu ubbaa giddon erennawe oonee? <verse eid="JOB 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 12:10" />Pas'a de'iyaa med'etatuwaa ubbaa de'uunne asaa ubbaa ayaanay Aa kushiyaanna. <verse eid="JOB 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 12:11" />Ins's'arssay k'umaa shaakki eriyaawaadan, haytsay haasayaa shaakkiide erenneeyye?<verse eid="JOB 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 12:12" />«Aad'd'eeda eratetsay c'imeedda asatuu matan de'ee; daro wodiyaa de'iyaawe akeekaa immee. <verse eid="JOB 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 12:13" />S'oossaw aad'd'eeda eratetsaynne wolk'k'ay de'ee; zoriinne akeekay an beettee. <verse eid="JOB 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 12:14" />S'oossay k'oleeddawaa zaaretsi kees's'anawe oonee? I k'achcheeda uraakka billi yeddanawe oonee? <verse eid="JOB 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 12:15" />S'oossay iraa te"ooppe, biittay melee; I iraa bukissooppe, di'uu biittaa bayzzee.<verse eid="JOB 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 12:16" />«Minotetsaynne s'oonuu S'oossaawaa; c'imettiyaawenne c'immiyaawenne laa"uukka aappe garssaana de'iino. <verse eid="JOB 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 12:17" />Zoriyaawanttuppe I aad'd'eeda eraa k'aari akkee; Daannatuwaakka I eeyaa kesee. <verse eid="JOB 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 12:18" />I kaatetuwaa kaatetuwaa araataappe wotsee; unttunttakka ayiletuwaa ootsee. <verse eid="JOB 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 12:19" />K'eesetuwaappekka bonchchuwaa k'aari akkee; wolk'k'aamatuwaakka aatsi yeggee. <verse eid="JOB 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 12:20" />Ammanetteeda asatuwaakka c'o"u ootsee; c'imatuwaappekka akeekaa wotsi akkee. <verse eid="JOB 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 12:21" />Kaappatuwaa kawushshee; deriyaa kaaletsiyaawanttu wolk'k'aakka wurssee.<verse eid="JOB 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 12:22" />«D'uman de'iyaa S'uura yewotuwaa k'onc'c'issee; d'ip'p'i go d'uma sa'aakka poo'o kessee. <verse eid="JOB 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 12:23" />S'oossay kawutetsatuwaa d'ok'k'isee; k'ay s'oonee. Kawutetsaakka aassee; k'ay d'ayissee. <verse eid="JOB 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 12:24" />Sa'aa asaa kaappatuwaa akeekaa diggiide, ogii bayinna mela sa'aan toyilakattanaadan ootsee. <verse eid="JOB 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 12:25" />Poo'uu bayinna d'uman unttunttu tattaafiino; matsotteedda asatuwaadan unttunttu ganddigaariino.<verse eid="JOB 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JOB 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 13:1" />«Hawaa ubbaa ta ayifii be'eedda; ta haytsaykka sisiide akeekeedda. <verse eid="JOB 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 13:2" />Hintte eriyaawaa taanikka eray; taani hintteppe laafikke. <verse eid="JOB 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 13:3" />Shin taani Ubbaa Danddayiyaa S'oossaw haasayanaw koyay; hinttenanna gidenna. Taani ta mootuwaa aanana mootettanaw amottay. <verse eid="JOB 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 13:4" />Hintte tumuwaa wordduwaan kammiita; hintte ubbaykka patsenna aakimatuwaa. <verse eid="JOB 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 13:5" />Hintte ubbay c'o"u geedda gideerikkiteeshsha! Yaatintto, hinttena Asay aad'd'eeda eranchcha gaana shin!<verse eid="JOB 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 13:6" />«Ha"i ta mootuwaa sisite; ta doonaappe kesiyaa palumiyaa hayzzite. <verse eid="JOB 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 13:7" />Hintte S'oossaa doonaa gidiide, wordduwaa haasayiiteeyye? Aa diraw ek'k'iide, c'imuwaa haasayiiteeyye? <verse eid="JOB 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 13:8" />Hintte Aa maaddiyaawe de'ii? Woy aw abakkaatto gidiide mootettiitee? <verse eid="JOB 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 13:9" />I hinttena pilggi s'eellintto, hintteppe lo"obaa demmanee? Hintte asaa c'immiyaawaadan, Aa c'immanaw danddayiiteeyye? <verse eid="JOB 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 13:10" />Hintte geeman asaa som"uwaa s'eelliide maaddooppe, S'oossay tumu hinttena seerana. <verse eid="JOB 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 13:11" />Aa bonchchuu hinttena dagantsennee? Aa anggay hinttena yashshennee? <verse eid="JOB 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 13:12" />Hintte odiyaa leemisotuu bidintsaa mala patsennawantta; hintte shiishshiyaa palumii urk'k'aappe med'etteedda gonddalliyaa mala.<verse eid="JOB 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 13:13" />«Ane c'o"u giite! haasayana; hawaappe guyyiyaan, bare hanowaa hano. <verse eid="JOB 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 13:14" />Taani ta huup'iyaa ayaw hirggaa garssan wotsaytaa? Ta shemppuwaakka ayaw ta kushiyaan oyk'k'aytaa? <verse eid="JOB 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 13:15" />Be'ite, S'oossay taana wod'iyaawaa gidooppenne, taani Aa danddayan naagana. Gidooppenne, taani ta mootuwaa Aa sintsa shiishshana. <verse eid="JOB 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 13:16" />Nagaranchcha Asay Aa sintsa shiik'anaw danddayenna diraw; hawe taani shiik'anaw s'aliyaawe, ooni erii, ta atotetsaw gaaso gidanaw danddayee. <verse eid="JOB 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 13:17" />Ta haasayaa akeekiide sisite; taani odiyaawe hintte haytsaan gelo. <verse eid="JOB 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 13:18" />Be'ite, taani ta mootuwaa giigissaaddi; shatimmanawaakka eray.<verse eid="JOB 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 13:19" />«Abeet S'oossaw, neeni taana mootanaw yay? Neeni taana bayzzanchcha kessooppe, taani c'o"u gaade hayk'k'ana. <verse eid="JOB 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 13:20" />Shin neeni taw ha laa"ubatuwaa ootsa; taani neeppe geemmikke. <verse eid="JOB 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 13:21" />Taana muriyaawaa agga; ne anggaan taana dagantsoppa. <verse eid="JOB 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 13:22" />Hewaappe guyyiyaan, taana s'eesa; taani koyana. Woy taani haasayina, taw zaaraadde haasaya. <verse eid="JOB 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 13:23" />Barew, taani bayzzeedda bayzzuunne nagaray aappunee? Ta balaanne ta nagaraa ane taana bessa.<verse eid="JOB 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 13:24" />«Neeni ayaw ne som"uwaa taappe gentsay? K'ay taana ayaw ne morkkiyaadan payday? <verse eid="JOB 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 13:25" />Taana, c'arkkuu afiyaa bonc'c'iyaa malaa, yashissayii? Woy meleedda suullaa malaa yederssay? <verse eid="JOB 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 13:26" />Neeni ta bolla s'aafeedda mootuu c'ama; haray attina, taani yalagatetsan de'aadde ootseedda bayzzuwaanne ashshabaakka. <verse eid="JOB 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 13:27" />Neeni ta gediyaa gediyaa birataan k'achchaadda; ta tanggiyaa tangguwaa ubbaa wochchaasa; ta gediyaa kottiyaa pilgga s'eellaasa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 33:11">Yob. 33:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JOB 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 13:28" />Taani wook'k'eeddabaadan hanay; bil"ay meedda afilaadankka wook'k'ay.<verse eid="JOB 13:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JOB 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 14:1" />«Mac'c'a asaappe yeletteedda asaa laytsay k'antsa; hewaa keeshshaakka metuwaan kumi utteedda. <verse eid="JOB 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 14:2" />I c'iishshaadan c'iishshiide, ellekka k'ok'k'ofetti aggee; k'ay gam"ennan kuwaadan ellekka aad'd'i kichchee. <verse eid="JOB 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 14:3" />Yaatina neeni, S'oossay, hewaa mala asaakka s'eellay? K'ay Aa pirddanaw ne sintsa shiishshay? <verse eid="JOB 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 14:4" />Tunabaappe geeshshabaa kessanaw danddayiyaawe oonee? Ooninne baawa. <verse eid="JOB 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 14:5" />Asay de'ana laytsatuu zawati utteeddino; I de'ana aginaakka neeni payda wotsaadda; neeni wotseedda zawaappe aad'd'iyaawe baawa. <verse eid="JOB 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 14:6" />Hewaa diraw, keraa ootsiyaa Asay bare oosuwaa poliide shemppiyaawaadan, Asay bare daabura laytsaa poliide shemppanaadan, Aa agga.<verse eid="JOB 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 14:7" />«Mitsawukka hidootay de'ee; mitsay k'ans's'ooppe aac'ee; aac'aykka hewaadan haniidde, de'i bashee. <verse eid="JOB 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 14:8" />He mitsaa s'ap'uu biittaa garssan ec'inttokka, Aa durumaykka biittan wook'k'ooppekka, <verse eid="JOB 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 14:9" />haatsaa peenuwaa demmiide aac'ee; puutiyaadan ooratsa lic'uwaa kessee.<verse eid="JOB 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 14:10" />«Shin Asay hayk'k'ina, Aa wolk'k'ay wuree; Aa shemppuu kesowaappe hini baggan, I hak'an de'ii? <verse eid="JOB 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 14:11" />Abbaappe haatsay meliyaawaadan, k'ay shaafaa haatsaykka to'iyaawaadan, <verse eid="JOB 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 14:12" />hewaadan asaykka hayk'k'ee; he sa'aappe denddenna. Salotuu aad'd'ana gakkanawukka Asay beegottena; bare gem"ishshuwaappekka denddenna.<verse eid="JOB 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 14:13" />«Abeet S'oossaw, neeni taana duufo giddon gentsaade, ne hank'k'uu aad'd'ana gakkanaw k'oseeddawaa gidaarikkiishsha! Neeni taw keeruwaa immaade, he gallassi taana hassayeeddawaa gidaarikkiishsha! <verse eid="JOB 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 14:14" />Itti Asay hayk'k'ooppe, simmiide pas'anee? Ta laamii yaana gakkanaw, ha tugga wodiyaa ubbaa danddayan naagana. <verse eid="JOB 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 14:15" />Neeni med'd'eedda taanakka be'anaw neeni laamotiyaa wode, neeni taana s'eesana; taani new koyana. <verse eid="JOB 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 14:16" />He wodiyaan, neeni tumuwaappe ta tangguwaa wochchana; shin ta nagaraa ta bolla paydakka. <verse eid="JOB 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 14:17" />Ta bayzzuu k'arc'c'iitaa giddon yiic'ettana; ta nagaraakka neeni kammana.<verse eid="JOB 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 14:18" />«Derii kunddiyaanne me"erettiyaawaadan, zaallaykka d'ok'olettiyaawaadan, <verse eid="JOB 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 14:19" />haatsaykka shuchchaa bookkiyaawaadaaninne di'uukka biittaa meec'c'iide afiyaawaadan, hewaadan neenikka asaa hidootaa d'ayissaasa. <verse eid="JOB 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 14:20" />Neeni Aa med'inaw s'oonaasa; yaatooppe I bi aggee. Aa malaa laammaadde, ne sintsappe yeddaasa. <verse eid="JOB 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 14:21" />Aa naanatuu bonchchettooppe, hewaa I erenna; unttunttu tooshettooppekka be'enna. <verse eid="JOB 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 14:22" />Shin Aa bollaa seelay Aa s'alalaw sisettee; I bare s'alalaw yeekkee» yaageedda.<verse eid="JOB 14:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JOB 15" />
  <para style="s">Elifaazi Laa"entso Haasayeedda Haasayaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 15:1" />Hewaappe Temaana biittaappe yeedda Elifaazi hawaadan yaagiide zaareedda; <verse eid="JOB 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 15:2" />«Aad'd'eeda eranchcha Asay c'arkkuwaadan oyk'k'ettennawaa haasayii? Woy k'ohiyaa k'ofaan bare uluwaa kuntsanaw bessii? <verse eid="JOB 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 15:3" />Patsenna k'aalaan woy maaddenna k'aalaan mootuwaa mootettii? <verse eid="JOB 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 15:4" />Hewaa gidooppe, neeni S'oossaw yayyiyaawaa aggaada; haratuukka S'oossaw goyinnennaadan diggaassa. <verse eid="JOB 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 15:5" />Ne iitatetsay ne haasayan erettee; shin ne c'inc'c'a haasayaan kamanaw baas'etaassa. <verse eid="JOB 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 15:6" />Ne bolla pirddiyaawe ne doonaappe attina, taana gidikke; ne ins's'arssay ne bolla markkattee.<verse eid="JOB 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 15:7" />«Koyiro asaappe sintsa yeletteeddawe neenee? Woy neeni deretuu med'ettanaappe kase yelettaaddii? <verse eid="JOB 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 15:8" />Neeni S'oossaa S'uura shiik'uwaa sisaadii? Woy aad'd'eeda eratetsaa ne s'alalay eriyaawaa new malatii? <verse eid="JOB 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 15:9" />Nuuni erennawaa neeni eriyaawe ayee? Nuw gelennaan aggiide, new geleeddawe ayee? <verse eid="JOB 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 15:10" />Ne aawuwaappe bayirattiyaa asatuu, c'imiide puulummeedda asatuu nu giddon de'iino.<verse eid="JOB 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 15:11" />«S'oossay new immeedda mintsetsuunne nuuni new ashkketetsan haasayeedda k'aalay guus'eeddee? <verse eid="JOB 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 15:12" />Ne wozanay neena ayaw wora afii? Ne ayifiikka ayaw s'eelaa derek'k'ii? <verse eid="JOB 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 15:13" />Yaataade neeni S'oossaa bolla hank'k'ettaadda; hewaa mala k'aalaakka ne doonaappe kessaadda. <verse eid="JOB 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 15:14" />Asay S'oossaa sintsan geeshsha gidanaw danddayii? Woy mac'c'a asaappe yeletteedda Asay s'illuwaa gidanaw danddayii?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:14-16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 25:4-6">Yob. 25:4-6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JOB 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 15:15" />Be'a, S'oossay bare kiitanchchatuwaankka ammanettena; haray atto salotuukka Aa sintsan geeshsha gidikkino. <verse eid="JOB 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 15:16" />Shin ha sheneyiyaanne tuneedda asay, nagaraakka haatsaadan ganiyaa Asay waan amanetannee!<verse eid="JOB 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 15:17" />«Iyyoobaa, ane sisa! new odana; taani be'eeddawaa ubbaa new odana. <verse eid="JOB 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 15:18" />Aad'd'eeda eranchcha asatuu barenttu mayzza aawotuwaappe demmeedda eratetsaa gentsennan taana tamaarisseeddino. <verse eid="JOB 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 15:19" />Ha biittay unttunttu s'alalaw imetteedda; hara biittaa Asay unttunttu wozanaa S'oossaappe wora zaaribeenna.<verse eid="JOB 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 15:20" />«Asaa uk'k'unniide de'iyaa iita asay, bare de'uwaa laytsaa ubbaan tuggi aappe shaakkettenna. <verse eid="JOB 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 15:21" />Ubbaa gede dagantsiyaa kooshshay Aa haytsaan sisettee; I saro de'ay giishina, panggatuu Aa bolla yaana. <verse eid="JOB 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 15:22" />D'umaappe kessi akkanawaa I ammanenna; I mashshaw kaac'etteedda. <verse eid="JOB 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 15:23" />Aa anhay ankkoo k'uma gidanawaa; barew d'uma gallassay matatteeddawaa I eree. <verse eid="JOB 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 15:24" />Metuunne tuggay Aa yashissana; olaw keseedda kaatiyaadan Aa dagantsana. <verse eid="JOB 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 15:25" />Ayaw gooppe, I bare kushiyaa S'oossaa bolla dentseedda; Ubbaa Danddayiyaa S'oossaa bollakka s'aleedda. <verse eid="JOB 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 15:26" />Minonne orddo gonddalliyaa oyk'k'iide, S'oossaa bolla makkaleedda.<verse eid="JOB 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 15:27" />«Aa som"ii mod'd'eedda diraw, Aa s'eessaykka boborc'c'eedda diraw, <verse eid="JOB 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 15:28" />I laattiide de'iyaa katamatuukka olan laaletteedda dirawunne I de'iyaa gollatuukka ooninne de'enna ona gideedda diraw, <verse eid="JOB 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 15:29" />I bare duretetsan daro gam"enna; Aa ak'uukka aanana gam"enna; biittaa bollankka aakena.<verse eid="JOB 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 15:30" />«D'umaappe I kessi akkena; Aa tashetuwaa lac'uu melissana; Aa c'iishshaakka S'oossaa c'arkkuu pitti d'ayissana. <verse eid="JOB 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 15:31" />Barekka barena c'immiidde, hadaban ammanettoppa. I akkanabaykka hadabaa. <verse eid="JOB 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 15:32" />Wodii gakkennan shulliyaanne meli simmiide, laa"entso aac'anaw danddayenna mitsaa mala I gidanawaa. <verse eid="JOB 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 15:33" />Teerennaan wurc'c'uwaanna k'ok'k'ofettiyaa woyniyaa malanne c'iishshay k'ok'k'ofettiyaa wogaraa mala I gidanawaa. <verse eid="JOB 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 15:34" />S'oossaw yayyena asatoo zarii d'ayana; mattaayiyaan kees'etteedda golliyaakka tamay maana. <verse eid="JOB 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 15:35" />Unttunttu metuwaa shahaariide, iitabaa yeliino; unttunttu wozanaankka c'imuu kumi utteedda» yaageedda.<verse eid="JOB 15:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JOB 16" />
  <para style="s">Iyyoobi Zaariidekka Haasayee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 16:1" />Iyyoobi hawaadan yaagiide zaareedda; <verse eid="JOB 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 16:2" />«Hawaa mala haasayaa daruwaa sisaad; hintte mintsetseetto giidde, taana metiyaawantta. <verse eid="JOB 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 16:3" />Ha go"ay bayinna hintte haasayaw wurssetsi baawee? Taananna hinttena hawaa keeshshaa palumissiyaa gaasuu ayee? <verse eid="JOB 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 16:4" />Hintte ta sa'aan de'ina, taani hintte sa'aan de'eeddawaa gidintto, taanikka ta huup'iyaa kad'iyaan k'aatsaadde, ha"i hintte giyaawaa ubbaa hintte bolla loytsaade haasayana shin! <verse eid="JOB 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 16:5" />Hewaadankka, ta zoriyaan taani hinttena mintsana shin! Ta doonaappe kesiyaa haasayaykka hinttena mintsetsana shin!<verse eid="JOB 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 16:6" />«Shin taani haasayinttokka, ta sakuu keekenna; taani c'o"u gaade danddayinttokka, taappe kichchenna. <verse eid="JOB 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 16:7" />Abeet S'oossaw, neeni taana dippi ootsaadda; ta golliyaa asaa ubbaakka d'ayissaadda. <verse eid="JOB 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 16:8" />Neeni ta galbbaa melissaaddanne gunddissaadda; ta bollaakka gilk'k'issaadda. Hewaa diraw, Asay taana be'iide, ‹Hawe I nagaranchcha gidiyaawoo markka› yaagee. <verse eid="JOB 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 16:9" />S'oossay bare hank'k'uwaan taana duuseretsi yeggeedda; bare achchaakka ta bolla garc'c'eedda; I ta morkkii taana derek'k'ee. <verse eid="JOB 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 16:10" />Asatuu ta yuushshuwaan shiik'eeddino; ta bolla k'iliic'iidde, ta k'ins's'alliyaa bak'k'eeddino. <verse eid="JOB 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 16:11" />S'oossay iitaa ootsiyaa asatoo taana aatsiide immeedda; geelatuwaa kushiyankka I taana oleedda.<verse eid="JOB 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 16:12" />«Taani kase woppu gaade de'aaddi; shin S'oossay taana kinchchereetseedda; ta murggaac'iyaa oyk'k'iide, I taana mentsereetseedda. K'ay I taana s'onggi dechchanaw malla ootseedda; <verse eid="JOB 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 16:13" />Aa wonddaafiyaa pootsay taana yaana haana mudeeddino. K'areti bayinnan I ta kilahuwaa c'addiide, ta c'ishshiyaa ta tiriyaappe sa'aan gussee. <verse eid="JOB 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 16:14" />Olanaw wos's'iyaa olanchchaadan, I taana zaari zaariide madutsee. <verse eid="JOB 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 16:15" />Taani kayyottaade, maak'aa mayyaad; ta wolk'k'aykka baanan oletteedda. <verse eid="JOB 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 16:16" />Taani yeekkiyaa yeekuwaa daruwaan ta ayfii galjjeedda; afotsaappe denddowaan ta ayifiikka zo"eedda. <verse eid="JOB 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 16:17" />Shin ha ubbankka taani bayzzeeddawe baawa; ta woosaykka geeshsha.<verse eid="JOB 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 16:18" />«Biittaw, biittaw, ta suutsaa kammoppa; taani waassanawaa diggoppa. <verse eid="JOB 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 16:19" />Ha"ikka ta markkay saluwaana;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 19:25">Yob. 19:25</ref></char></note> taw s'abak'atiyaawe bolla d'ok'k'aana. <verse eid="JOB 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 16:20" />Ta laggetuu taana kad'iide s'eelliino; ta ayifii S'oossaa sintsan afotsaa tigee. <verse eid="JOB 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 16:21" />Asay bare lagetsaw gaanatiyaawaadan, taana S'oossaanna sigetsiyaa Asay de'eedda gideerenneeshsha! <verse eid="JOB 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 16:22" />Ayaw gooppe, amareeda laytsatuu aad'd'eedawaappe guyyiyaan, taani simmennasaa baana.<verse eid="JOB 16:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JOB 17" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 17:1" />«Ta shemppatta kesaw; ta laytsay k'aammeedda; taw duufuu giigi utteedda. <verse eid="JOB 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 17:2" />Taana k'iliic'iyaawanttu tumuwaappe ta yuushshuwaan de'iino; unttunttu taw hank'k'etiyaa hank'k'uwaa ubbaa gede taani be'ay.<verse eid="JOB 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 17:3" />«Abeet S'oossaw, neeppe haray taana maaddiyaawe bayinna diraw, neeni ne huup'iyaan taw waase gida. <verse eid="JOB 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 17:4" />Unttunttoo gelennaadan, neeni ta laggetsatuwaa wozanaa donc'c'ilisaadda. Hewaa diraw, neeni unttunttoo s'oonuwaa immoppa. <verse eid="JOB 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 17:5" />Miishshaa demmana giide, bare laggetuwaa aatsi immiyaa asaa nagaray Aa naanatuwaa kaa'ana.<verse eid="JOB 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 17:6" />«S'oossay taana asaa ubbaw k'iliic'iyaawaa kesseedda; Asay som"uwaan c'uchchiyaa asaa taani gidaaddi. <verse eid="JOB 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 17:7" />Taani daro kayyotteedda diraw, ta ayifiikka galjjeedda; ta kumentsaa asatetsay laafiidde, s'ink'k'uwaa keeshshaa gideeddino. <verse eid="JOB 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 17:8" />Keeka asatuu taana be'iide dagammeeddino; suuretuukka S'oossaa kaddiyaawanttu bolla yiloteeddino. <verse eid="JOB 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 17:9" />Gidooppenne, s'illotuu barenttu ogiyaappe yaakka haakka simmikkino; suuretuu wolk'k'aa gujji gujji biino. <verse eid="JOB 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 17:10" />Shin ha"i ubbaykka ane taakko haa yiite! Yinttokka, taani hintte giddon itti aad'd'eeda eranchcha asaakka demmikke.<verse eid="JOB 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 17:11" />«Ta de'uwaa laytsay wureedda; ta halchcheedda halchchuukka ta wozanaa amuukka c'oo atteedda. <verse eid="JOB 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 17:12" />Ta laggetuu k'ammaa gallassaa giino; d'umi utti de'ishshin, ‹Poo'ana hanee› yaagiino. <verse eid="JOB 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 17:13" />Taani hidootaan naagiyaa ta gollii duufuwaa; ta hiis'aakka yaan d'uman hiis's'ana. <verse eid="JOB 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 17:14" />Duufuwaa taani, ‹Neeni ta aawuwaa› yaagana; gus'uniyaakka, ‹Neeni ta aato› woy ‹Ta michchato› yaagana. <verse eid="JOB 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 17:15" />Yaatina, ta hidootay hak'anee? Ooni Aa be'eeddee? <verse eid="JOB 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 17:16" />Ta hidootay taananna duufuwaa banddee? Nuuni laa"uu ittippe biittan duge wod'd'aneeshsha?» yaageedda.<verse eid="JOB 17:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JOB 18" />
  <para style="s">Bilddaade Laa"entso Haasayaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 18:1" />Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Shuuha biittaappe yeedda Bilddaade hawaadan yaagiide zaareedda; <verse eid="JOB 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 18:2" />«Iyyoobaa, neeni ha haasayaa awude wurssay? Ane akeeka. Yaatooppe nuuni haasayana. <verse eid="JOB 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 18:3" />Nuuna ayaw miizza kessay? Ayaw nuuna donc'c'illowantta kessay? <verse eid="JOB 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 18:4" />Neeni ne hank'k'uwaan neena k'ohaasa. Ne hank'k'uwaan biittay mela gidanee? Woy zaallatuu barenttu sa'aappe d'ok'k'olettanee?<verse eid="JOB 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 18:5" />«Nagaranchchatuwaa de'uu s'omppii to'iyaawaadan to'anawe geeshsha; I laa"entso mulekka ees's'enna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:5-6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 21:17">Yob. 21:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JOB 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 18:6" />I s'omppii bayinna golliyaa mala; Aa matan de'iyaa s'omppiikka to'ee. <verse eid="JOB 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 18:7" />I tanggiyaa tangguukka k'aammee; I haratuwaa zoriyaa zorii Aa unggee.<verse eid="JOB 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 18:8" />«Aa hametay Aa afiide, p'iriyaan gelissee; diizzaa giddon I hamettee. <verse eid="JOB 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 18:9" />P'irii Aa ginddiyaa oyk'k'ee; Aa k'aatsuwaa diggee. <verse eid="JOB 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 18:10" />Aw yurddo wodoruu geeman sa'aan hiis'etti uttee; I hamettiyaa ogiyaankka gitii wod'd'i uttee.<verse eid="JOB 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 18:11" />«Dagamay Aa dooddee; Aa guyyenakka yederssee; <verse eid="JOB 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 18:12" />Aa wolk'k'ay koshaan daabureedda; bashshay Aa matan naagee. <verse eid="JOB 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 18:13" />Wod'iyaa harggii Aa bollan ubbaan dooddee; Aa kushiyaanne Aa gediyaa duushissee. <verse eid="JOB 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 18:14" />I hirggi bayinnan de'iyaa bare golliyaappe yedersseettee; unttunttu asaa ubbaa mooddiyaa Hayk'k'uwaa giyaa kaatiyaakko, Aa afiino. <verse eid="JOB 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 18:15" />Harggiyaa yederssanaw diiniyaa laalowaappe guyyiyaan, ooninne Aa golliyaan de'ana. <verse eid="JOB 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 18:16" />I s'ap'uu garssaana meliyaanne k'ankkatuukka bollaanna k'ok'k'ofettiyaa mitsaa mala gidee. <verse eid="JOB 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 18:17" />Aa worii biittaappe d'ayee; Aa suntsaykka sa'aan hassayettennan attee. <verse eid="JOB 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 18:18" />I poo'uwaappe d'umaw yederssettana; Asay de'iyaa biittaappekka I d'ayana. <verse eid="JOB 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 18:19" />Aw na'ay woy zarii d'ayana; I de'eedda sa'aan itti asaynne pas'a de'enna. <verse eid="JOB 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 18:20" />Away doliyaa bagga Asay Aa gakkeeddawaan dagammee; away wulliyaa bagga asaykka yashshan kokkoree. <verse eid="JOB 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 18:21" />Awudekka iita asatuwaa wurssetsay hewaa mala; S'oossaa erennawanttu kaac'aykka hewaa mala» yaageedda.<verse eid="JOB 18:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JOB 19" />
  <para style="s">Iyyoobi Zaariidekka Haasayee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 19:1" />Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Iyyoobi zaariide, hawaadan yaageedda; <verse eid="JOB 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 19:2" />«Hintte taana awude gakkanaw un"etsiitee? Awude gakkanaw hintte k'aalan taana gaac'c'iitee? <verse eid="JOB 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 19:3" />Hintte taana tammu gede boreedditta; taana kawushshiiddikka yeellatikkita. <verse eid="JOB 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 19:4" />Taani tumu baleeddawaa gidinttokka, ta balay taana oochchana. <verse eid="JOB 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 19:5" />Hintte taappe keekkiyaawaa hinttew malatina, ‹Hawe metuu ubbay Aa gakkeeddawe, I bayzzeedda dirassa› yaagiide, ta bolla pirddiita. <verse eid="JOB 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 19:6" />Shin ha metuwaa ubbaa ta bolla gatseeddawenne gitiyaan taana gelisseeddawe S'oossaa gidiyaawaa erite.<verse eid="JOB 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 19:7" />«Taani, ‹Naak'ettaadi› yaagaade waassina, taw alliyaawe baawa; k'aalaa d'ok'k'u ootsaade, suure pirddaw waassinakka, sisiyaawe baawa. <verse eid="JOB 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 19:8" />Taani aad'd'enaadan S'oossay ta ogiyaa direedda; ta hamettiyaasaakka d'uman goozeedda. <verse eid="JOB 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 19:9" />Ta duretetsaa taappe k'aareedda; ta bonchchuwaakka taappe diggeedda. <verse eid="JOB 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 19:10" />I taana ubbaa baggana mentsereetsi yegeedda; ta hidootaakka s'ap'uwaanna d'ok'k'oletteedda mitsaa mala ootseedda. <verse eid="JOB 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 19:11" />Aa hank'k'uu ta bolla ees's'i keseedda; I taana bare morkkiyaadan paydee. <verse eid="JOB 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 19:12" />Ta bolla dooddanaw I bare olanchchatuwaa kiittee; unttunttu taana olanaw ogiyaa giigisiino; ta dunkkaaniyaa yuushshuwaakka dooddiino.<verse eid="JOB 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 19:13" />«S'oossay ta ishatuwaa taappe haasseedda; taana eriyaawanttu ubbaanna taw allaga gideeddino. <verse eid="JOB 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 19:14" />Ta dabbotuu taappe shaakketteeddino; ta laggetuukka taana dogeeddino. <verse eid="JOB 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 19:15" />Ta son imatsatetsaan mokkowanttu taana dogeeddino; ta mac'c'a k'oomatuukka taana imatsaadaaninne betiyaadan s'eelliino. <verse eid="JOB 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 19:16" />Taani ta k'oomaa s'eegina, taw koyenna; taani woossinakka, taw eeno geena. <verse eid="JOB 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 19:17" />Ta machata ta doonaa peenuwaa is's'aaddu; ta ishatuukka taana shenetiino. <verse eid="JOB 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 19:18" />Haray attina, guutsa naanatuukka taana kad'iino; taana s'eeliyaa wode, ta bolla k'iliic'iino. <verse eid="JOB 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 19:19" />Ta mata laggetsatuu ubbay taana shenetiino; taani siik'iyaawanttukka taw zokkiyaa zaareeddino. <verse eid="JOB 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 19:20" />Ta mek'etsay ta galbbaana oyk'k'etteedda; hayk'k'uwaappe laafasan taani ataad.<verse eid="JOB 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 19:21" />«Hinttenoo ta laggetoo, S'oossaa kushii taana dechcheedda diraw, taw k'arettite. <verse eid="JOB 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 19:22" />S'oossay taana yederssiyaawaadan, hintte taana ayaw yederssiite? Hanno gakkanaw hintte taana tuggayeeddawe gidennee?<verse eid="JOB 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 19:23" />«Hanno gakkanaw taani haasayeedda k'aalay, woy hassayetteedda gideerenneeshsha! Mas'aafankka woy s'aafetteedda gideerenneeshsha! <verse eid="JOB 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 19:24" />Daro gam"ana mala, birataa marssan zaallaa bollan wooc'ettiide s'aafetteerenneeshsha!<verse eid="JOB 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 19:25" />«Taana Wozeeddawe pas'a de'iyaawaanne wurssetsan biittaa bollan I ek'k'anawaa taani eray. <verse eid="JOB 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 19:26" />Ta galbbay meetetti wurooppenne, taani ta ashuwaappe shaakkettaade, S'oossaa be'anawaa eray. <verse eid="JOB 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 19:27" />Hara uraa gidennaan, taani ta huup'iyaan, ta ayifiyaan Aa be'ana. Hewaa diraw, ta wozanay ayaa laamotii!<verse eid="JOB 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 19:28" />«Hintte, ‹Metoo unkkuu Aa gideedda diraw, ane haayite! Aa yedersseetto!› gooppe, <verse eid="JOB 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 19:29" />mashshaw yayyite! S'oossaa hank'k'uu mashshaana yaana; pirdday de'iyaawaakka erite» yaageedda.<verse eid="JOB 19:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JOB 20" />
  <para style="s">S'oofaara Laa"entso Haasayaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 20:1" />Naa'ima biittaappe yeedda S'oofaari hawaadan yaagiide zaareedda; <verse eid="JOB 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 20:2" />«Ne haasayay taana hank'k'etseedda diraw, taani ayinne gam"ennan ne haasayaw zaaruwaa immana. <verse eid="JOB 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 20:3" />Ne shek'k'aa haasayaa taani sisaad; aw bessiyaa zaaruwaa taana imma imma gee.<verse eid="JOB 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 20:4" />«Asaa biittaa bolla wotseedda wodiyaappe doommiide, benippekka nagaranchcha asatuwaa c'eek'uu k'antsa wodiyaassa gidiyaawaa eraasa; <verse eid="JOB 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 20:5" />S'oossaa erenna asatuwaa nashechchaykka lip'eedda ayifii s'eellanaassa gidiyaawaa neeni eraasa; <verse eid="JOB 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 20:6" />Iita Asay shaariyaa gakkanaw aduk'k'ooppekka, Aa huup'p'iikka shaariyaa bochchooppe, <verse eid="JOB 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 20:7" />I panddaadan pitetti d'ayana. Aa eriyaa ubbay, ‹I hak'an de'ii?› yaagana. <verse eid="JOB 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 20:8" />Akumuwaadan I paalli d'ayana; simmiidekka beettena; k'ammaa sas'aadan I d'ayi bashana. <verse eid="JOB 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 20:9" />Aa be'eedda ayifetuu laa"entsiide, Aa be'ikkino; I bare de'iyaasaappekka tippi giide d'ayana. <verse eid="JOB 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 20:10" />Iita aawuu bonk'k'i akkeedda miishshaa Aa naanatuu barenttu kushiyan guyye zaariide hiyeesatoo c'iggana. <verse eid="JOB 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 20:11" />Wolk'k'an kumeedda Aa yalagatetsaa minotay guutsa wodiyaappe guyyiyaan, biittaa kesana.<verse eid="JOB 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 20:12" />«Iita asaa doonaan iitatetsay k'umaadan mal"inttokka, I bare ins's'arssaappe garssa baggana gentsooppekka, <verse eid="JOB 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 20:13" />wurennaadan bare doonaan c'oommiide, wotsi bashinttokka, <verse eid="JOB 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 20:14" />Aa ulo giddon Aa k'umay laamettana; wod'iyaa shooshshaa yishshaa mala aw gidanawaa. <verse eid="JOB 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 20:15" />Iita bitanii bare mitteedda duretetsaa haa c'uchchana; Aa uluwaappe S'oossay c'ooshshiide kessana. <verse eid="JOB 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 20:16" />Iita bitanii mittiyaabay aw yishsha gidanawaa; shooshshaa yishshaa mala gidiide, Aa wod'ana. <verse eid="JOB 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 20:17" />Eessaynne maatsay haatsaadan goggishina, I be'ennaan hayk'k'ana. <verse eid="JOB 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 20:18" />Bare daabureedda daaburaa c'awaa meennaan, haraw sheed'd'ana; zal"iide wod'iseedda bare wod'iyaankka nashettena. <verse eid="JOB 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 20:19" />Ayaw gooppe, hiyyeesatuwaa I un"etseedda; unttuntta sheneko geedda; hara Asay kees's'eedda golliyaakka barew akkeedda.<verse eid="JOB 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 20:20" />«Aa yoraw zaway baawa; bare dosiyaawaa kallanaw danddayenna; <verse eid="JOB 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 20:21" />I meeddawaappe guyyiyaan, ayaynne de'enna. Hewaa diraw, Aa duretetsay gam"enna. <verse eid="JOB 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 20:22" />I daro mas'uwaa demmiyaa wode, metuu Aa bolla gakki wod'd'ana. <verse eid="JOB 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 20:23" />I miide kalliyaa wode, S'oossay Aa muranaw bare suulliyaa hank'k'uwaa Aa bolla gussana. <verse eid="JOB 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 20:24" />Birataa mashshaappe I bak'atana; shin naasiyaa aday Aa c'addanawaa. <verse eid="JOB 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 20:25" />He aday aw zokkiyaanna kantsi kesana; he p'ooliyaa s'eeray Aa tiriyaa aad'd'iidde, c'ishshiyaa gussana. Dagamaan Aa wozanay shabbarettana.<verse eid="JOB 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 20:26" />«I shiishsheedda ak'uwaa ubbay d'ayana; Asay eetsibeenna tamay Aa maana; Aa golliyaan atteeda Asay ubbaykka taman meetettana. <verse eid="JOB 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 20:27" />Salotuu ha bitaniyaa nagaraa k'onc'c'issana; biittaykka Aa bolla markkattana. <verse eid="JOB 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 20:28" />S'oossay hank'k'ettiide ahiyaa beetan Aa golliinne aw de'iyaabay ubbay shokettiide baana. <verse eid="JOB 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 20:29" />S'oossay iita asatoo wotseedda kaac'ay; S'oossaappe gisheteedda gishuu hawaa» yaageedda.<verse eid="JOB 20:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JOB 21" />
  <para style="s">Iyyoobi Zaariidekka Haasayee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 21:1" />Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Iyyoobi hawaadan yaagiide zaareedda; <verse eid="JOB 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 21:2" />«Ane ta haasayaa akeekiide hayzzite; sisiyaawe hintte taana mintsetsiyaawaa gidi paydetto. <verse eid="JOB 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 21:3" />Taani itti gedenne haasayanaw taw kaac'aa immite. Taani haasaya simmina, k'iliic'ite! <verse eid="JOB 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 21:4" />Taani mootettiyaawe asaana gidenna. Yaatina, taw danddayay wurooppe, hewe malalissiyaawe? <verse eid="JOB 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 21:5" />Ane taana s'eellite; malaletite; hintte kushiyankka hintte doonaa oyk'k'ite. <verse eid="JOB 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 21:6" />Taana gakkeeddawaa taani k'oppiyaa wodekka, taana dagantsee; ta bollaykka kokkoree.<verse eid="JOB 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 21:7" />«Iita asatuu ayaw pas'a de'ino? Unttunttu laytsay ayaw aduk'k'ii? Unttunttu wolk'k'aykka ayaw dari dari bi? <verse eid="JOB 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 21:8" />Unttunttoo naanatuunne naanatuwaa naanatuu de'iino; unttunttu dic'c'ishina be'anaw, gam"iide de'iino. <verse eid="JOB 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 21:9" />Unttunttu soyay hirggi bayinnan saro de'ee; S'oossay unttuntta bare gatiman shoc'i erenna. <verse eid="JOB 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 21:10" />Unttunttu koruma booratuu mac'c'a miizzaana gakketiyaa wode, kolenan oytsiino; mac'c'a miizzatuukka sal"eesenan yeliino. <verse eid="JOB 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 21:11" />Barenttu naanatuwaa dorssaa wudiyaadan kessiino; unttunttu naanatuukka yaan haan guppiino. <verse eid="JOB 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 21:12" />Darbbiyaa bak'k'iiddenne diitsaa diis's'iidde, yetsaa yes's'iino; lookkuwaa punniiddekka nashettiino. <verse eid="JOB 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 21:13" />Unttunttu barenttu de'uwaa laytsaa ishaluwaan poliide, barenttu duufuwaakka saro biino. <verse eid="JOB 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 21:14" />Unttunttu S'oossaa, ‹Nuuppe haakka! Nuuni ne ogiyaa eranaw koyokko! <verse eid="JOB 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 21:15" />Nuuni aw ootsanaw Ubbaa Danddayiyaa S'oossay oonee? Nuuni Aa woossiide, go'ettanabay ayee?› yaagiino. <verse eid="JOB 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 21:16" />Unttunttu barenttu ishalo de'uwaa barenttu minotetsan demmeeddo giino; shin taani unttunttu k'ofaa akkikke.<verse eid="JOB 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 21:17" />«Iita asatuwaa de'uwaa s'omppii to'i erii? Unttunttu bolla bashshay wod'd'i erii? S'oossay bare hank'k'uwaan unttuntta muri erii? <verse eid="JOB 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 21:18" />C'arkkuwaa sintsan unttunttu suullaadan haneedda wodii de'ii? Gotuu pitti afiyaa baanaadan unttunttu hani erino?<verse eid="JOB 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 21:19" />«Hintte, ‹S'oossay aawotuwaa bayzzuwaan unttunttu naanatuwaa muree› yaagiita. Ane S'oossay nagaranchchatuwaa unttunttu huup'iyaan muro! Yaatintto unttunttu barenttu bayzzuwaa erana. <verse eid="JOB 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 21:20" />Unttunttu barenttu muruwaa barenttoo akkino. Ubbaa Danddayiyaa S'oossaa hank'k'uwaa s'uu'aakka unttunttu barenttu huup'iyaan ushino. <verse eid="JOB 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 21:21" />Ayaw gooppe, unttunttu hayk'k'i kichcheeddawaappe guyyiyaan, unttunttu naanatuwaa ayay gakkinttonne koyikkino.<verse eid="JOB 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 21:22" />«Bolla d'ok'k'an de'iyaawantta pirddiyaa S'oossaa eraa tamaarissanaw danddayiyaa Asay de'ii? <verse eid="JOB 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 21:23" />Itti Asay kumentsaa wolk'k'aynne kumentsaa saruu de'ishiina, ishaluwaan de'iiddi hayk'k'ee. <verse eid="JOB 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 21:24" />Aa bollay orddi de'ishshin, Aa mek'etsaa kolzziikka shic'c'i de'ishiina hayk'k'ee. <verse eid="JOB 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 21:25" />Shin hara Asay Aa shemppuwaan kayyuu pac'c'ennan, bare de'uwaan mulekka lo"obaa demmennaan hayk'k'ee. <verse eid="JOB 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 21:26" />Unttunttu laa"uukka itti mala biittan moogettiino; unttuntta laa"uwaakka gus'unetuu kammiino.<verse eid="JOB 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 21:27" />«Hintte taana naak'k'anaw k'oppiide, hintte wozanaan halchcheedda halchchuwaa muliyaa taani loytsaade eray. <verse eid="JOB 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 21:28" />Hintte, ‹He iitaa ootsiyaa, wolk'k'aama bitaniyaa Gollii ha"i hak'anee?› yaagiita. <verse eid="JOB 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 21:29" />Ogiyaanna hamettiyaa asatuwaa oochchibeykkitee? Unttunttu odiyaawaa ammanikkitee? <verse eid="JOB 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 21:30" />Unttunttu, ‹Iita asatuu bayetsaa gallassi boshetenaan attiino; S'oossaa hank'k'uu k'onc'c'iyaa gallassikka unttunttu kessi akkana› yaagiino. <verse eid="JOB 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 21:31" />Iita asaa Aa iitatetsaw oonee walassanawe? I ootseedda iitabawukka Aa muranawe oonee? <verse eid="JOB 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 21:32" />I hayk'k'ina, Aa anhaa duufuwaa afiyaa wode, Aa duufuu naagettana. <verse eid="JOB 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 21:33" />Asay ubbay Aa kaallee; Paydu bayinna Asay Aa baliyaan peeshee; Aa duufuwaa biittaykka utulaadan aw kawushee. <verse eid="JOB 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 21:34" />Yaatina, hintte taana wooti mela oduwaan mintsetsiitee? Hintte ta ooshaw zaareedda zaaruu ubbay wordduwaa!» yaageedda.<verse eid="JOB 21:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JOB 22" />
  <para style="s">Elifaazi Zaariidekka Haasayee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 22:1" />Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Temaana biittaappe yeedda Elifaazi hawaadan yaagiide zaareedda; <verse eid="JOB 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 22:2" />«Asay S'oossaa go"anaw danddayii? Haray atto aad'd'eeda eranchcha gidinttokka, I barena go"anaappe attina, S'oossaa go"enna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 35:6-8">Yob. 35:6-8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JOB 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 22:3" />Neeni s'illuwaa gidooppe, hewe Ubbaa Danddayiyaa S'oossaa nashechchii? Ne ogii tooshii bayinnawaa gidooppe, hewan I ayaa wod'iyaa demmeeddee?<verse eid="JOB 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 22:4" />«Neeni Aa bonchchiyaa diraw, I neena seeriinne pirddii? <verse eid="JOB 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 22:5" />Ne iitatetsay dara gidennee? Ne nagaraw zaway baawa. <verse eid="JOB 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 22:6" />Neeni ne ishatuwaa gaasuu bayinnan waasiyaa s'eesissaadda; asaa mayuwaakka k'aaraade unttuntta kallo ashshaada. <verse eid="JOB 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 22:7" />Neeni saametteeddawantta haatsaa ushshabaakka; koshatteeddawanttakka k'umaa diggaadda. <verse eid="JOB 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 22:8" />Neeni ne wolk'k'aaninne ne maatan zemppaade, hara asaa biittaa new c'oo akkaada. <verse eid="JOB 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 22:9" />Am"etuwaa mela kushiyaa yeddaadda; aawuu bayinnawanttakka uk'k'unnaadda. <verse eid="JOB 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 22:10" />Ne yuushshuwaan gitii dooddi utteeddawe; akeekenan yashshay neena kokkorssiyaawekka hewaassa. <verse eid="JOB 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 22:11" />Neeni be'ennaadan, new d'umiyaawe; k'ay kuntso haatsay neena muukkiyaawekka hewaassa.<verse eid="JOB 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 22:12" />«S'oossay bolla d'ok'k'a saluwaan uttiide, d'ok'k'an de'iyaa s'oolinttetuwaa duge s'eellee. <verse eid="JOB 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 22:13" />Shin neeni, ‹S'oossay ayaa erii? I hewaa mala, d'ip'p'i go d'umaa gidduwaanakka pirddanaw danddayii? <verse eid="JOB 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 22:14" />Saluwaanne sa'aa dantsuwaa bolla I simerettiyaa wode, I be'ennaadan, sikkeedda shaarii Aa goozee› yaagaasa.<verse eid="JOB 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 22:15" />«Nagaranchchatuu hametteedda beni ogiyaan baanaw k'ofaa k'achchaadii? <verse eid="JOB 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 22:16" />Unttunttu barenttu wodii gakkennan de'ishiina hayk'k'eeddino; unttunttu de'uwaa baasuukka di'uwaan meec'etti d'ayeedda. <verse eid="JOB 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 22:17" />Unttunttu S'oossaa, ‹Nuuppe haakka! Ubbaa Danddayiyaa S'oossay nuw ayaa ootsanaw danddayii?› yaageeddino. <verse eid="JOB 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 22:18" />Gidooppenne, unttunttu golliyaan lo"obaa kuntseeddawe S'oossaa. Hewaa diraw, iita asatuwaa k'ofay taw gelenna.<verse eid="JOB 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 22:19" />«Iita asatuwaa bolla gakkiyaawaa be'iide, s'illotuu nashettiino; suure asatuukka hawaadan yaagiide, unttunttu bolla k'iliic'iino; <verse eid="JOB 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 22:20" />‹Tumuwaappe nu morkketuu d'ayeeddino; unttunttu duretetsaakka tamay meedda›.<verse eid="JOB 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 22:21" />«Iyyoobaa, ha"ikka S'oossaw moodeta; aanana saro de'a. Yaatooppe, neeni anjjettana. <verse eid="JOB 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 22:22" />Aa doonaappe timirttiyaa akka; Aa k'aalatuwaakka ne wozanaan wotsa. <verse eid="JOB 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 22:23" />Neenatetsaa hokissaade, Ubbaa Danddayiyaa S'oossaakko, neeni simmooppe; iita oosuwaa ubbaa ne sooppe diggooppe; <verse eid="JOB 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 22:24" />Ne work'k'aa sa'aan olooppe; ne bertte work'k'aakka shaafaa shuchchaan olooppe; <verse eid="JOB 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 22:25" />Ubbaa Danddayiyaa S'oossay new work'k'aanne dooretteedda biraa gidanawaa.<verse eid="JOB 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 22:26" />«Hewaappe guyyiyaan, neeni Ubbaa Danddayiyaa S'oossan tumu nashettana; yeellatennaan S'oossaakko pude s'eelana. <verse eid="JOB 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 22:27" />Neeni S'oossaa woosana; I sisana; k'ay neeni ne k'anggiyaa aw gatsana. <verse eid="JOB 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 22:28" />Neeni zorettaade k'achcheeddawe new polettana; ne hamettiyaa ogiyaankka poo'uu poo'ana. <verse eid="JOB 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 22:29" />Ayaw gooppe, S'oossay otorettiyaawantta kawushshee; shin barentta hokisiyaawantta ashshee. <verse eid="JOB 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 22:30" />I suure asaa wotsi akkee. Ne kushii naak'uwaappe geeshsha gidooppe, I neena ashshana» yaageedda.<verse eid="JOB 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JOB 23" />
  <para style="s">Iyyoobi Zaariidekka Haasayee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 23:1" />Iyyoobi hawaadan yaagiide zaareedda; <verse eid="JOB 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 23:2" />«Taani ha"ikka S'oossaa bolla makkalaynne zuuzummay; ayaw gooppe, taani oolinakka Aa kushii ta bolla dees'iyaawaa aggibeenna. <verse eid="JOB 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 23:3" />I de'iyaasaa taani eraarikkitaashsha! I utteeddasaakka gakkarikkitaashsha! <verse eid="JOB 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 23:4" />Yaatintto, taani ta mootuwaa Aa sintsan biddana shin! Ta doonaakka palumiyaan kuntsana shin! <verse eid="JOB 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 23:5" />I ta mootoo zaariyaawe ayenttokka taani erana shin! I taana giyaawaakka akeekana shin! <verse eid="JOB 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 23:6" />I bare wolk'k'aama wolk'k'an taananna ek'ettaneeshsha? Tuytti, tuytti, I taani odiyaawaa sisanaappe attina, hewaa hanenna. <verse eid="JOB 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 23:7" />Ta wozanay suure gidiyaa diraw, taani S'oossaanna mootettanaw danddayay; I ta daannay taana med'inaw shatintsana.<verse eid="JOB 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 23:8" />«Shin ayissee, taani away doliyaa bagga booppe, I yaan de'enna; k'ay taani away wulliyaasaa booppekka, Aa demmikke. <verse eid="JOB 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 23:9" />I huup'issa bagga biittan ootsiyaa wode, taani Aa be'ikke; k'ay gedissa bagga biittaa simmiyaa wodekka, taani Aa demmikke. <verse eid="JOB 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 23:10" />Shin I ta tangguwaa ubbaa eree; I taana paac'c'ooppe, taani work'k'aadan geeshsha gidiyaawaa I be'ana. <verse eid="JOB 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 23:11" />Taani I hametteedda ogiyaa geeshsha oyk'k'aade hamettaad; Aa ogiyaappe wora simmabeykke. <verse eid="JOB 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 23:12" />Aa doonaappe kesiyaa azazuwaappe taani shaakkettabeykke; Aa k'aalaakka ta wozanaan wotsaad.<verse eid="JOB 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 23:13" />«S'oossay laamettenna. Aanana ek'ettana, woy bare koyeeddawaa I ootsennaadan Aa diggana Asay baawa. <verse eid="JOB 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 23:14" />I taw halchcheeddawaa polana; hewanttu mala, hara daro halchchotuukka aw de'iino. <verse eid="JOB 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 23:15" />Hewaa diraw, Aa sintsan ek'k'iyaawe loytsi taana yashshee; hewaa ubbabaa k'oppaade, taani kokkoray. <verse eid="JOB 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 23:16" />Ta wozanay daaburanaadan S'oossay ootseedda; Ubbaa Danddayiyaa S'oossay taana dagantsee. <verse eid="JOB 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 23:17" />Bara d'umay ta som"uwaa goozinttokka, taana he d'umay haasayaa diggibeenna.<verse eid="JOB 23:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JOB 24" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 24:1" />«Ubbaa Danddayiyaa S'oossay pirddiyaa wodiyaa ayaw keerennee? Aa eriyaawanttu he wodiyaa ayaw be'ikkinoo? <verse eid="JOB 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 24:2" />Iita asatuu barenttu gadiyaa aassanaw, zawaan de'iyaa shuchchaa d'ok'oliino. Dorssaakka wuu"i ahiide, barenttu dorssaa wudiyaan gatsiide heemmiino. <verse eid="JOB 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 24:3" />Aawuu bayinna naanatuwaa haretuwaa laaggiide, akki biino; am"atii booraakka ac'oo oyk'k'iide, barenttoo akkiino. <verse eid="JOB 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 24:4" />Hiyyeesatuwaa bare maataa demenaadan diggiino; biittan de'iyaa hiyyeesatuwaa ubbaa barenttu sintsappe k'osetsiino. <verse eid="JOB 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 24:5" />Bazzuwaan de'iyaa wora haretuwaadan, hiyyeesatuu miyaawaa koyiidde wos'erettiino, barenttu naanatookka bazzuwaappe k'umaa koyiino. <verse eid="JOB 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 24:6" />Unttunttu dembban hara asaw katsaa c'akkiino; iita asatuwaa woyniyaa teeraa wurc'c'uwaakka k'aarimiino. <verse eid="JOB 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 24:7" />Unttunttu k'ammaa kallo ak'iino; meeguwaa wodekka bollan mayiyaawe unttunttoo baawa. <verse eid="JOB 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 24:8" />Deretuwaan bukkiyaa iran unttunttu s'irkkikkiino; geliyaasaa d'ayiide, shuchchaa k'oommiino.<verse eid="JOB 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 24:9" />«Iita asatuu aawuu bayinna na'aa aatti d'antsaa d'ammiyaasaappe dafi akkiino; hiyyeesatuwaa guutsa naanatuwaakka ac'oo oyk'k'iino. <verse eid="JOB 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 24:10" />Hiyyeesatuu mayuwaa d'ayiide, kallo hamettiino; Unttunttu tukuwaa keeziidde koshshatiino. <verse eid="JOB 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 24:11" />Unttunttu zayitiyaa kessanaw wogaraa teeraa purs's'iino; woyniyaa teeraakka gum"iidde saamettiino. <verse eid="JOB 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 24:12" />Kataman hayk'k'ana haniyaa asatuu ooliino; deshetteedda asatuukka maaduwaa koyiide waassiino; shin S'oossay unttunttu metuwaa s'eellenna.<verse eid="JOB 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 24:13" />«Poo'uwaa is's'iyaa asatuu de'iino; unttunttu poo'uu ayentto erikkino; Aa ogiyaappekka wora biino. <verse eid="JOB 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 24:14" />Shemppuwaa wod'iyaawe wonttumaatsa denddiide, hiyyeesatuwaanne metootanchchatuwaa wod'ee; k'amma k'ay kayisuwaadan wuu"ee. <verse eid="JOB 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 24:15" />Shaarmus'iyaawe sa'ay d'umanawaa naagee; I, ‹Ooninne taana be'oppo› giide, bare som"uwaa kammee. <verse eid="JOB 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 24:16" />Kayisatuu k'amma golliyaa bookkiide, wuu"anaw geliino; shin gallassi poo'uwaa is's'iide, k'osetti peeshiino. <verse eid="JOB 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 24:17" />Unttuntta gallassaa poo'uu yashshee; shin k'amma d'umay unttuntta dagantsenna.<verse eid="JOB 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 24:18" />«Iita asatuwaa di'uwaa haatsay k'uc'c'iide afee; unttuntta gakkeedda gadii shek'k'etteeddawaa gidee. Ooninne unttunttu woyniyaa turaa sa'aa beenna. <verse eid="JOB 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 24:19" />Shachchay hombbiyan muushina, away Aa melissi d'ayissiyaawaadan, hewaadankka, nagaranchchatuu hayk'k'iide d'ayiino. <verse eid="JOB 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 24:20" />Haray attina, yeleedda aayetuukka unttuntta hassaykkino. Gus'unii unttunttu ashuwaa mal"ina mee. Unttunttu iita oosuukka kunddeedda mitsaadan me"ana. <verse eid="JOB 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 24:21" />Ayaw gooppe, unttunttu na'ay bayinna maynne mac'c'a asaa naak'k'eeddino; am"e mac'c'a mishiratiwukka maaddennaan is's'eeddino.<verse eid="JOB 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 24:22" />«S'oossay bare wolk'k'an minotuwaa d'ayissee; unttunttoo sa'ay injjetowaa malattooppekka de'uwaa hidootay baawa. <verse eid="JOB 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 24:23" />S'oossay unttunttu saro de'anaadan ootsooppekka, unttunttu ogiyaa wochchee. <verse eid="JOB 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 24:24" />Iita asatuu guutsa wodiyaw d'ok'k'u d'ok'k'u giino; shin ellekka sharafaadan shulli d'ayiino; katsaadan c'akettiino.<verse eid="JOB 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 24:25" />«Hewe hanenna giide, kaddiyaa Asay de'ii? Taani odeedda k'aalaakka wordduwaa giide, ammantsiyaa Asay de'ii?» yaageedda.<verse eid="JOB 24:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="JOB 25" />
  <para style="s">Bilddaade Zaariidekka Haasayee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 25:1" />Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Shuuha biittaappe yeedda Bilddaade hawaadan yaagiide zaareedda; <verse eid="JOB 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 25:2" />«S'oossay wolk'k'aama gidiyaa diraw, Asay yayyiide, aw moodettee. I bare saluwaa kawutetsaa saruwaan naagee. <verse eid="JOB 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 25:3" />Aa olanchchatuwaa paydanaw danddayiyaa Asay de'ii? S'oossaa poo'uu gakkenna sa'ay de'ii? <verse eid="JOB 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 25:4" />Yaatina, Asay S'oossaa sintsan waan s'illuwaa gidanaw danddayii? Mac'c'a asaappe yeletteedda Asay waan geeshsha gidanaw danddayii? <verse eid="JOB 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 25:5" />S'oossaa sintsan aginayikka wagagga poo'o gidenna; Aa sintsan s'oolinttetuukka geeshsha gidikkino. <verse eid="JOB 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 25:6" />Yaatina, S'oossaa sintsan gus'uniyaa gidiyaa Asay ay keeshshaa laafee?» yaageedda.<verse eid="JOB 25:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="JOB 26" />
  <para style="s">Iyyoobi Zaariidekka Haasayee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 26:1" />Iyyoobi hawaadan yaagiide zaareedda; <verse eid="JOB 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 26:2" />«Wolk'k'ay bayinna asaa neeni ayaa maaduwaa maaddadii! Daabureedda k'esetuwaa neeni ayaa ashuwaa ashshaadii! <verse eid="JOB 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 26:3" />Aad'd'eeda eratetsay bayinnawaa ayaa zoriyaa zoraaddii! Ay keeshshaa wolk'k'aama eratetsaa k'onc'c'issaadii! <verse eid="JOB 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 26:4" />Neeni ha k'aalaa haasayanaadan neena oonee maaddeeddawe? K'ay hawaadan haasayanaw neena dentsetseedawe O ayyaanee?» yaageedda.<verse eid="JOB 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bilddaade Bare Haasayaa Wurssee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 26:5" />Bilddaade, «Hayk'k'eeddawanttu moyttilletuu biittaappe garssa baggana haatsaa giddon kokkoriino. <verse eid="JOB 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 26:6" />S'oossaa sintsan Si'ooliikka k'onc'c'e; ayaynne Aa gentsanaw danddayenna. <verse eid="JOB 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 26:7" />S'oossay huup'issa bagga salotuwaa mic'c'eedda; sa'aakka ayentto bayinna saan kak'k'eedda. <verse eid="JOB 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 26:8" />I shaaretuwaan haatsaa kuntsee; haatsaa dees'uwaan shaaretuu daakettikkino. <verse eid="JOB 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 26:9" />Doysseedda aginaa I bare shaariyaan kammee. <verse eid="JOB 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 26:10" />Poo'uwaa d'umaappe shaakkanaw, saluu sa'aanna dantsettiyaa sa'aan k'ammaynne gallassay laamettiyaa zawaa S'oossay essee. <verse eid="JOB 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 26:11" />I seeriyaa wode, salotuwaa tuuk'etuu dagamaw kokkoriino. <verse eid="JOB 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 26:12" />Bare wolk'k'an abbaa c'o"u ootseedda; bare akeekan Ra'aaba giyaa dawiyaa d'ayisseedda. <verse eid="JOB 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 26:13" />I shemppiyaa shemppuwaan salotuu geeyeeddino; Aa kushiikka s'onggettiyaa shooshshaa wod'eedda. <verse eid="JOB 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 26:14" />Hawanttu ubbay S'oossay ootseedda oosotuwaappe amareedawantta; nuuni sisiyaawe saasuketsaa s'alala. Yaatina, Aa wolk'k'aa gitatetsaa akeekanaw danddayiyaawe oonee?» yaageedda.<verse eid="JOB 26:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="JOB 27" />
  <para style="s">Iyyoobi Zaariidekka Haasayee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 27:1" />Iyyoobi hawaadan yaageedda; <verse eid="JOB 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 27:2" />«Ta suure pirddaa taana diggiide, ta de'uwaa c'ama kesseedda, Ubbaa Danddayiyaa de'uwaa S'oossan taani c'aak'k'ay. <verse eid="JOB 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 27:3" />S'oossay taw de'uwaa shemppuwaa immeedda keenan, <verse eid="JOB 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 27:4" />ta doonay wordduwaa haasayenna; ta ins's'arssaykka c'imuwaa odenna. <verse eid="JOB 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 27:5" />Hintte haasayeeddawe likke gaade taani akkikke; hayk'k'ana gakkanawukka taani ta suuretetsaa aggikke. <verse eid="JOB 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 27:6" />Ta s'illotetsaa minisa oyk'k'anaappe attina, s'illotetsaa aggikke; taani de'eedda laytsaa ubbaan ta wozanay kahay taana k'um"ena.<verse eid="JOB 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 27:7" />«Ta morkketuunne taananna ek'ettiyaawanttu ubbay iitanne bayzzanchcha asaadan muretino. <verse eid="JOB 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 27:8" />S'oossay unttunttu shemppuwaa unttunttu ashuwaappe shaakkiide, unttunttu laytsaa k'aamissiyaa wode, iitatoo sintsappe hidootay ayee? <verse eid="JOB 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 27:9" />Unttunttu bolla metuu gakkiyaa wode, S'oossay unttunttu waasuwaa sisii? <verse eid="JOB 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 27:10" />Ubbaa Danddayiyaa S'oossan unttunttu nashettanee? Unttunttu ubbaa wode S'oossaa s'eesanee?<verse eid="JOB 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 27:11" />«Taani hinttena S'oossaa wolk'k'aabaa tamaarissana; Ubbaa Danddayiyaa S'oossaa halchchuwaa taani hintteppe k'ossikke. <verse eid="JOB 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 27:12" />Hintte ubbay hawaa hintte huup'iyaan be'eeddita. Yaatina, ha mela haasayaa ayaw haasayiitee?<verse eid="JOB 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 27:13" />«S'oossay iita asatoo immeedda kaac'aynne uk'k'unniyaa asatuu Ubbaa Danddayiyaa S'oossaappe akkiyaa woytuu hawaappe kaalliyaawaa. <verse eid="JOB 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 27:14" />Unttunttu naanatuu ay keeshshaa darooppenne, unttunttu olan wuriino; unttunttu zaratuukka miyaawaa d'ayiide koshshatiino. <verse eid="JOB 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 27:15" />Hewaappe atteedawanttu boshaan wuriino; unttunttu am"etuukka unttunttoo yeekkikkino.<verse eid="JOB 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16-17" style="v" sid="JOB 27:16-17" />«Iita asatuu, paydina wurenna biraa shiishshinakka, unttunttu biraa suure asatuu shaakki akkana; k'ay mayuwaa darissiide shiishshinakka, unttunttu shiishshiyaawaa s'illotuu mayyana. <verse eid="JOB 27:16-17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 27:18" />Unttunttu kees's'iyaa golletuu shararootaa golliyaa mala; naagiyaawanttu kees's'eedda gaabbaa mala.<verse eid="JOB 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 27:19" />«Unttunttu dure gidiide, barenttu hiis'an gisana; shin unttunttu gem"ishuwaappe beegottiyaa wode, ayaynne d'ayina mela attanawantta. <verse eid="JOB 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 27:20" />Dagamay di'uwaadan k'oppennaan unttunttu bolla yaana; k'ammankka gotii unttuntta dentsiide afana. <verse eid="JOB 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 27:21" />Away doliyaa bagga c'arkkuu unttuntta de'iyaasaappe pittiide afana. <verse eid="JOB 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 27:22" />Unttunttu kessi akkanaw bak'atishina, k'areti bayinnan unttunttu bolla wod'd'ana. <verse eid="JOB 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 27:23" />Wolk'k'aama kooshshaa sissiidde, unttuntta yederssana.<verse eid="JOB 27:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="JOB 28" />
  <para style="s">Aad'd'eeda Eratetsaa Timirttiyaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 28:1" />«Biraa bookki kessiyaasaynne work'k'aa geeshshanaw muushisiyaa sa'ay de'ee. <verse eid="JOB 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 28:2" />Biratay Asay biittaappe bookkina kesee; nahaasiikka Aa shuchchaa muushisina kesee. <verse eid="JOB 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 28:3" />Asay s'omppiyaa ahiide, d'umaa s'oonee; biittaa c'iimmuwaa gakkiide, d'ip'p'i go d'umaa giddon he shuchchaa koyee. <verse eid="JOB 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 28:4" />Asay de'iyaasaappe haakkiide, asaa gedii yed'd'i erennasaa biide, hewan c'iimma ollaa bookkee; hewan wodoruwaan yaanne haanne kuulumushiidde, asaappe shaakkettiide de'ee. <verse eid="JOB 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 28:5" />Katsay biittaappe mokkee; shin he biittaa gidduu taman muushiide, aad'd'i aad'd'i wod'd'ee. <verse eid="JOB 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 28:6" />He biittaa giddon de'iyaa shuchchaappe samppeeriyaa giyaa al"o shuchchay kesee; Aa baanaa giddoppekka work'k'ay beettee.<verse eid="JOB 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 28:7" />«He shuchchaa bookkiyaasaa afiyaa ogiyaa s'inggillii erenna; gac'iikka be'ibeenna. <verse eid="JOB 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 28:8" />Iita do'atuu barenttu gediyaan he sa'aa yed'd'i erikkino; gaammuukka hewaana aad'd'ena.<verse eid="JOB 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 28:9" />«Asay mino zaallaa mentsereetsee; deriyaakka bookkiide, s'ap'uwaappe aatsi yeggee. <verse eid="JOB 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 28:10" />Zaallaa lukkiide, aad'd'iyaa ogiyaa kessiide, he al"o shuchchaakka demmee. <verse eid="JOB 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 28:11" />Haatsaa pulttuwaa bookino; geemmeeddabatuwaakka poo'uwaa kessee.<verse eid="JOB 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 28:12" />«Shin aad'd'eeda eratetsay hak'appe beettanaw danddayii? Akeekay beettiyaa sa'ay hak'ee? <verse eid="JOB 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 28:13" />Asay Aa tumu gatiyaa erenna; ayaw gooppe, aad'd'eedda eratetsay pas'a de'iyaawanttu biittaan beettanaw danddayenna. <verse eid="JOB 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 28:14" />C'iimmuu, ‹Aad'd'eeda eratetsay ta giddon baawa› yaagee; Abbaykka taananna gidena gee.<verse eid="JOB 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 28:15" />«Aad'd'eeda eratetsay work'k'aan shamettenna; Aa gatiikka biran geedaretena. <verse eid="JOB 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 28:16" />Aad'd'eeda eratetsay bertte work'k'aan, margidiyaanne samppeeriyaa geetettiyaa al"o shuchchaan shamettenna. <verse eid="JOB 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 28:17" />Work'k'aynne masttootiyaa oosetteedda miishshatuwaa gatii aanana likkettenna; work'k'aappe oosetteedda al"obankka laamettenna. <verse eid="JOB 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 28:18" />Aad'd'eeda eratetsaa gatii yeleeluwaappe, almmaaziyaappenne ink'k'uwaa ubbaappe aad'd'ee. <verse eid="JOB 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 28:19" />Toop'aaziyooniyaa giyaa Toop'p'iyaa ink'k'uukka aanana likkettenna; bertte work'k'aankka shamettenna.<verse eid="JOB 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 28:20" />«Yaatina, aad'd'eeda eratetsay hak'appe yii? Akeekay beettiyaa sa'ay hak'ee? <verse eid="JOB 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 28:21" />Pas'a de'iyaa med'etaa ubbaappe geemmi utteedda; saluwaa kafotuukka Aa demmikkino. <verse eid="JOB 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 28:22" />Bashshayinne hayk'k'uu, ‹Nuuni aad'd'eeda eratetsaw odo s'alala nu haytsaan siseeddo› yaagiino.<verse eid="JOB 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 28:23" />«Aad'd'eeda eratetsaakko afiyaa ogiyaanne I de'iyaa sa'aa eriyaawe S'oossaa s'alala. <verse eid="JOB 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 28:24" />Ayaw gooppe, S'oossay sa'aa gas'aa ubbaa s'eellee; salotuwaappe garssaana de'iyaawaa ubbaa be'ee. <verse eid="JOB 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 28:25" />S'oossay c'arkkoo wolk'k'aa immeedda wodenne shaariyaa haatsaa likkeedda wode, <verse eid="JOB 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 28:26" />iraykka hak'an bukkanentto, walk'k'antsaykka hak'an wod'd'anentto wogaa wotseedda wode, <verse eid="JOB 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 28:27" />I he wode, aad'd'eeda eratetsaa be'iide paac'c'eedda; lo"a geedda. <verse eid="JOB 28:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 28:28" />Hewaappe guyyiyaan, S'oossay asaw odiidde, ‹S'oossaw yayyiyaawe aad'd'eeda eratetsaa; iitaappe haakkiyaawekka akeeka› yaagee» yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 111:10">Maz. 111:10</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 1:7">Lem. 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 9:10">9:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 28:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="JOB 29" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 29:1" />Iyyoobi k'aykka hawaadan yaageedda; <verse eid="JOB 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 29:2" />«Ha"i ta de'iyaa de'uu S'oossay beni taana naageedda wodiyaawaa mala gideerenneeshsha! <verse eid="JOB 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 29:3" />Aa s'omppii ta bolla poo'ina, taani d'umaan aad'aadde Aa poo'uwaan hamettaad. <verse eid="JOB 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 29:4" />He wodii S'oossay taananne ta soo asaa naagina, taani ta kumentsaa wolk'k'aanna de'eedda wode. <verse eid="JOB 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 29:5" />He wode Ubbaa Danddayiyaa S'oossay taananna de'ee; ta naanatuukka ta yuushshuwaan de'iino. <verse eid="JOB 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 29:6" />Taani ta kushiyaa maatsan meec'ettaad; ta wogaraa gum"iyaasaappekka zayitii shaafaadan goggeedda.<verse eid="JOB 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 29:7" />«Taani kataman de'iyaa pirdda golliyaa beedda wode, daannatuwaana ittippe uttaad. <verse eid="JOB 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 29:8" />He wode yalagatuu taana be'iide, ogiyaa immeeddino; c'imatuukka taana bonchchanaw denddi ek'k'eeddino. <verse eid="JOB 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 29:9" />Kaappatuu haasayiyaawaa aggi basheeddino; barenttu doonaankka barenttu kushiyaa wotseeddino. <verse eid="JOB 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 29:10" />He kataman de'iyaa wolk'k'aama asatuukka c'o"u geeddino; unttunttu ins's'arssaykka unttunttu kookkiyaa bak'k'i oyk'k'eedda.<verse eid="JOB 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 29:11" />«Tawaa siseeddawanttunne taana be'eeddawanttu ubbay taana galatiide haasayeeddino. <verse eid="JOB 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 29:12" />Ayaw gooppe, maadoo waassiyaa hiyyeesatuwaanne aawuu aata d'ayina, maaddiyaawe bayinnawantta taani ashshaad. <verse eid="JOB 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 29:13" />Hayk'k'ana haniyaa bitanii taana anjjeedda; am"atakka ta maaduwaan nashetaaddu. <verse eid="JOB 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 29:14" />Taani s'illotetsaa mayuwaadan mayyaad; suure pirddaykka ta afilaa malanne k'umaashsha mala. <verse eid="JOB 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 29:15" />Taani k'ook'etoo ayifiyaa, wobbatuwaa gediyaa gidaaddi. <verse eid="JOB 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 29:16" />Hiyyeesatoo aawuwaa gidaaddi; taani erenna asatookka abakkaatto gidaaddi. <verse eid="JOB 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 29:17" />Taani iitatuwaa gappataa mentsaad; unttunttu shankkatiide oyk'k'eeddawanttakka unttunttu doonaappe wotsa akkaad.<verse eid="JOB 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 29:18" />«Taani ta k'ofaan, ‹Taani adussa laytsaa ta soo asaa gidduwaan de'aade hayk'k'ana. <verse eid="JOB 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 29:19" />Taani bare s'ap'otuwaa haatsaa giddo yeddeeddanne ketterssay k'amma ubbaan Aa tashiyaa bolla de'iyaa mitsaa mala. <verse eid="JOB 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 29:20" />Taani ubbaa wodekka bonchchettaade de'ana; ta wolk'k'aykka ubbaa wode ooras's'ana› gaade k'oppaad.<verse eid="JOB 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 29:21" />«Taani haasayiyaawaa Asay sirp'p'i gi hayzziide, ta zoriyaa akkeedda. <verse eid="JOB 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 29:22" />Taani haasayeeddawaappe guyyiyaan, unttunttu zaaretsiide haasayibeykkino; ayaw gooppe, ta k'aalay unttunttu wozanaan s'okeedda. <verse eid="JOB 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 29:23" />Goshshanchchay iraa naagiyaawaadan, unttunttu taani haasayanawaa sisanaw hanggiide naageeddino. <verse eid="JOB 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 29:24" />Unttunttu hirggi utti de'ishshin, taani ta som"uwaa pashikkissaad; hewan unttunttu mintsetsetteeddino. <verse eid="JOB 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 29:25" />Taani unttunttu de'ana ogiyaa dooraad; unttunttu kaappuwaadan uttaad. Bare olanchchatuwaa giddon de'iyaa kaatiyaadan, taani unttunttu giddon de'aaddi. K'ay kayyottiyaawantta mintsetsiyaa asaa mala gidaaddi.<verse eid="JOB 29:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="JOB 30" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 30:1" />«Shin ha"i taappe yalagiyaa asatuu taana k'iliic'iino. Unttunttu ta dorssaa wudiyaa heemmiyaa kanatuwaa maaddana giinakka taani diggeedda aawotuwaa naanatuwaa. <verse eid="JOB 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 30:2" />Unttunttu aawotuu wolk'k'ay is's'eeddawanttanne bollaa gilk'k'eeddawantta gideedda diraw, taana ayinne maaddibeykkino. <verse eid="JOB 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 30:3" />Metuwaanne koshaa gaasuwaan k'amma denddiide, bazzuwaa biidde, s'ap'uwaa c'oommeeddino. <verse eid="JOB 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 30:4" />K'ay sharafaanne bonc'c'iyaa mas'eeddino; mal"enna sankkaaraa s'ap'otuwaakka meeddino. <verse eid="JOB 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 30:5" />Asay waassiidde, kayisotuwaa yedersseeddawaadan, asaa giddoppe unttuntta yedersseedda. <verse eid="JOB 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 30:6" />Unttunttu zanggaaraa giddon, gonggolo giddoninne zaallaa gonggoluwaa giddon de'eeddino. <verse eid="JOB 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 30:7" />Unttunttu buuraa giddon bazzo do'atuwaadan waasseeddino; doobbiyaa garssan shiik'iide, ittippe de'eeddino. <verse eid="JOB 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 30:8" />Unttunttu k'ays's'eeriyaan shoc'ettiide, biittaappe yederssetteeddino. Unttunttu suntsaanna bayiide, booza gidiide de'eeddino.<verse eid="JOB 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 30:9" />«Ha"i unttunttu naanatuu taana yetsan k'iliic'iino; taani unttunttu giddon leemisiide odiyaawaa gidaaddi. <verse eid="JOB 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 30:10" />Unttunttu taana shenetiide, taappe haakkiino; ayinne yeellatennaan ta som"uwaan c'uchchaa c'uchchiino. <verse eid="JOB 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 30:11" />S'oossay ta wolk'k'aa laafetsiide, taana kawushsheedda diraw, unttunttu taana k'ohanaw, bis'aalaa kessi diggeedda paraadan, yeda gideeddino. <verse eid="JOB 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 30:12" />Ha seeri bayinnan dic'c'eedda naanatuu ta bolla denddiide, taana yederssiino; unttunttu taana d'ayissanaw ta bolla doodiino. <verse eid="JOB 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 30:13" />Unttunttu ta hamettiyaa ogiyaa gorddiide, taana d'ayissanaw koyiino; ooninne unttunttu hewaa ootsanawaa diggenna. <verse eid="JOB 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 30:14" />Olanchchatuu katamaa dirssaa mentsiide geliyaawaadan, unttunttu ta bolla yeeddino. <verse eid="JOB 30:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 30:15" />Wolk'k'aama dagamay taana dippi ootseedda; ta bonchchuukka c'arkkuu afiyaawaadan beedda; ta ishaluukka shaariyaadan d'ayeedda.<verse eid="JOB 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 30:16" />«Ta shemppatta un"etaaddu; tuggaa gallassatuu taana c'irppi oyk'k'eedda. <verse eid="JOB 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 30:17" />K'amma k'amma sakuu ta mek'etsaa c'oommee; seelaykka shemppi akkennan gede gujjee. <verse eid="JOB 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 30:18" />Ta mayuu gunddiide bayeedda; shamic'c'iyaa k'ood'iyaadan, taana c'uulli oyk'k'eedda. <verse eid="JOB 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 30:19" />S'oossay taana urk'k'aan oleedda; taani biittaappe bidintsaappe keekkenna asaa gidaaddi.<verse eid="JOB 30:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 30:20" />«Abeet S'oossaw, taani new waassay; shin neeni taw allabeyikka. Ek'k'aade neena woossaad; shin neeni ta woosaa sisabeykka. <verse eid="JOB 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 30:21" />Neeni kasewaappe dummataade, taw mek'etsaa iitaada; ne wolk'k'aama wolk'k'an taana yederssaasa. <verse eid="JOB 30:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 30:22" />Neeni taana c'arkkuwaan dentsaadda; Aa togissaadda; gotiyankka taana gonddorssaadda. <verse eid="JOB 30:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 30:23" />Asaw ubbaw wurssetsa gideedda hayk'oo neeni taana aatsaade immiyaawaa taani eray.<verse eid="JOB 30:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 30:24" />«Kunddiide me"eedda Asay tuggatiidde, ‹Taana maaddarikkii› giide waassina, aw k'arettenna Asay de'ii? <verse eid="JOB 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 30:25" />Tuggaan de'iyaawanttoo taani yeekkabeykkitaa? Hiyyeesatoo taani k'arettabeykkitaa? <verse eid="JOB 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 30:26" />Lo"obaa demmana gaade taani amottiyaa wode, iitabay taana gakkeedda. Taw sa'ay keekee gaade taani naagiyaa wode, gallassay taw d'umeedda. <verse eid="JOB 30:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 30:27" />Ta wozanay hirggeedda; taani woppaa demmabeykke; gallassaappe gallassan ta tuggay yaa dareedda. <verse eid="JOB 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 30:28" />Ta bollay aawaa suuluwaan gidennaan kayyuwaan kares's'eedda; taani shiik'uwaan ek'k'aade, ‹Taana maaddite!› gaade waassay. <verse eid="JOB 30:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 30:29" />Taani worakanatoo ishaa, sagoniyawukka dabbo gidaaddi. <verse eid="JOB 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 30:30" />Ta galbbay kares's'iide, pok'etti pok'etti wod'd'ee; ta bollaykka mishuwaan s'uugettee. <verse eid="JOB 30:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 30:31" />Hewaa diraw, ta dinkkii zilaassaw puneteedda; ta his'is'iikka yeekoo punetteedda.<verse eid="JOB 30:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="JOB 31" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 31:1" />«Malanchcha mac'c'awunno s'eellaade amottennaadan, taani ta wozanaa ayifiyaana c'aak'uwaa c'aak'k'etaad. <verse eid="JOB 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 31:2" />Bollan de'iyaa S'oossay taw ayaa kaac'aa immanddeeshsha? Saluwaan de'iyaa Ubbaa Danddayiyaa S'oossay asaw immiyaa woytuu ayaa gidanddeeshsha? <verse eid="JOB 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 31:3" />Iitatuwaa bolla boshay, bayzzuwaa ootsiyaawanttu bolla bashshay gakkanawe eretteeddawaa gidenneeyye? <verse eid="JOB 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 31:4" />S'oossay ta hemetaa ubbaa be'ee; ta tangguwaa ubbaakka paydee.<verse eid="JOB 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 31:5" />«Taani wordduwaa mulekka ootsabeykke; asaakka c'immanaw kajjeelabeykke. <verse eid="JOB 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 31:6" />S'oossay taana likke miizaanan mazzano; yaatiide taani s'illuwaa gidiyaawaa ero. <verse eid="JOB 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 31:7" />Ta hametay ogiyaappe sher"eedabaa gidooppe, ta wozanaykka ta ayifii s'eelleeddawaa amotteeddawaa gidooppenne, k'ay ta kushiikka nagaran tuneeddawaa gidooppe, <verse eid="JOB 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 31:8" />ta c'arshshay ubbay shodetti d'ayo; taani zereeddawaakka haray mo.<verse eid="JOB 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 31:9" />«Ta wozanay ta shooruwaa mac'c'a asaa amotteeddawaa gidooppe, woy taani Izi penggen zuggaade naageeddawaa gidooppe, <verse eid="JOB 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 31:10" />ta machchata hara asaw gaac'c'u; k'ay hara attuma asatuu iinanna gisino. <verse eid="JOB 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 31:11" />Ayaw gooppe, shaarmus'iyaawe loytsi pokkanne pirddan murissiyaa nagaraa. <verse eid="JOB 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 31:12" />Ha nagaray tamaadan s'uuggiide, ta mas'uwaa ubbaa d'ayissiyaawaa.<verse eid="JOB 31:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 31:13" />«Taani ta attuma woy ta mac'c'a k'oomatuu taana mootina, unttunttu mootuwaa kad'eeddawaa gidooppe, <verse eid="JOB 31:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 31:14" />S'oossay taana biddiyaa wode, taani waananee? K'ay I taana oochchiyaa wode, taani waaga zaaranee? <verse eid="JOB 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 31:15" />Taana med'd'eedda S'oossay ta k'oomatuwaakka I med'd'eedda. Nuuna ubbaakka nu aatti nu aatti uluwaan med'eeddawe itti Aa s'alala.<verse eid="JOB 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 31:16" />«Taani hiyyeesatuu woosseeddawaa diggaadditantto, woy am"etuwaa mintsetsenan aggaaditantto, <verse eid="JOB 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 31:17" />Aawuu aata bayinna naanatuu mela ak'iyaa wode, taani ta k'umaa taarekka mabeykke. <verse eid="JOB 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 31:18" />Taani unttuntta ta yalagatetsaappe doommaade, unttunttu aawuwadan dichchaad; ta aatti uluwaappe yelettoodeppe doommaade, am"etuwaa maaddaad. <verse eid="JOB 31:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 31:19" />Mayuu d'ayina, meeguu wod'iyaa uraa, woy kallo de'iyaa metootanchchaa demmiyaa wode, <verse eid="JOB 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 31:20" />ta dorssatuwaa ikisiyaappe oosetteedda mayuwaa taani unttuntta ho"etseeddawaappe attin, unttunttukka barenttu polo wozanaan taana galatanenttoppe attin, <verse eid="JOB 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 31:21" />Taani mootuwaan unttuntta shatimmanawaa eraade, aawuu bayinna naanatuwaa naak'k'eeddawaa gidooppe, <verse eid="JOB 31:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 31:22" />ta k'eesii kuriyaappe me"o; ta kushiikka hashiyaappe karetti wod'd'o. <verse eid="JOB 31:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 31:23" />Hewaa taani ootsennawe S'oossaa muroo yayyiyaa dirassanne Aa anggay taana dagantsiyaa dirassa.<verse eid="JOB 31:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 31:24" />«Taani work'k'aan ammanetteedawaa gidintto, Muruta work'k'aakka, ‹Taani neenan c'eek'ettay› gaadditantto, <verse eid="JOB 31:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 31:25" />Ta duretetsaa daruwaan, ta kushii demmeedda wod'iyaan taani nashetaadditantto, <verse eid="JOB 31:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 31:26" />Awaa p'ooletsaa woy aginaa lo"otetsaa be'aade, <verse eid="JOB 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 31:27" />ta wozanaan geeman unttuntta bonchchaadditantto, woy ta kushiyaa piddi ootsa yeraade, unttuntta bonchchaadditantto, <verse eid="JOB 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 31:28" />D'ok'k'an de'iyaa S'oossaa kaddaad shin. He nagaraykka pirddan murissiyaa nagaraa gidee shin.<verse eid="JOB 31:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 31:29" />«Ta morkkatuwaa gakkeedda iita kaac'aan taani nashetabeykke; unttuntta gakkeedda metuwaankka hombboc'abeykke. <verse eid="JOB 31:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 31:30" />‹Ta morkkii d'ayo› yaaga shek'k'aade, nagaraa ootsabeykke. <verse eid="JOB 31:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 31:31" />Taani ubbaa gede imatsaa mokkiyaawaa ta k'oomatuu taw markkattiino. <verse eid="JOB 31:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 31:32" />Sa'ay k'ammeedda asaa karen ayissabeykke; taani ta golliyaa penggiyaa ogiyaanna biyaawoo ubbaw dooyaa wotsaad. <verse eid="JOB 31:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 31:33" />Asay k'osiyaawaadan, taani ta nagaraa ta shop'p'iyaan k'osabeykke. <verse eid="JOB 31:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 31:34" />Taani asaa haasayaade dagamabeykke; unttunttu boriyaw yayaade, taani c'o"u geedda wodiinne kare kesennan aggeeda wodii baawa.<verse eid="JOB 31:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 31:35" />«Taani haasayiyaawaa sisiyaawe de'eerenneeshsha! Taani haasayeeddawe ubbay tuma gidiyaawo taani paramay; Ubbaa Danddayiyaa S'oossay taw zaaruwaa immo. Ta baaligaaray taana mooteedda paylii de'ina, be'aarikkitaashsha! <verse eid="JOB 31:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 31:36" />Woytuwaadan taani ta hashiyaan wotsana shin! Kallachchaadan ta huup'iyaan tookkanashin! <verse eid="JOB 31:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 31:37" />Taani kaappuwaadan aakko shiik'aade, ta ootseeddawaa ubbaa aw odana shin!<verse eid="JOB 31:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOB 31:38" />«Ta goshsha biittay, ‹Taana bonk'k'a akkaada!› giide, ta bolla waasseeddawaa gidooppe, ta yafaratuukka ta bolla yeekkeeddawaa gidooppe, <verse eid="JOB 31:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOB 31:39" />he biittan mokkeedda miishshaa k'ans's'ennaan c'oo meeddawaa gidooppe, woy he biittaa ootsiyaawantta koshaan wod'eeddawaa gidooppe, <verse eid="JOB 31:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOB 31:40" />taw zarggaa diraw aguntsay, banggaa dirawukka sharafay he biittan mokko» yaageedda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 31:40">Iyyooba haasayay hawaan poletteedda.<verse eid="JOB 31:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="JOB 32" />
  <para style="s">Eelihu Haasayee</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="JOB 32:1-37:24">32:1—37:24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 32:1" />Iyyoobi, «Taani s'illo asaa» geedda diraw, ha heezzu asatuu aw zaaruwaa immiyaawaa aggi basheeddino. <verse eid="JOB 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 32:2" />Iyyoobi S'oossaa s'illuwaa giyaawaa aggiide, barena s'illuwaa ootseedda diraw, Raama yara gidiyaa Buuziyaa Barkkeela na'ay Eelihu Iyyooba bolla loytsi hank'k'etteedda. <verse eid="JOB 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 32:3" />Eelihu k'ay Iyyooba heezzu laggetuwaakka hank'k'etteedda; ayaw gooppe, unttunttu Aa c'oo bayzzanchcha geeddinoppe attina, aw suure zaaruwaa zaaranaw danddayibeykkino. <verse eid="JOB 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 32:4" />Eelihu unttunttuppe teefatiyaa diraw, unttunttu ubbay haasayaa wurssana gakkanaw naageedda. <verse eid="JOB 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 32:5" />Ha heezzu asatuu Iyyoobaw gidiyaa zaaruwaa immanaw danddayibeennawaa be'iide, I loytsi hank'k'etteedda.<verse eid="JOB 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 32:6" />Buuziyaa Barkkeela na'ay Eelihu hawaadan yaagiide, haasayaa doommeedda; «Taani laytsan na'atay; hintte taappe c'imiita. Hewaa diraw, taani ta k'ofaa hinttew odanaw yayaad. <verse eid="JOB 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 32:7" />Taani, ‹C'imatuu haasayino; barenttu daro laytsan demmeedda aad'd'eeda eratetsaa tamaarissino› gaade k'oppaad. <verse eid="JOB 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 32:8" />Shin asaakko yiide, aad'd'eeda eratetsaa asaw immiyaawe Ubbaa Danddayiyaa S'oossaa Ayaanaa. <verse eid="JOB 32:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 32:9" />Asaa aad'd'eeda eranchcha kessiyaawe c'imatetsaa gidenna, woy likkebay geliyaawe daro de'eedda asatuwaassa gidenna. <verse eid="JOB 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 32:10" />Hewaa diraw, sisite; taanikka ta k'ofaa hinttew odana.<verse eid="JOB 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 32:11" />«Be'ite, hintte haasayiyaa wode, taani c'o"u gaade hayzzaad; hintte haasayana k'aalaa k'oppaade naagaad. <verse eid="JOB 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 32:12" />Taani hintte giyaawaa ubbaa wurssa sisaad; shin hintteppe ooninne Iyyoobi bayzzanchcha giide ammantsibeenna; k'ay hintteppe ooninne Aa palamaw bessiyaa zaaruwaa immibeenna. <verse eid="JOB 32:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 32:13" />Iyyooba haasayaw kalissiyaa zaaruwaa zaaranawe S'oossaappe attina, asaa gidenna diraw, hintte, ‹Nuuni aad'd'eeda eratetsaa demmeeddo› geenaadan naagettite. <verse eid="JOB 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 32:14" />Iyyoobi palumetteeddawe hinttenanappe attina, taananna gidenna. Taani hintte haasayeeddawaadan aw zaaruwaa immikke.<verse eid="JOB 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 32:15" />«Iyyoobaa, unttunttu dagammiide, ne haasayaw zaaruwaa immanaw danddayibeykkino; unttunttoo haasayiyaawe d'ayeedda. <verse eid="JOB 32:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 32:16" />Unttunttu haasayiyaawaa d'ayiide, c'o"u giide ek'k'ooppe, taanikka naaganaw koshshii? <verse eid="JOB 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 32:17" />Tawukka odiyaawe de'ee; taanikka ta k'ofaa odana. <verse eid="JOB 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 32:18" />Daro haasayiyaawe de'iyaa diraw, ta giddon de'iyaa ayyaanay taana oda giide giddee. <verse eid="JOB 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 32:19" />Be'ite, taw haasayiyaa kaalay imettennawaa gidooppe, taani ho"o woyniyaa eessay kumeedda ogoruwaadan d'uuk'k'ana hanay. <verse eid="JOB 32:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 32:20" />Taw hawaappe guutsaa keekkana mala, taani haasayanaw koshshee; ta doonaakka dooyaade, taani ta zaaruwaa immanaw koshshee. <verse eid="JOB 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 32:21" />Ha yewuwaan taani oonanne maaddikke, woy ay asanne c'oo sabbikke. <verse eid="JOB 32:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 32:22" />Ayaw gooppe, asaa c'oo sabbiyaawe taw mulekka erettenna. Taani k'ay hewaa hanooppe, taana Med'd'eeddawe taana murana.<verse eid="JOB 32:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="JOB 33" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 33:1" />«Iyyoobaa, ha"i taani odiyaawaa sisa; ta giyaawaa ubbaa hayzza. <verse eid="JOB 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 33:2" />Haasayanaw giigaad; ta k'aalatuukka ta ins's'arssaa s'eeran de'iino. <verse eid="JOB 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 33:3" />Ta haasayiyaa k'aalatuu ta wozanaa suuretetsaa k'onc'c'issiino; taani eriyaawaa ta ins's'arssay tumatetsan haasayee. <verse eid="JOB 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 33:4" />Taana S'oossaa Ayyaanay med'd'eedda; Ubbaa Danddayiyaa S'oossaa shemppuu taw de'uwaa immeedda. <verse eid="JOB 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 33:5" />Neeni danddayiyaawaa gidooppe, taw zaaruwaa imma; neena giigissaade, taananna gakketa.<verse eid="JOB 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 33:6" />«Be'a, taani S'oossaa sintsan ne mala; k'ay taanikka urk'k'aappe med'ettaad. <verse eid="JOB 33:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 33:7" />Neeni taw yayyiyaa gaasuu baawa; taani neena naak'k'ikke.<verse eid="JOB 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 33:8" />«Ne haasayaa ubbaa taani hayzzaadde takkaad; neeni hawaadan yaagishin sisaad; <verse eid="JOB 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 33:9" />‹Taani geeshshanne tooshii bayinna asaa; taani s'illuwaanne nagaraa ootsabeenna asaa. <verse eid="JOB 33:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 33:10" />Shin S'oossay taana muranaw gaasuwaa koyee; I taana bare morkkiyaadan paydee. <verse eid="JOB 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 33:11" />Ta gediyaa gediyaa birataan k'achchee;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 13:27">Yob. 13:27</ref></char></note> taani tanggiyaa tangguwaa ubbaakka I wochchee› yaagaadda.<verse eid="JOB 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 33:12" />«Iyyoobaa, neeni ha haasayan likke gidakka! Ane taani new oday; S'oossay asaappe aad'd'ee. <verse eid="JOB 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 33:13" />Neeni, ‹S'oossay taani haasayeedda haasayaw zaaruwaa immenna› gaade, ayaw aanana palumettay? <verse eid="JOB 33:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 33:14" />Asay akeekanappe attina, S'oossay ha duma duma ogiyaan haasayee.<verse eid="JOB 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 33:15" />«Asay k'amma hiis'an gisiide,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 4:13">Yob. 4:13</ref></char></note> gem"ishshuwaa pannuro wode, S'oossay akumuwaaninne sas'aan haasayee. <verse eid="JOB 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 33:16" />He wode Asay sisanaadaan haytsaa dooyee; bare seerankka I unttuntta dagantsee. <verse eid="JOB 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 33:17" />Yaatiide Asay nagaraa ootsennaadan te"ee; otoruwaakka asaappe diggee. <verse eid="JOB 33:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 33:18" />S'oossay asaa bashshaappe ashshee; hayk'uwaappekka naagee.<verse eid="JOB 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 33:19" />«S'oossay asaa sakuwaa hiis'an de'oodekka, bare balaappe simmanaadan seeree. <verse eid="JOB 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 33:20" />Hewaadan haniide, harggeedda uray katsaa is's'ee; daro mal"o k'umaykka Aa sheneyee. <verse eid="JOB 33:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 33:21" />Aa ashuukka gilk'k'iide wuree; Aa bollaykka melina, mek'etsay paydetee. <verse eid="JOB 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 33:22" />Aa shemppatta duufuwaakko, Aa de'uwuukka hayk'k'uwaa kiitanchchatuwaakko mateedda.<verse eid="JOB 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 33:23" />«Asaw suure ogiyaa bessiyaa, sha"an paydetiyaa kiitanchchatuwaappe ittuu aw gaannatanaw yintto, <verse eid="JOB 33:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 33:24" />aw k'arettiide, ‹I duufuwaa gelennaadan Aa ashshana. Taani aw woziyaawaa demmaad› yaagintto, <verse eid="JOB 33:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 33:25" />Aa bollay yalagana; Aa yalagatetsaa wolk'k'aykka aw simmana. <verse eid="JOB 33:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 33:26" />He bitanii S'oossaa woosana; S'oossay Aa woosaa sisana. S'oossay aw Aa s'illotetsaa zaariyaa diraw, I nashshechchan S'oossaw goyinnana. <verse eid="JOB 33:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 33:27" />He wode asaa sintsan I hawaadan yaagana; ‹Taani nagaraa ootsaad; suurebaakka geellayaad; shin S'oossay ta bayzzuwaadan taw c'iggibeenna. <verse eid="JOB 33:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 33:28" />Duufuwan gelennaadan taana ashsheeda; hekko, ha"i pas'a de'aade, poo'uwaa be'ay› yaagana.<verse eid="JOB 33:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 33:29" />«Be'ite, S'oossay asaw hawaa ubbaa zaari zaariide ootsee; <verse eid="JOB 33:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 33:30" />asaa duufuwaan geliyaawaappe ashshee; de'uwaan I nashshettanaadan ootsee.<verse eid="JOB 33:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 33:31" />«Simmi Iyyoobaa, taani odiyaawaa hayzzaadde sisa. Ane neeni c'o"u giina, taani haasayay. <verse eid="JOB 33:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 33:32" />Neeni haasayanaw koyiyaawe de'ooppe, taw haasaya. Taani neeni s'illuwaa gidiyaawaa bessanaw koyay. <verse eid="JOB 33:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 33:33" />Hewe d'ayooppe, c'o"u gaade, taani haasayiyaawaa sisa. Neena taani aad'd'eeda eratetsaa tamaarissana» yaageedda.<verse eid="JOB 33:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="JOB 34" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 34:1" />K'aykka Eelihu hawaadan yaageedda, <verse eid="JOB 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 34:2" />«Hinttenoo, aad'd'eeda eranchchatoo, taani haasayiyaa haasayaa sisite. Hinttenoo, eranchchatoo, hintte haytsaa taakko yeggite. <verse eid="JOB 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 34:3" />Ins's'arssay k'umaa mal"uwaa eriyaawaadan,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 12:11">Yob. 12:11</ref></char></note> haytsaykka yewuwaa shaakkiide eree. <verse eid="JOB 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 34:4" />Ane nuuni likkebaanne lo"obaa shaakkiide eroytte.<verse eid="JOB 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 34:5" />«Iyyoobi, ‹Taani s'illuwaa; shin S'oossay ta suure pirddaa taana diggeedda. <verse eid="JOB 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 34:6" />Taani likke gidaadde, worddanchchaadan paydetaad. Taanan bayzzuu bayinnankka, I taana pas'ennaadan madutseedda› yaageedda.<verse eid="JOB 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 34:7" />«S'oossaa bolla Iyyoobewaadan k'iliic'iyaa Asay de'ii? <verse eid="JOB 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 34:8" />I iitabaa ootsiyaawanttuna zuppetee; nagaranchchatuwaannakka hamettee. <verse eid="JOB 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 34:9" />Ayaw gooppe, I, ‹Asay S'oossaa nashshechchana giide ootsiyaawe ayinne maaddenna› yaagee.<verse eid="JOB 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 34:10" />«Hewaa diraw, hinttenoo, akeekanchcha asatoo, taani odiyaawaa ane sisite! Ubbaa Danddayiyaa S'oossay iitabaa mulekka ootsenna. <verse eid="JOB 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 34:11" />S'oossay asaw Aa oosuwaadan immee; aa ogiyaadan aw c'iggee.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 62:12">Maz. 62:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JOB 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 34:12" />S'oossay tumuwaappe iitabaa ootsenna; Ubbaa Danddayiyaa S'oossay suure pirddaa geellayenna. <verse eid="JOB 34:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 34:13" />Sa'aa bollan S'oossaw maataa immeeddawe oonee? K'ay biittaa ubbaa bolla Aa suntseeddawe oonee? <verse eid="JOB 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 34:14" />S'oossay bare Ayyaanaanne bare de'uwaa shemppuwaa barekko zaariide akkintto, <verse eid="JOB 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 34:15" />ashuwaa mayyeedda ubbay ittippe d'ayana; Asay biittaw duge simmana.<verse eid="JOB 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 34:16" />«Hintte akeekanchcha gidooppe, hawaa sisite; ta haasayiyaawaakka hayzzite. <verse eid="JOB 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 34:17" />Suure pirddaa is's'iyaawe biittaa mooddanaw danddayii? Yaatina, neeni s'illuwaanne wolk'k'aama gidiyaa S'oossaa pirdday? <verse eid="JOB 34:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 34:18" />S'oossay kaatetuwaa, ‹Hintte shufurotuwaa› yaagee; k'ay biittaa mooddiyaawanttakka, ‹Hintte iita› yaagee. <verse eid="JOB 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 34:19" />Kaappatuwaa som"uwaa s'eelliide maaddenna; duriyaakka mank'k'uwaappe aatsiide s'eellenna. Ayaw gooppe, unttunttu ubbaykka Aa oosotuwaa. <verse eid="JOB 34:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 34:20" />Unttunttu hekka bilahe akeekenan hayk'k'ana; Asay ubbaykka kokkoriide d'ayana; wolk'k'aamatuukka ay asaa kushiinne bochchennan kichchana.<verse eid="JOB 34:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 34:21" />«S'oossay asaa hemetaa s'eellee; Aa tangguwaa ubbaakka wochchee. <verse eid="JOB 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 34:22" />Iitaa ootsiyaawantta S'oossaappe gentsanaw danddayiyaa d'ip'p'i go d'umi baawa. <verse eid="JOB 34:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 34:23" />S'oossay asaa bolla pirddanaw, Asay Aa sintsa shiik'anaadan keeruwaa immenna. <verse eid="JOB 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 34:24" />Wolk'k'aamatuwaa ayinne oochchennan mentsereetsee; yaatiide unttunttu sa'aan haratuwaa wotsee. <verse eid="JOB 34:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 34:25" />I unttunttu oosuwaa eriyaa diraw, unttuntta itti k'amma maataappe wotsiide d'ayissee. <verse eid="JOB 34:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 34:26" />Unttunttu iitatetsaa diraw, Asay ubbay be'iyaasan I unttuntta muree. <verse eid="JOB 34:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 34:27" />Unttunttu Aa kaallennaan is's'iide, Aa azazuwaakka aggeeda dirassa. <verse eid="JOB 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 34:28" />Unttunttu hiyyeesatuwaa uk'k'unniide, unttunttu S'oossaakko waassanaadan ootseeddino; ikka hiyyeesatuwaa waasuwaa siseedda. <verse eid="JOB 34:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 34:29" />S'oossay c'o"u gooppe, Aa pirddanawe oonee? I bare som"uwaa wora zaarooppe, asaa maaddiyaawe baawa. I asaappekka c'oraappekka dara. <verse eid="JOB 34:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 34:30" />Hewaadankka, S'oossaw yayyena asatuu mooddenaadaaninne asaassikka gite gidennaadan, Asay ubbay digganaw danddayenna.<verse eid="JOB 34:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 34:31" />«Iyyoobaa, ne nagaraa S'oossaw paas'adii? K'ay zaaraadde nagaraa ootsennaadan geppaadii? <verse eid="JOB 34:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 34:32" />Ne bayzzuwaa new k'onc'c'issana mala, S'oossaa woossaadii? Sintsanaw iita oosuwaa ootsenan agganaw eeno gaaddii?<verse eid="JOB 34:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 34:33" />«Neeni S'oossay ootsiyaawaa is's'aade, ne gatii neeni dosiyaawaadan hananaw koyay? Simmi k'ofaa k'achchanawe neenappe attina, taana gidikke. Hewaa diraw, neeni k'oppiyaawaa taw oda. <verse eid="JOB 34:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 34:34" />Akeekanchcha asatuu taani odiyaawaa eeno giino; taani odiyaawaa sisiyaa aad'd'eeda eranchchatuukka hawaadan yaagiino; <verse eid="JOB 34:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 34:35" />‹Iyyoobe eray pac'c'ina, hawaa haasayee; I haasayiyaawoo biletsaykka baawa› yaagiino. <verse eid="JOB 34:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 34:36" />Iyyoobi iita asatuwaadan zaaruwaa immeedda diraw, wurssetsaa gakkanaw paac'etteedda gideerenneeshsha! <verse eid="JOB 34:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 34:37" />Ayaw gooppe, I bare nagaraa bolla makkalaa gujjee; nu sintsan S'oossaa k'iliic'ee. Bare k'aalaakka darissiide, S'oossaa bolla biddee» yaageedda.<verse eid="JOB 34:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="JOB 35" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 35:1" />Eelihu k'aykka hawaadan yaageedda; <verse eid="JOB 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 35:2" />«Iyyoobaa, neeni, ‹Taani S'oossaa sintsan s'illuwaa› giyaawe likkee? <verse eid="JOB 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 35:3" />K'ay, ‹Taani nagaraa ootsooppe, neena ay k'ohayttaa? Nagaraa ootsennan aggooppe, taani go'ettiyaawe ayee?› yaagaade neeni S'oossaa oochchaadda. <verse eid="JOB 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 35:4" />Taani newunne neenanna ne laggetoo zaaruwaa haasayana.<verse eid="JOB 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 35:5" />«D'ok'k'u gaade salotuwaa s'eella; neeppe bollaanna de'iyaa shaaretuwaakka ane akeekaade be'a. <verse eid="JOB 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 35:6" />Neeni nagaraa ootsooppe, hewe S'oossaa ayinne k'ohenna. Ne bayzzuu darooppekka, neeni S'oossaa ayinne ootsakka.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:6-8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 22:2-3">Yob. 22:2-3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JOB 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 35:7" />S'illuwaa gidooppe, aw neeni ayaa immay? Woy ne kushiyaappe I ayaa akkanee? <verse eid="JOB 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 35:8" />Neeni nagaraa ootsooppe, ne mala asaa k'ohaasa; k'ay s'illooppekka, asaa go"aassa.<verse eid="JOB 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 35:9" />«Uk'k'unnay daroppe Asay waassee; wolk'k'aamatuwaa kushiyaappe kessi akkanaw alluwaa s'eegee. <verse eid="JOB 35:9" /><verse number="10-11" style="v" sid="JOB 35:10-11" />Shin ooninne, ‹S'oossay, taana Med'd'eeddawe, k'amman mazamuriyaa immeeddawe, sa'aa do'atuwaappe aatsiide, nuuna tamaarissiyaawenne saluwaa kafotuwaappe aad'd'eeda eranchcha nuuna ootsiyaawe hak'an de'ii?› yaagenna. <verse eid="JOB 35:10-11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 35:12" />Iita asatuu waassiino; shin S'oossay unttunttu otoruwaa gaasuwaan, unttunttoo allenna. <verse eid="JOB 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 35:13" />Hada waasuwaa S'oossay tumuwaappe sisenna; Ubbaa Danddayiyaa S'oossay hewaa hayzzenna.<verse eid="JOB 35:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 35:14" />«Iyyoobaa, neeni, ‹Taani S'oossaa be'anaw danddaykke; ta mootuu Aa sintsan de'ee; taani Aa naagay› yaagaasa. Yaatina, new I zaaruwaa immanaw, ne gaasuu ay keeshshaa guus's'anddeeshsha! <verse eid="JOB 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 35:15" />S'oossay asaa murenabaanne nagaraakka sheneko giide aggi aggiyaawaa gaade k'oppay? <verse eid="JOB 35:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 35:16" />Hewaa gidooppe, neeni ne doonaa c'oo mela dooyyasa; eray bayinna haasayaa darissaasa» yaageedda.<verse eid="JOB 35:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="JOB 36" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 36:1" />Eelihu gujjiidekka hawaadan yaageedda; <verse eid="JOB 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 36:2" />«S'oossaa doonaa gidaade taani new odiyaawe biro de'iyaa diraw, guutsaa danddayaade sisa. <verse eid="JOB 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 36:3" />Taani ta eraa haakuwaappe ahaad; taana Med'd'eeddawe s'illo pirddaa immiyaawaa gidiyaawaa taani neena erissana. <verse eid="JOB 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 36:4" />Taani wordduwaa haasayikke; kumentsaa eray de'iyaa uray neenanna de'iyaawaa ammana.<verse eid="JOB 36:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 36:5" />«Be'a, S'oossay wolk'k'aama; shin I oonanne kad'enna. I akeekankka mina. <verse eid="JOB 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 36:6" />Iitatuwaa I pas'a wotsenna; shin uk'k'unnetteeddawanttu maataa I naagissee. <verse eid="JOB 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 36:7" />S'oossay bare ayifiyaa s'illotuwaappe dentsenna. I unttuntta kaatetuwaanna utissiide, med'inaw d'ok'k'u d'ok'k'u ootsee. <verse eid="JOB 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 36:8" />Shin Asay sanssalatan k'ashettooppe, woy tuggaa wodoruwaan oyk'k'ettooppe, <verse eid="JOB 36:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 36:9" />I unttunttu oosuwaanne otoruwaan unttunttu ootseedda nagaraa k'onc'c'issee. <verse eid="JOB 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 36:10" />Seeraa sisanaadaan unttunttu haytsaa dooyee; nagaraappe simmanaadankka I unttuntta azazee. <verse eid="JOB 36:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 36:11" />Unttunttu sisiide, aw ootsooppe, barenttu laytsaa ishaluwaaninne woppan wurssana. <verse eid="JOB 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 36:12" />Shin unttunttu sisennan is's'ooppe, mashshaan wurana; unttunttu eraa d'ayeedda diraw hayk'k'ana.<verse eid="JOB 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 36:13" />«S'oossaa ammanenna asatuu barenttu wozanaan hank'k'uwaa dagayiino; I unttuntta muriyaa wodekka, maadda giide woossikkino. <verse eid="JOB 36:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 36:14" />Unttunttu barenttu yalagatetsan hayk'k'iino; unttunttu de'uukka yeellaan wuree. <verse eid="JOB 36:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 36:15" />S'oossay tuggatiyaawantta unttunttu tuggaan tamaarissee; I unttunttu metuwaa baggana unttuntta sissee.<verse eid="JOB 36:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 36:16" />«S'oossay neena metuwaappe kessiide metuu bayinna aako sa'aa afeedda; ne miyaa masoofiyankka mod'd'uwaa guuppeedda. <verse eid="JOB 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 36:17" />Shin ha"i iitatuwaa pirddaa akkaada; bessiyaa muraakka akkaade de'aassa. <verse eid="JOB 36:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 36:18" />Neena ooninne duretetsaa bessiide c'immennaadan, daro mattaayiyankka baletsennaadan naagetta. <verse eid="JOB 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 36:19" />Ne mas'uwaa daruu woy ne minotetsay neena metuwaappe ashshanee? <verse eid="JOB 36:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 36:20" />Asatuu barenttu sa'aappe d'ayiyaa k'ammay yaanaadan amottoppa. <verse eid="JOB 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 36:21" />Ha metuu ubbay neena gakkeeddawe, neena iitaappe ashshanaassa. Hewaa diraw, iitatetsaw guyye simmennaadan neena akeeka.<verse eid="JOB 36:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 36:22" />«S'oossay bare wolk'k'an d'ok'k'u d'ok'k'u geedda! Aa mala asttamaarii oonee? <verse eid="JOB 36:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 36:23" />‹Hawaa ootsa› giide S'oossaa azaziyaa asay, woy, ‹Neeni iita oosuwaa ootsaadda› yaaganaw danddayiyaa Asay baawa. <verse eid="JOB 36:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 36:24" />Asay mazamuriyaan sabbeedda Aa oosuwaa neenikka sabbanaw hassaya. <verse eid="JOB 36:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 36:25" />Asay ubbay S'oossaa oosuwaa be'eedda; shin be'iide, haakuwaan be'eedda. <verse eid="JOB 36:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 36:26" />Be'ite, S'oossay wolk'k'aama! Aa gitatetsaa nuuni akeekibookko; Aa laytsaa c'oratetsaykka paydina gakettenna.<verse eid="JOB 36:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 36:27" />«S'oossay haatsaa sa'aappe pude saluwaa afee; yaan iraa kessee. <verse eid="JOB 36:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 36:28" />He iray shaariyaappe kesiide, asaw daro bukkanaadan ootsee. <verse eid="JOB 36:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 36:29" />Shaarii waan yuuyyintto, walk'k'antsaykka S'oossay de'iyaa saluwaan waan guummintto, ooninne erenna. <verse eid="JOB 36:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 36:30" />I bare yuushshuwaan walk'k'antsaa poo'uwaa laalee; shin abbaa c'iimmaa I d'uman kammee. <verse eid="JOB 36:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 36:31" />Iraa bukissiyaawan bare asaw daro katsaakka mokissee; hawaadan ootsiide S'oossay asaa ubbaa ayissee. <verse eid="JOB 36:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 36:32" />I walk'k'antsaa bare kushiyan oyk'k'ee; bare halchcheedda sa'aa shoc'anaw azazee. <verse eid="JOB 36:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 36:33" />Guuguntsay guummiyaawe uushuu uushottanawaa awaayyee; mehiikka uushuu yiyaawaa eree.<verse eid="JOB 36:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="JOB 37" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 37:1" />«Uushuu ta wozanaa diddik'issee; bare de'iyaa saankka piree. <verse eid="JOB 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 37:2" />Ubbaykka S'oossaa kooshshaa, guuguntsaadan guummiyaa Aa k'aalaa sisite. <verse eid="JOB 37:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 37:3" />I saluwaa ubbaappe kiittiyaa walk'k'antsay biittaa gas'aappe gas'aa gakkanaw beettee. <verse eid="JOB 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 37:4" />Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Aa guntsaa kooshshay sisettee; bare wolk'k'aama kooshshan guummee; Aa kooshshay sisettiyaa wode, bare walk'k'antsaa te"enna. <verse eid="JOB 37:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 37:5" />S'oossaa kooshshay malalissiyaa guntsaa guummee; nuuni akeekanaw danddayenna wolk'k'aamabaa I ootsee. <verse eid="JOB 37:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 37:6" />Shachchaa I, ‹Sa'aan wod'd'a!› yaagee; wolk'k'aama iraakka, ‹Bukka› yaagiide azazee.<verse eid="JOB 37:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 37:7" />«Asay ubbay Aa oosuwaa erana mala, he wode bare oosuwaa oosuwaa agganaadan ootsee. <verse eid="JOB 37:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 37:8" />Do'atuukka barenttu geessuwaa geessuwaa geliino; yaan uttiino. <verse eid="JOB 37:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 37:9" />Gedissa baggappe gotii yee; huup'issa baggappekka meeguu yee. <verse eid="JOB 37:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 37:10" />S'oossay siid'iyaanna shemppiyaa shemppuwaappe shachchay med'ettee; hewan aakko haatsatuukka shuchchaadan minnee. <verse eid="JOB 37:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 37:11" />Shaarii haatsaa tookkanaadan I ootsee; bare walk'k'antsaakka shaariyaa giddon laalee. <verse eid="JOB 37:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 37:12" />Aa kaaletsuwaan shaaretuu yuuyyi yuuyyi aad'd'iino; I azaziyaawaa ubbaa unttunttu sa'aa bolla ootsiino. <verse eid="JOB 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 37:13" />S'oossay iraa bukissiyaawe biittaa irs's'issanaassa, woy asaa muranaassa, woy bare siik'uwaa unttuntta bessanaassa.<verse eid="JOB 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 37:14" />«Iyyoobaa, hawaa sisa; S'oossay ootsiyaa malalissiyaa oosuwaa takki gaade akeeka. <verse eid="JOB 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 37:15" />S'oossay shaaratuwaa wooti azazinttonne bare walk'k'antsaakka wooti walk'k'antsintto eray? <verse eid="JOB 37:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 37:16" />Shaaratuu saluwaan waan tookettooppenne k'ay Aa eray polo gideedda S'oossay ootsiyaa malalissiyaa oosuwaa neeni eray? <verse eid="JOB 37:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 37:17" />Gedissa c'arkkuu yiide, biittaa mishissiyaa wode, neeni hombbiyan metootanaappe attina, mulekka hewaa erakka. <verse eid="JOB 37:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 37:18" />S'oossay saluwaa masttootiyaadan piddi ootsiide mic'c'iyaa wode, neeni Aa maaddanaw danddayay? <verse eid="JOB 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 37:19" />Nuuni eraa pac'a gidiyaa diraw haasayanaw danddayokko; nuuni S'oossaw waagi haasayanentto, neeni nuuna tamaarissa. <verse eid="JOB 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 37:20" />S'oossaanna haasayana gaade taani oochchikke; I taana d'ayissana mala, taani ayaw Aa dentsereetsaytta? <verse eid="JOB 37:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 37:21" />C'arkkuu salotuwaa pittiide geeshsheeddawaappe guyyiyaan, salotuwaan p'ooliyaa aawaa poo'uwaa Asay s'eellanaw danddayenna. <verse eid="JOB 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 37:22" />Huup'issa baggana work'k'aa malatiyaa poo'uu beettee; S'oossaykka yashshiyaa anggan k'onc'c'ee.<verse eid="JOB 37:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 37:23" />«Nuuni Ubbaa Danddayiyaa S'oossaa mata shiik'anaw danddayokko; Aa wolk'k'ay wolk'k'aama. I bare tumu pirddaaninne bare wolk'k'aama s'illotetsan gitaa. <verse eid="JOB 37:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 37:24" />Hewaa diraw, Asay aw yayyee; barentta aad'd'eeda eranchcha giyaawantta ubbatuwaa I s'eelenna» yaageedda.<verse eid="JOB 37:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="JOB 38" />
  <para style="s">Med'inaa Goday Iyyoobaw Immeedda Zaaruwaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="JOB 38:1-41:34">38:1—41:34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 38:1" />Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Med'inaa Goday gotiyaa giddoppe Iyyoobaw hawaadan yaagiide zaareedda; <verse eid="JOB 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 38:2" />«Eri bayinna haasayan ta zoriyaa toochchiyaawe I hawe oonee? <verse eid="JOB 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 38:3" />Ane neeni asaadan ne s'eessaa danc'c'a denddaade, taani oochchiyaawaa taw oda.<verse eid="JOB 38:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 38:4" />«Taani sa'aa med'd'iyaa wode, neeni hak'an de'ay? Ane new akeekay de'ooppe, taw oda. <verse eid="JOB 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 38:5" />Ha sa'ay ay keeshshaa gidanaw bessintto, he k'ofaa k'achcheeddawe oonee? Likkiyaa wodoruwaakka sa'aa bolla yeggeeddawe oonee? Hewaa zaaruwaa ubbaa eray? <verse eid="JOB 38:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 38:6" />Sa'aa tuuk'etuwaa kunddennaadan mintsi oyk'k'eeddawe ayee? Sa'aa baasoo koyiro shuchchaa wotseeddawe oonee? <verse eid="JOB 38:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 38:7" />He gallassi wontta s'oolinttetuu ittippe yes's'eeddawaanne kiitanchchatuu ubbay nashshechchaw ilileeddawaa neeni eray?<verse eid="JOB 38:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 38:8" />«Abbaa haatsay, biittaa gomppaappe d'uuk'k'iide kesiyaa gallassi, Aa penggetuwaa gorddeeddawe oonee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:8-11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 5:22">Erm. 5:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JOB 38:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 38:9" />Abbaa shaariyaa mayzzeeddawe, k'ay d'umankka s'aas'a wotseeddawe taana. <verse eid="JOB 38:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 38:10" />Abbaw aad'd'ena zawaa med'd'eeddawe, Aa penggiyaanne Aa kulbbuwaa sa'aan wotseeddawe taana. <verse eid="JOB 38:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 38:11" />Taani, ‹Hawaa gakka; shin hawaappe aad'd'oppa; ne wolk'k'aama beetaykka hewan ek'k'o› yaagaad.<verse eid="JOB 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 38:12" />«Iyyoobaa, neeni yelettoodeppe away wontta guuraanna kesanaadan azaza eray? <verse eid="JOB 38:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 38:13" />Biittaa gas'aan poo'uwaa bessana malanne iita asatuwaakka unttunttu k'osetteedda saappe k'onc'c'iyaa kessana mala, neeni wontta azaza eray? <verse eid="JOB 38:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 38:14" />Gallassaa poo'uu zoozatuwaanne zanggaaratuwaa dakkoyiide wotseedda mayuu ek'k'eeddawaadan beettanaadan ootsee; k'ay urk'k'aa miishshaa bolla wotseedda maatafaadan geeshshiide bessee. <verse eid="JOB 38:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 38:15" />Iitatuu barenttoo poo'o gi wotseedda d'umay d'ayee; unttunttu makkalaw dentsiyaa kushiikka me"ee.<verse eid="JOB 38:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 38:16" />«C'iimma abbaa giddo gelaade, pulttuwaa be'aaddi? Woy Asay gakki erenna abbaa gidduwaa paac'c'a s'eella eray? <verse eid="JOB 38:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 38:17" />Hayk'uwaa penggetuwaa neena oonentto besseedee? Woy d'ip'p'i go d'umaa penggetuwaa be'aaddi? <verse eid="JOB 38:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 38:18" />Sa'ay ay keeshshaa wolk'k'aamentto eray? Hewaa ubbaa neeni eriyaawaa gidooppe, taw oda.<verse eid="JOB 38:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 38:19" />«Poo'uu de'iyaasaa afiyaa ogii hak'an de'ii? K'ay d'umay de'iyaa sa'ay hak'ee? <verse eid="JOB 38:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 38:20" />Unttuntta neeni unttunttu golle golle afanaw danddayay? Unttunttu de'iyaasaa afiyaa ogetuwaa neeni eray? <verse eid="JOB 38:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 38:21" />Neeni sa'ay med'ettiyaa wode yeletteedda dirawunne daro laytsaakka de'eedda diraw, hewaa erennan aggakka!<verse eid="JOB 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 38:22" />«Suuppa shachchay minjjettiyaasaa gelaaddii? Orddo shachchay dooretteeddasaakka be'aaddi? <verse eid="JOB 38:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 38:23" />Taani unttuntta meto wodiyaw, olaa wodiyaawunne tooraa gallassaw minjja wotsaad. <verse eid="JOB 38:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 38:24" />Walk'k'antsay kesiyaa sa'aa afiyaa ogii hak'an de'ii? Woy away wulliyaa bagga c'arkkuu hak'appe kesiide c'arkkii?<verse eid="JOB 38:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 38:25" />«Wolk'k'aama iray wod'd'iyaa loossuwaa giigisseeddawe, guuguntsaw ogiyaa kesseeddawe oonee? <verse eid="JOB 38:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 38:26" />Asi de'enna bazzuwaan iraa bukissiyaawe oonee? <verse eid="JOB 38:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 38:27" />Mela bazzuu iraa haatsaan shuggiide, l"o maataa mokkanaadan ootseeddawe oonee?<verse eid="JOB 38:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 38:28" />«Iraw woy ketterssaw aawuu de'ii? <verse eid="JOB 38:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 38:29" />Orddo shachchawunne burc'c'e shachchaw aata de'ay? <verse eid="JOB 38:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 38:30" />Daro iris's'atetsay haatsaa shuchchaadan minisee; abbaa haatsaw bolla baggaakka shachchaa kessee.<verse eid="JOB 38:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 38:31" />«Piliyaadisa geetettiyaa s'oolinttetuwaa c'itaa ittippe gatsaade k'achchanaw danddayay?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 9:9">Yob. 9:9</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 5:8">Amo. 5:8</ref></char></note> Ooriyoona geetettiyaa s'oolinttetuwaa c'itay k'ashetteedda wodoruwaa billanaw danddayay? <verse eid="JOB 38:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 38:32" />C'itan c'itan de'iyaa s'oolinttetuwaa unttunttu wodiyaan wodiyaan kessanaw danddayay? Wogga Beeriyaanne K'eeri Beeriyaa geetettiyaa s'oolinttetuwaa c'itatuwaa ittippe kaaletsanaw danddayay? <verse eid="JOB 38:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 38:33" />Salotuu ak'iyaa higgiyaa neeni eray? Woy he higgii sa'aan mooddanaadan ootsanaw danddayay?<verse eid="JOB 38:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 38:34" />«Di'uu neena muukkanaadan iraa bukissanaw, ne k'aalaa d'ok'k'u ootsaade, shaaratuwaa azazayi? <verse eid="JOB 38:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 38:35" />Walk'k'antsatuu biide yiide, ‹Hekko, ha"i ay ootsiino› gaana mala, neeni unttuntta azazanaw danddayay? <verse eid="JOB 38:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 38:36" />Haatsaa kafoo aad'd'eeda eraa, kuttuwaa awuriyawukka akeekaa immeeddawe oonee? <verse eid="JOB 38:36" /><verse number="37-38" style="v" sid="JOB 38:37-38" />Bare eran shaaretuwaa paydanaw danddayiyaawe oonee? Baanaa munak'k'iide, urk'k'aa kessiide, minisanaw saluwaa shaaretuwaa gede ootsiide, haatsaa duge tigiyaawe oonee?<verse eid="JOB 38:37-38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39-40" style="v" sid="JOB 38:39-40" />«Gaammotuu ubbay barenttu geessuwaan geessuwaan gisi de'ishshin woy zuggiide naagishin, neeni unttunttoo miyaawaa shankkataade immanaw danddayay? Woy koshatti utteedda unttunttu maratuwaa kalissanaw danddayay? <verse eid="JOB 38:39-40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOB 38:41" />K'uurotuu koshatti bichchaariya wode, unttunttu maratuukka miyaawaa demmanaw taw, S'oossaw, waassiyaa wode, unttunttoo miyaawaa immiyaawe oonee?<verse eid="JOB 38:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="JOB 39" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 39:1" />«Deriyan de'iyaa gen"etuu awude yeliinontto, neeni eray? Gaaratuu bannikkiide, barenttu maratuwaa yeliyaa wode be'aaddi? <verse eid="JOB 39:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 39:2" />Unttunttu kuntsiidde, woyissa keeshshaa aginaa gam"iinonttonne k'ay awude yeliinontto eray? <verse eid="JOB 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 39:3" />Unttunttu gulbbatiide, barenttu maratuwaa yeliyaawe awudentto eray? <verse eid="JOB 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 39:4" />Unttunttu maratuu bazzuwaan dic'c'iide minniino; barenttu aayetuwaa mataappe biino; laa"entso guyye simmikkino.<verse eid="JOB 39:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 39:5" />«Dembbaa haretuu yeda de'anaadan ootseeddawe oonee? K'ashuwaappe unttuntta billi yeddeeddawe oonee? <verse eid="JOB 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 39:6" />Unttunttoo taani bazzuwaa de'iyaasaa ootsaade immaad; Asay baynna ladda biittaa unttunttu de'anaadan ootsaad. <verse eid="JOB 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 39:7" />Katamaa c'abbuwaappe unttunttu haakkiide de'iino; laaggiyaawanttu waasuwaakka sissikkino. <verse eid="JOB 39:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 39:8" />Unttunttu deretuwaa barenttoo heemettiyaa sa'aa ootsiino; hewan miyaa mul"o maataa k'oriino.<verse eid="JOB 39:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 39:9" />«Mentsay new ootsanaw eeno ganddee? Woy ne gaas'aatan k'ammaa ak'anddee? <verse eid="JOB 39:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 39:10" />Goshana mala, neeni Aa waas'ay? Woy ginddaa goochchanaadan Aa ootsanaw danddayay? <verse eid="JOB 39:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 39:11" />Neeni Aa wolk'k'aa minotetsan ammanettay? Ne daaburssiyaa oosuwaa I ootsanaadan, aw yegga aggay? <verse eid="JOB 39:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 39:12" />I simmiide yiide, ne katsaa k'os's'iyaa ne uddumaw shiishshee gaade neeni an ammanettay?<verse eid="JOB 39:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 39:13" />«Sogonata bare k'efiyaa ellekka k'aatsaw; shin sogonati k'efetuu sanggaanuwaa k'efetuwaanne baalletuwaa mala gidikkino. <verse eid="JOB 39:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 39:14" />Sogonata bare k'uuk'ulliyaa biittan k'uuk'ullaw; baanay ho'etsanaadan aggaw. <verse eid="JOB 39:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 39:15" />Gedii mentsana woy, ‹Bazzuwaa do'atuu yed'd'ana› gaade k'oppukku. <verse eid="JOB 39:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 39:16" />Maratuu barewaa gidennawaadan paydaadde, unttunttoo mek'etsaa iitaw. I daaburay ubbay mela attiyaawe iw ayaanne malatenna. <verse eid="JOB 39:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 39:17" />Ayaw gooppe, taani S'oossay izo aad'd'eeda eratetsaa diggaad; taani akeekaakka iw immabeykke. <verse eid="JOB 39:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 39:18" />Shin denddaade iza wos's'iyaa wode, barenanna naasettiyaa paraa bollanne paraw bolla miic'c'aw.<verse eid="JOB 39:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 39:19" />«Iyyoobaa, paratoo wolk'k'aa immeeddawe, woy paratuwaa morggiyaa gotosho gammaa mayzzeeddawe neenee? <verse eid="JOB 39:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 39:20" />Paratuu booliyaadan guppanaadaaninne yashshiyaa daaretsaa unttunttu daaranaadan ootseeddawe neenee? <verse eid="JOB 39:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 39:21" />Paratuu zanggaaraan biittaa booddiino; barenttu wolk'k'ankka nashettiino; yaatiide olaa miishshatuwaa danc'c'eeddawanttuna gakketanaw olaa dembbaa piriis'iino. <verse eid="JOB 39:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 39:22" />Yashshaa giyaawaa unttunttu mulekka erikkino; unttuntta ayaynne dagantsenna; unttunttu bolla mashshaa zaaretsooppenne guyye simmikkino. <verse eid="JOB 39:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 39:23" />Unttunttu toggiyaa olanchchatuu oyk'k'eedda olaa miishshatuu p'ooliidde, ittuu ittuwaanna gakketiide giirettiino. <verse eid="JOB 39:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 39:24" />Paratuu paachchuriidde yashissiidde, olaw sintsaw piriis'iino. Malakataa punusaa kooshshaa sisiyaa wode, c'o"u giide ek'k'anaw danddaykkino; <verse eid="JOB 39:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 39:25" />malakataa punniyaa wode, ‹Hayyashsho!› yaagiino. Olaa peenuwaa haakuwaan akkiino; olaa gadaawatuu azaziyaa azazuwaanne olanchchatuwaa c'eek'uwaa sisiino.<verse eid="JOB 39:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 39:26" />«Gac'ii bare k'efiyaa gedissa mic'c'iide paallanaw danddayanaadan, aad'd'eeda eratetsaa aw immeeddawe neenee? <verse eid="JOB 39:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 39:27" />Arggantsay pude kesiide, bare golliyaa d'ok'k'a deretuwaan kees's'anaw ne azazuwaa naagii? <verse eid="JOB 39:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 39:28" />Arggantsay aafuwaa doonaan bare golliyaa kees's'iide de'ee; zaallatuwaa za'otuukka aw geessuwaa gideeddino. <verse eid="JOB 39:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 39:29" />Hewan uttiide, barew miyaawaa wochchee; Aa ayifii haakuwaappe demmee. <verse eid="JOB 39:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 39:30" />Arggantsaa maratuu suutsaa ushiino; bakkutay de'iyaa saan hak'ankka I shiik'ee» yaageedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:28">Mat. 24:28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:37">Luk'. 17:37</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOB 39:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="JOB 40" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 40:1" />Med'inaa Goday Iyyooba, <verse eid="JOB 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 40:2" />«Iyyoobaa, Asay Ubbaa Danddayiyaa S'oossaanna mootettiide, shatimmi erii? Ane S'oossaanna mootettiyaa uray aw zaaro» yaageedda.<verse eid="JOB 40:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iyyooba Zaaruwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 40:3" />Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Iyyoobi Med'inaa Godaw zaariide, hawaadan yaageedda; <verse eid="JOB 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 40:4" />«Abeet S'oossaw, taani patsenna laafa asaa; taani new woota zaaranaw danddayayitaa? Taani ta doonaan ta kushiyaa wotsaad. <verse eid="JOB 40:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 40:5" />Taani itti gede haasayaad; shin taw zaariyaawe baawa. Laa"entsuwaa haasayikke» yaageedda.<verse eid="JOB 40:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">S'oossay K'aykka Haasayee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 40:6" />Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Med'inaa Goday gotiyaa giddoppe Iyyoobaw hawaadan yaageedda; <verse eid="JOB 40:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 40:7" />«Attuma asaadan ne s'eessaa danc'c'a denddaade, taani oochchiyaawaa taw oda. <verse eid="JOB 40:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 40:8" />Neeni taana bayzzanchcha kessana hanay? New s'illuwaa gidanaw, taana wordduwaa kessay? <verse eid="JOB 40:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 40:9" />S'oossaa wolk'k'aa mala wolk'k'ay new de'ii? S'oossay guummiyaawaadan neeni guummanaw danddayay? <verse eid="JOB 40:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 40:10" />Hewaa gidooppe, ane ne bonchchuwaaninne gitatetsan dendda! Ne puulaanne anggaa mayya! <verse eid="JOB 40:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 40:11" />Ne hank'k'uwaa boshaa ane tiga; otorettiyaa asaa ubbaa s'eellaade, ane kawushsha! <verse eid="JOB 40:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 40:12" />Ane loytsa s'eellaade, otorettiyaa ubbaa yeellaya; iitaa ootsiyaawantta ubbaa unttunttu de'iyaa saan yed'd'a! <verse eid="JOB 40:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 40:13" />Unttunttu ubbaa biittan mooga; duufuwaa duge wotsaade, unttuntta gordda. <verse eid="JOB 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 40:14" />Yaatooppe, ne wolk'k'an neeni s'oonanawaa taani new markkattana.<verse eid="JOB 40:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 40:15" />«Taani neena med'd'eeddawaadan med'd'eedda, Bihemoota giyaa do'aa ane s'eella! I booraadan maataa mee. <verse eid="JOB 40:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 40:16" />Aa s'eessan de'iyaa wolk'k'aynne Aa uluwaa kammeedda shayaa minotetsay loytsi daro. <verse eid="JOB 40:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 40:17" />Aa dufii zigaadan sitti gi utteedda; Aa gediyaa s'ap'otuukka minuwaan dook'eteeddawantta. <verse eid="JOB 40:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 40:18" />Aa mek'etsatuu naasiyaa bombbaa mala; Aa gediikka birataa zanggetuwaa mala.<verse eid="JOB 40:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 40:19" />«S'oossay med'd'eedda med'etatuu ubbaappe I aad'd'i malalissiyaawaa. Aa Med'd'eeddawaappe attina, Aa s'oonanaw danddayiyaawe baawa. <verse eid="JOB 40:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 40:20" />Do'ay ubbay kaa'iyaa zoozii aw miyaawaa mokissee. <verse eid="JOB 40:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 40:21" />Aguntsay de'iyaa mitsaa garssan gisee; mak'k'aa giddon c'ariyaan k'osettee. <verse eid="JOB 40:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 40:22" />Aguntsay de'iyaa mitsatuu barenttu kuwan Aa gentsiino; shaafaa doonaan doliyaa mitsatuu Aa kammiino. <verse eid="JOB 40:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 40:23" />Shaafay kumiide goggiyaa wodekka dagammenna; Yorddaanoosa Shaafay Aa som"uwaan d'arc'c'ettiyaa wodekka I saro de'ee. <verse eid="JOB 40:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 40:24" />Aa ayifiyaa toyissiide, Aa oyk'k'anaw danddayiyaa Asay de'ii? Aa siid'iyaakka p'iriyaa k'aran c'addi oyk'k'anaw danddayiyaawe oonee?<verse eid="JOB 40:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="JOB 41" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 41:1" />«Neeni Leewaataanna giyaa dawiyaa moliyaa oyk'k'iyaa mans's'ak'uwaan oyk'k'anaw, woy Aa ins's'arssaa wodoruwaan k'achchanaw danddayay?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 74:14">Maz. 74:14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 104:26">104:26</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 27:1">Isa. 27:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JOB 41:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 41:2" />Aa siid'iyaan dafuwaa gelissanaw danddayay? Woy Aa gac'uwaa mans's'ak'uwaan c'addaade oyk'k'ay? <verse eid="JOB 41:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 41:3" />I neena, ‹Hayyanaa taana yeddaarikkii› yaagiide woossanee? Woy I new mal"o k'aalan haasayanee? <verse eid="JOB 41:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 41:4" />Neeni Aa med'inaw ne k'ooma ootsanaw, I neenanna c'aak'uwaa c'aak'k'etannee? <verse eid="JOB 41:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 41:5" />Asay kafuwaanna kaa'iyaawaadan, neeni aanana kaa'ay? Woy Aa k'achchaade, ne mac'c'a k'oomatoo kaa'anaadan immay? <verse eid="JOB 41:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 41:6" />Moliyaa oyk'k'iyaawanttu Aa gatiyaan palumettiino? Woy zal"anchchatuu Aa k'ans's'ereetsiide zal"iino? <verse eid="JOB 41:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 41:7" />Neeni Aa galbbaa mac'c'aamiyan, Aa huup'iyaakka goman c'addaade k'ohanaw danddayay? <verse eid="JOB 41:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 41:8" />Ane Aa ne kushiyan bochcha; neeni aanana baas'eteedda baas'iyaa hassayaade, laa"entsaade aanana baas'etanaw kajjeelakka!<verse eid="JOB 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 41:9" />«He dawiyaa oyk'k'anaw kajjeeliyaawe mela; haray attina, Aa be'eedda ubbaykka yashshaw kokkoree. <verse eid="JOB 41:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 41:10" />I giseeddasaappe Aa dentsetsanaw ooninne s'alenna; yaatina, ta sintsan ek'k'anaw danddayiyaawe oonee? <verse eid="JOB 41:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 41:11" />Zaara imma gaanaw, taw koyiro immeeddawe oonee? Saluwaappe garssaana de'iyaabay ubbay tawaa.<verse eid="JOB 41:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 41:12" />«Leewaataana gedetuwaabaa, Aa wolk'k'aama wolk'k'aabaanne Aa lo"iyaa bollaabaa haasayiyaawaa taani aggikke. <verse eid="JOB 41:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 41:13" />Aa galbbaa k'aaranaw danddayiyaawe oonee? Aa doonaa bis'aalana danddayiyaawe oonee? <verse eid="JOB 41:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 41:14" />Yashshiyaa achchay de'iyaa Aa goggoc'c'uwaa pook'k'anaw danddayiyaawe oonee? <verse eid="JOB 41:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 41:15" />Aa zokkiyaa galbbay ittuu ittuwaa bollan dooretteeddanne shuchchaadan minneedda gonddalletuwaa malatee. <verse eid="JOB 41:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 41:16" />Unttunttu ittuu ittoo loytsi matatteedda diraw, unttunttu gidduwaanna, haray atto, c'arkkuukka aad'd'anaw danddayenna. <verse eid="JOB 41:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 41:17" />Unttunttu ubbaykka ittuu ittuwaanna gakketti utteedda diraw, unttuntta ayaynne shaakkenna.<verse eid="JOB 41:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 41:18" />«I hed'd'ishiyaa wode, p'olk'k'u giyaa poo'uu kesee; Aa ayifetuukka wontta s'alk'k'iyaadan zo"iino. <verse eid="JOB 41:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 41:19" />Aa doonaappe tamaa lac'uu kesee; tamaykka piriide wod'd'ee. <verse eid="JOB 41:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 41:20" />Penttiyaa disttiyaappe garssa baggana ees's'iyaa mak'k'aappe kesiyaa c'uwaadan, Aa siid'iyaappe c'uway kesee. <verse eid="JOB 41:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 41:21" />Aa siid'iyaanna kesiyaa shemppuu s'iis'untsaa bonk'k'issee; tamaa lac'uukka Aa doonaappe kesee.<verse eid="JOB 41:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 41:22" />«Aa morggiyaan wolk'k'ay de'iyaa diraw, I loytsi yashshiyaawaa. <verse eid="JOB 41:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 41:23" />Aa ashuu ittippe nuketti utteedda diraw, Aa bollay birataadan minnee. <verse eid="JOB 41:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 41:24" />Aa wozanay shuchchaadan mina; gaac'c'iyaa wos'aadankka mina. <verse eid="JOB 41:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 41:25" />I denddiyaa wode, minotuukka yayyiino; unttunttu dagammiide bak'atiino. <verse eid="JOB 41:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 41:26" />Aakko gakkiyaa mashshay ayinne allaalle kessenna; tooray, woy aday, woy gomay Aa ayinne ootsenna. <verse eid="JOB 41:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 41:27" />Birataa I dalaadan, nahaasiyaakka museedda mitsaadan paydee. <verse eid="JOB 41:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 41:28" />Wonddaafiyaa aday Aa bak'atissena; yambbarshshan oliyaa shuchchaykka aw suullaa mala. <verse eid="JOB 41:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 41:29" />Dullay aw itti buus'a mala; tooraa s'onggiyaa wode, k'iliic'iide miic'c'ee. <verse eid="JOB 41:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 41:30" />Aa uluwaa bollan de'iyaa galbbay me"eretteedda kon"aadan k'ara; urk'k'aanna I biyaa wode, maarashaadan biittaa p'alk'k'ee.<verse eid="JOB 41:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 41:31" />«Abbaa pentteedda haatsaadan bukkee; s'aaruwaa giddon penttiyaa zayitiyaadankka bulibulissee. <verse eid="JOB 41:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 41:32" />Bareppe guyyenna p'ooliyaa ogiyaa kessee; abbaa haatsaakka bootsa hoommoo laammee. <verse eid="JOB 41:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 41:33" />Biittaa bollan Aa mala med'eti baawa; I yayyi erenna med'etaa. <verse eid="JOB 41:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 41:34" />Loytsi wolk'k'aama gideedda med'etatuwaa ubbaa I zik'k'i ootsiide s'eellee; do'aa ubbatoo I kaate» yaageedda.<verse eid="JOB 41:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="JOB 42" />
  <para style="s">Iyyoobe Anjjuwaa Zaari Demussaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="JOB 42:1-17">42:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 42:1" />Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Iyyoobi Med'inaa Godaw hawaadan yaagiide zaareedda; <verse eid="JOB 42:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 42:2" />«Neeni ubbabaa ootsanaw danddayiyaawaanne ne halchchuwaakka digganaw danddayiyaawe bayinnawaa taani eray. <verse eid="JOB 42:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 42:3" />‹Laa ha eray bayinnan ta zoriyaa gentsiyaawe oonee?› yaagaade taana oochchaadda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 38:2">Yob. 38:2</ref></char></note> Tumuppe taani taw gelibeennabaa haasayaad; ta eraappe haakkeedda malalissiyaabaa haasayaad.<verse eid="JOB 42:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 42:4" />«Neeni taana, ‹Taani odiyaa wode hayzza;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 38:3">Yob. 38:3</ref></char></note> taani oochchiyaa wode oda› yaagaadda.<verse eid="JOB 42:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 42:5" />«Taani kase nebaa ta haytsaan sisaad; shin ha"i ta ayifiyaan neena be'aad. <verse eid="JOB 42:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 42:6" />Hewaa diraw, taani haasayeeddawe taana yeellayeedda. Taani bidintsaaninne baanan uttaade paas'ay» yaageedda.<verse eid="JOB 42:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 42:7" />Med'inaa Goday hawaa Iyyoobaw haasayeeddawaappe guyyiyaan, Temaanappe yeedda Elifaaza hawaadan yaageedda; «Ta k'oomaa Iyyoobewaadan, hintte tawaa likke haasayibeenna diraw, ne bollanne ne laa"u laggetuwaa bolla ta hank'k'uu ees's'i keseedda. <verse eid="JOB 42:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 42:8" />Hewaa diraw, ha"i laappun korumatuwaanne laappun dorssaa orggetuwaa akkiide, ta k'oomaa Iyyoobakko biite; s'uuggiyaa yarshshuwaa hintte bayzzoo yarshshite. Ta k'oomay Iyyoobi hinttew woosana; taanikka Aa woosaa sisaade, hintte bayzzuwaadan murikke. Hintte ta k'oomaa Iyyoobewaadan tabaa likke haasayibeykkita» yaageedda.<verse eid="JOB 42:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 42:9" />Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Temaanappe yeedda Elifaazi, Shuuhappe yeedda Bilddaadinne Naa'imappe yeedda S'oofaari biide, Med'inaa Goday unttuntta azazeeddawaadan ootseeddino. Med'inaa Godaykka Iyyooba woosaa siseedda.<verse eid="JOB 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Med'inaa Goday Iyyoobaw Dakkuwaa Zaaree</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 42:10" />Iyyoobi bare laggetoo woosseeddawaappe guyyiyaan, Med'inaa Goday aw zaariide ishalisseedda; aw kasewaa diraw laa"u kushiyaa ootsiide immeedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 1:1-3">Yob. 1:1-3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JOB 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 42:11" />Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Aa ishatuu, Aa michchetuunne kase Aa eriyaawanttu ubbatuu aakko yeeddino; Aa son aanana gibiraa meeddino. Aw kayyottiide, Med'inaa Goday Aa bolla aheedda meto ubbaappe Aa mintsetseeddino. K'ay ubbaykka aw work'k'aa migiduwaanne biraa immeeddino.<verse eid="JOB 42:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 42:12" />Med'inaa Goday Iyyooba wurssetsa laytsaa koyiro laytsaappe aatsiide anjjeedda. Iyyoobaw tammanne oyddu sha"u dorssatuu, usuppun sha"u gaalotuu, itti sha"u waatsa booratunne itti sha"u mac'c'a haretuu de'iino. <verse eid="JOB 42:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 42:13" />K'ay aw laappun attuma naanatuunne heezzu mac'c'a naanatuu yeletteeddino. <verse eid="JOB 42:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 42:14" />Bayira mac'c'a naatto Yimiimo, laa"entsiyaanna K'as'ii'o, heezzentsiyaana K'erenihafuuko yaagiide suntseedda. <verse eid="JOB 42:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 42:15" />Iyyooba mac'c'a naanatuwaadan malaa lo"o mac'c'a Asay biittan sa'aan hak'aninne beettena. Unttunttu aawuu unttunttoo unttunttu ishatuwaana laattiyaa biittaa shaakkiide immeedda.<verse eid="JOB 42:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iyyooba Hayk'uwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 42:16" />Hewaappe simmina, Iyyoobi s'eetanne oytamu laytsaa de'eedda; bare naanatuwaanne bare naanatuwaa naanatuwaa oyddentso yeletaa gakkanaw be'eedda. <verse eid="JOB 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 42:17" />Iyyoobi daro wodiyaa de'iide, lo"o c'imaa c'imiide hayk'k'eedda.<verse eid="JOB 42:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 42" />
</usx>